<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zab</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli ni kuilumba kwa nyila na nhambiko. Kwa ulonzi wa Chiebulaniya fambulo da zabuli ni “wila wa nholwa.” Zabuli nyingi ni nyila zozimtogoza Mulungu, mbali iviya kuna zabuli zimwenga. Zimwenga mbuli za kupula kutazigwa na Mulungu, zimwenga zolagusa kulila na usungu mkulu uli muna imizoyo ya wanhu. Kuna nyila zozimtogoza mfalume wa Isilaili, iviya kuna nyila zozisang'haniligwa kuwafunza wanhu ubala na kumulonda Mulungu na mbuli zimwenga. Chitabu cha Zabuli chandikigwa na wanhu wengi na kwikigwa hamwe kwa miyaka mingi. Zabuli zili za mwaka ng'hani zandikigwa chipindi cha Mfalume Daudi. Wasomi wohuwila kuwa zabuli nyingi zandikigwa na mfalume Daudi mwenyewo. Zabuli zimwenga zandikigwa wanhu viwabwelile kuna zikaye zawo kulawa kuna uuhami wa Babeli. Wasomi wasomile ng'hani ilimu ya Bibiliya wohuwila kuwa kulumbilizigwa hamwe kwa zabuli kufika muundo wake wa sambi muna ichipindi cha hagati ya kaline ya 3 na ya 4 KK. Muundo uno wa kuuhelelo umema zabuli 150 zoziigolile muna ivitabu vidoododo vitano.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bila kugesa zabuli zilondeka ni nyila hebu nhambiko, zabuli zose zandikigwa kwa mtindo wa shaili. Muladi munhu yavimanye fambulo dili muna itenzi ya shaili ya zabuli, izakuwa mbuli itaza kuumanya chidogo mtindo wa wandikaji wa mashaili ya Chiebulaniya. Chipengele chimwenga muna zizabuli za Chiebulaniya chotangigwa misitali yoipapa kweli ili sambamba. Miyanza mingi wandikaji walumbiliza hamwe misitali midi ya zabuli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Zabuli ni chimwe mwa vitabu va Bibiliya vimanyika na kudeng'heleligwa ng'hani. Zabuli nyingi zisang'haniligwa kuna ukutambika kuna Ikaye ya Mulungu uko Yelusalemu. Zabuli zochifunza voilondeka kupula na kumtogoza Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani. Zabuli ya 23 iwaguma moyo ng'hani wanhu wengi wakalile na usungu. Zabuli ya 51 iwawangiliza wanhu wengi kulonga uhasanyi wawo kwa Mulungu. Zabuli ya 110 yoguma moyo na huwilo kwa kumgong'onda Mkombola yokwiza, yondayawe mfalume na mkulu wa nhambiko.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili muna ichitabu cha Zabuli</para>
  <para style="io">1. Chitabu cha mwanduso cha Zabuli ni sula 1-41.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Chitabu chekaidi cha Zabuli ni sula 42-72.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Chitabu cheketatu cha Zabuli ni sula 73-89.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Chitabu chekane cha Zabuli ni sula 90-106.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Chitabu chetano cha Zabuli ni sula 107-150.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cha mwanduso</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 1-41">Zabuli 1-41</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Kamweda munhu ija hasondelela ugenzi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">hebu kwima muna inzila ya wahasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">hebu kuihanganya hanhu howokala wakewezi.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Mbali koyadeng'helela malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">na koyagesa malagilizo yake imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Munhu iyo kalinga fana viya mbiki wouhandigwe mumgwazogwazo wa lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">woukwima matunda kwa lusita lwake na mayani yake hayanyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Chila choyotenda chokala goya.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile haweli ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">wawo walinga fana makang'ha yohembelusigwa na mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Ivo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezatogoleligwa kwima lusita lwa kuhumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">wahasanyi hawezakala na bumbila da wanogile haulongozi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu koimanya nzila ya munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile haulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">mbali nzila za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zowagala kuna iifa.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Habali wanhu wa zisi zimwenga woitogolela kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">na wanhu woilunga kutenda mbuli za ubozi?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Wafalume wa zisi zose woisasala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na watawala woiting'hana kuitogolela hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">kusonhela mbuli zihile kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na yoyamsagule kuwa mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Wolonga, “Chiisegeze muna utawala wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">na chizidumule nzabi zawo.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Mndewa yotawala kuchanyha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">kowaseka na kowazeha.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Kowakalikila kwa ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na kowadumbiza kwa kwihilwa kwake, kolonga,<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />“Nimwika mfalume wangu uchanyha ya mulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">uchanyha ya mulima wangu welile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Nizagong'onda lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">“Weye iyo mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">diyelo niwa tati yako.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Nipule, nizakwing'ha zisi za wanhu wamwenga kuwa uhazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">na zisi zose kuwa zako.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Kwizawahonda kwa fimbo ya zuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">na kwizawatula fana vizae va nongo!”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Lelo mweye wafalume, muwe na ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">mweye watawala wa zisi muzumike.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Msang'hanileni Mndewa Mulungu kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">na mtambikileni Mulungu kwa kugudemeka.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Mtumbalileni mavindi mwanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">muladi Mulungu sekeyamuwoneleni ludoko na kumnangani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">kwaviya kowona ludoko himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Wamweda wanhu wokimbilila kukala goya kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukalizigwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi yosonhela lusita viyamkimbile mwanage Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, lola wehi wangu viweli wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">wanhu wengi ng'hani wonilema.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Wanhu wengi wonilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">“Hezatazigwa na Mulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo ngao yangu chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">kunihishimu na kunitenda niwe galu.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Kwa dizi kulu nimulamba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">nayo kanidika kulawa muna uukazi wake welile kuna umulima wa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Nitambalala na nipata nhongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">nilamka kaidi, kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu konitaza.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Siwadumba wanhu maelufu longo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">wonizunguluka kunitowa chila ubanzi.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, winuke!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Weye Mulungu wangu, unikombole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Ubene saya za wehi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">ubene meno ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kowalopola wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">uwatemele mate wanhu wako!<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s">Muhuwile Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa via va nyila vili na lusingija</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Unidike Mulungu youtenda voilondeka, unidike vonikutanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Unilopole vonikuwa muna uuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">uniwonele ubazi na uhulike viya vonikupula.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Vino mweye mwizalema kudihishimu zina jangu mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Molonda vinhu va ubozi na kulonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kamsagula munhu mwaminika yawe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Mndewa Mulungu kohulika viya vonimpula.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Mugudemeke kwa kudumba na sekemutende uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">gelegezeni muna yamakomwa yenu na munyamale hupi.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Mulavileni Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko zozilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">na mumuhuwile yeye.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Wanhu wengi wouza, “Yelihi yondayachitendele mbuli zinogile?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uchiwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Kumemeza moyo wangu deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">kufosa viuwamemeze weli na divai na ndiya nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Notambalala na nopata nhongo vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwaviya novimanya weye Mndewa Mulungu kwizanilola goya.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu yachikalize kwa ichimu cha wehi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa chilongelonge</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, tegeleza mbuli zangu vinipula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">Uhulike goya viniiyalala.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Utegeleze goya vonilila, weye mfalume wangu na Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">kwaviya nokupula weye.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Mndewa Mulungu imitondo kohulika dizi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">imitondo nokupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">maabaho nogozela unidike.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Weye siyo Mulungu yotogola wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">wihi haudaha kukala kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Wanhu weli na magoda hawezadaha kwima haulongozi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">Weye kowehila wose wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Kowananga waja wavwizi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">Mndewa Mulungu kowehila wakomaji na wavwizi.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Mbali kwa ulondo wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nizakwingila muna ikaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nizakutambikila muna ikaye yako yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">na nizakutumbalila mavindi kwa kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Unilongoze Mndewa Mulungu kwa unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">kwaviya nina wehi wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">ugolose nzila yako kuulongozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Wehi wangu hawezalonga mbuli za kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mizoyo yawo yolonda kunanga muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">Viwolonga ni fana ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mbali wosang'hanila milomo yawo kulonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Weye Mulungu uwataguse kwa wihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">malungilo yawo yehile yawabwelele wenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">Wawinge hanhu hako kwaviya wawo wana uhasanyi mwingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">kwaviya wawo walema kukutegeleza.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Mbali wadeng'helele waja wose wokimbilila ukalizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">wembe kwa kudeng'helela siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Uwakalize waja wodilonda zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">wadahe kudeng'helela kwa ichimu chako.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kowatemela mate wanhu wose womtegeleza yeye, kowakaliza fana ngao viimkaliza mtowang'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu konikombola</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa dizi da ugaluga, kwa via va nyila vili na lusingija</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Mndewa Mulungu, sekeunibwakile kwa ng'hasiliki yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">sekeunitaguse kwa ludoko lwako.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uniwonele ubazi, mana nimalilwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">Unihonye Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya mavuha yangu yogegeda ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Muhe wangu wosafagila ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Na weye, Mndewa Mulungu kwizagozela kunitaza mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Mndewa Mulungu wize unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">unikombole kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Kwaviya habule yondayakukumbuke yahawa kadanganika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">Vino munhu yahawa kuzimu, yelihi yondayakutogoze?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Nilegela kwa kulila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">chila siku notapagiza komwa jangu kwa masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">notapagiza mto wangu kwa kulila kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Meso yangu yalegela kwa luholozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">kwa ichimu cha chililo cha kugazigwa na wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Segeleni kumwangu mweye wose womutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kahulika chililo changu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kahulika chinipulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Mndewa Mulungu kezatogola mbuli zangu zonimpula.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Wehi wangu wose wezapata chinyala na kwazanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">wezabwela kuchisogo na wezapata chinyala kwa kusinhukiza.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ziyopula munhu yowoneligwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi yoyamwimbile Mndewa Mulungu kusonhela Kushi wa kabila da Benyamini</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, nokukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">unilopole na waja wose woniwinza, unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Buleivo wezakwiza kunivavatula fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">wonibulula kutali na habule wa kunilopola.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, one nimtendela mbuli ihile munhu yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">one niyatenda makono yangu yambule mwiko kwa kutenda wihi,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />one nimtendela zihile munhu yonitendela mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">hebu nimtenda vihile mwihi wangu bila chimu,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />leka mwihi wangu yaniwinze na kunigwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na yanibojoge mbaka nidanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na kuugoneza ukulu wangu muna ditimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, inuka kwa ludoko lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">uwatowe wehi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">Inuka, weye Mulungu wangu, uhumize voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Wanhu wa zisi zose waiduganye kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">uwatawale kulawa uchanyha,<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kowatagusa wanhu wa zisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">Mndewa Mulungu, unihumize kwaviya nabule ubananzi na notenda fana voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Weye Mulungu unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">youlola magesa na mizoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">komeleza sang'hano za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">na uwatende wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wakale kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Mulungu ni ngao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">kowakombola wanhu weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Mulungu ni msemi yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">Mulungu yeli na ludoko na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile chila siku.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />One wanhu hawalekile uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Mulungu kezanola panga jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">kezaukwega upinde wake na kulinga shabaha.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Kezasasala via va ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">na kuihaka usungu misale yake.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Lola! Munhu yehile koilunga kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">munhu yehile kogesa mbuli zihile na kolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Munhu iyo kohimba kombo digidimile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">maabaho kogwa mwenyewo muna dikombo ijo.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Mbuli zihile zizampata yeye mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">usede wake wizambwelela yeye mwenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Nizamwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya kohumiza voilondeka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">na nizakwimba nhogolwa za zina da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mulungu na hishima ya munhu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa chia cha nyila cha Gasi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">zina jako dotogozigwa muna izisi zose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Ukulu wako wogong'ondigwa mbaka kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Kwa kutogozigwa na wana ving'hele na wana wokong'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">kuikila nguvu haulongozi ha wehi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">kuwafudaza wehi wako na wanhu wolihiza chisasi.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Nihalola ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">sang'hano ya vidole vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">mwezi na nhondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">zouziusile,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />vinhu ivo vonitenda niuze, “Munhu niiyo yelihi mbaka umgese?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">Munhu niiyo yelihi mbaka umwike kumoyo?”<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Kumtenda mdodo chidogo kufosa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">kumwing'ha ukulu na hishima.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Kumsagula yatawale vinhu vose viulumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">kuvika vinhu vose vilangulizigwe na yeye.<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />Yawatawale ng'hondolo na ng'ombe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">na wanyama wa kumbago,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />na ndege wa kuulanga na somba wa muna ibahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">na vilumbe vose vili muna ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">kweli zina jako dotogozigwa muna izisi zose!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kohuma</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwimbiligwa fana wila utangigwa “Ifa ya Mwana wa Chilume”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Nizakwing'ha hewela weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwa moyo wangu wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">Nizazisimulila sang'hano zako zose za unzonza.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Nizadeng'helela na kusekelela kwa ichimu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">Weye Uli Uchanyha Ng'hani nizadimbila nhogolwa zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Wehi wangu viwobwela kuchisogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">woikwala haulongozi wako na wodanganika.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Kwaviya kuigombela haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kukala muna ichigoda chako cha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">kuhumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Kuwakalikila wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">kuwadanganiza wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">wano hawezakumbukigwa kaidi siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Wehi wanangigwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">mabululu yawo kuyang'ola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">hawezakumbukigwa kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kotawala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">keka chigoda chake cha chifalume yakale na kuhumiza.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Kowahumiza wanhu wa zisi zose voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">kowatawala vinogile wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mhongono ya wanhu wowoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">yeye ni mhongono chipindi cha uzidilwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Wanhu wakumanyile weye Mndewa Mulungu wokuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu huwasa wanhu wokuzahila.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Mwimbileni nhogolwa Mndewa Mulungu yokala Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">Wagong'ondeleni wanhu sang'hano zake.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Kwaviya Mulungu kowalihilizila wanhu wogaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">hawazimiza wanhu wogazigwa viwolila.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uniwonele ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">Lola vinigazigwa na wanhu wonihila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">Unikombole muladi sekenidanganike,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />muladi niwagong'ondele nhogolwa zako wanhu muna zinyivi za Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">na uko nodeng'helela ukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wagwa muna dikombo diwahimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">wenzeka muna ulwavu lowafisile.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kailagusa kwa kuhumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wanamata kwa sang'hano zawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezahita kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">hamwe na wanhu wa zisi zose waja womzimiza Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Mbali wanhu wolonda kutazigwa hawezazimizigwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">uhuwilo wa ngayengaye hawizakwaga.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Inuka, weye Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">muladi wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile sekewahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">uwaduganye haulongozi wako wanhu wa zisi na uwahumize.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwatende wadumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">wanhu wa zisi wavimanye kuwa wawo ni wanhu muhala!<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowagombela wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, habali kokwima kutali na cheye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Habali koifisa chipindi cha magayo?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Kwa magoda wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wogaza ngayengaye na mitego yawo iwanamate.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zihile koitogoza madambwa ya moyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">komtemela mate muhika na kombela Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Kwa magoda yake munhu yotenda mbuli zihile kolonga, “Mulungu hezavimanya”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">na hamgesa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Siku zose kopata chila chinhu chiyolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">kuhumiza kwako kwa kutali nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">munhu yotenda mbuli zihile kowehula wehi wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Kogesa muna umoyo wake, “Habule chinhu cha kunitenda nidumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">sizapata magayo muna uugima wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Mulomo wake umema maduwilo na uvwizi na ubamanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">kahuha kulonga mbuli ziguma ludoko na zihile.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Koifisa na kusepa muna ivibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">komkoma kwa mvisa munhu yelibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">meso yake yomzahila nyondenyonde yamgaze.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Kosepa fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">kololela muladi yawagwile ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">kowanamata kwa mtego wake na kowabulula.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Munhu yelibule mtazi kogwiligwa na kogwisigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">kopotigwa kwa nguvu ya munhu yotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zihile kogesa muna umoyo wake, “Mulungu halola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">kagubika chihanga chake hawona!”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Inuka weye Mndewa Mulungu, winule mkono wako umtaguse munhu yotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">Sekeuwazimize waja wogaya.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Habali munhu yotenda mbuli zihile komwehula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">na kogesa muna umoyo wake, “Hezanitagusa”?<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Mbali weye kowawonela ubazi weli na magayo na manhesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">nyondenyonde wokuhuwila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">weye kowataza wachiwa siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Bena mkono wa munhu yotenda mbuli zihile voumtagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">sekeyagendelele kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mfalume wa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezawingigwa muna iisi yake.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kohulika chiyopula ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">komwing'ha moyo na komtegeleza.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Kowagombela wachiwa na waja wowoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">muladi munhu yeli ulongo muhala sekeyawadumbize wamwenga kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s">Kumuhuwila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Nokimbilila kwa Mndewa Mulungu kukala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">Lelo modahaze kunilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Guluka fana ndege mbaka kuna umulima.<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />Kwaviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokwega mhinde zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wamala kusasala misale muna diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">muladi wawapigisile wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Vandusilo va malagilizo vihanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">munhu yanogile kezatenda choni?”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuna ikaye yake yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">chigoda cha chifalume cha Mndewa Mulungu cha kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Kowalola wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">kovimanya chila chinhu chowotenda.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kowageza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">mbali kowehila wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">kowehila wanhu weli na mizoyo itoboke.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Kezawatowa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile kwa makala ya moto na mabwe ya baluti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">na beho kulu dizakuwa iyo nhaguso yawo.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kotenda mbuli zigoloke chila lusita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">kolonda sang'hano zigoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">wanhu wotenda mbuli zigoloke wezachiwona chihanga chake.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wake kulawa kwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila kwa modeli wa Sheminiti</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uchitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwaviya habule mwaminika yomdumba Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">kwaviya wokwaminika wasegezigwa mwa wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Chila munhu komvwizila mkaya miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">kolonga uvwizi kwa moyo wa udelenya.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Mndewa Mulungu, uifudaze milomo ilonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">uzifudagize ndimi zoziigoda.<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />Wolonga, “Chizahuma kwa ndimi zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">milomo chinayo, yelihi yodaha kuchitawala?”<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Kwa ichimu cha ngayengaye wowoniligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">na kwa ichimu cha ngayengaye wogaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">lelo nizakwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">nizaweng'ha tindiwalo wowozehigwa.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu yohuwiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">yohuwiligwa fana hela isunhigwe muna ditanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">fana hela isunhigwe kufosela muluvimbo miyanza saba.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwizachikaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">siku zose kwizachikaliza na welesi uno wihile.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wozunguluka banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">viwotogozigwa kwa kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizanizimiza mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Kwizanizimiza siku zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Kwizanifisa chihanga chako mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Nizakuwa na lugano mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Vino nizakuwa na usungu chila siku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Wehi wangu wezadeng'helela manhesa yangu mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Unilole na unidike, weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Nigangamize, one hutendile ivo nizadanganika.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Sekeuwaleke wehi wangu walonge, “Chimuhuma!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Wanhu wonigaza sekewadeng'helele kwaviya notigisigwa.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Mbali niye nohuwila ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">moyo wangu woudeng'helela ukombola wako.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Nizamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">kwaviya kanitendela mbuli nyingi zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s">Wihi wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Wabozi wolonga muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">“Habule Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Wose waga na wotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Habule munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kowalola wanhu kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">muladi yawone fana kuna munhu yoyose yovimanya kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">yomtambikila yeye.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Wose wabananga, wose waga hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">Habule munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">habule hata imwe.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Vino wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zihile hawavimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Wowawonela wanhu wa Mulungu chila siku, hawampula Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Wabananzi wezadumba ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowagombela wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Mweye wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile moyalema malungilo ya ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">mbali Mndewa Mulungu niiyo kimbililo jawo.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Nolonda ng'hani ukombola wa Isilaili ulawe Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Mndewa Mulungu vondayawabwelezele wanhu wake ugima utemeligwe mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">welesi wa Yakobo wizadeng'helela na Waisilaili wezasekelela.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s">Munhu yokuwa hamwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, yelihi yondayadahe kwingila muna dihema jako jelile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Yelihi yodaha kukala uchanyha ya mulima wako welile Sayuni?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Niiyo munhu yokala fana Mulungu viyolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">yolonga ukweli kwa moyo welile.<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />Niiyo munhu hawadeta wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">hamtendela zihile mbwiyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">hebu kumulonga vihile mkaya miyage.<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />Niiyo munhu yowehula waja walemigwe na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">mbali kowahishimu wanhu womdumba Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Niiyo munhu hagalula chilaho chake ng'o, hata one yahalumila,<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />hamwazima munhu hela yake kwa kulonda yambwelezele limangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">hahokela lushwa muladi kulonga uvwizi kusonhela munhu yelibule ubananzi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Munhu yotenda mbuli izo kezagangamala.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s">Kukala goya</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unikalize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwaviya nokukimbilila weye.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Nomulongela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">vinhu vose vinogile vinilinavo vilawa kumwako.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Wanhu welile weli muna iisi, niiwawo weli na muhavu.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Mbali wanhu wotambikila milungu imwenga, wezagaya ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Sizaitila nhambiko ya damu na sizatambula mazina ya milungu iyo.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu weye liziki yangu na chochose chonilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">ugima wangu wamuna yamakono yako.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kaning'ha hanhu hanogile ng'hani ha kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">Nideng'helela vinhu vose voyaning'hile.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu yonilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">hata ichilo muna umoyo wangu nogesa mafundizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Nomuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">kwaviya Mulungu kahamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">sizadumba bule.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Ivo moyo wangu wodeng'helela na lulimi lwangu losekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">na lukuli lwangu lwizahumula.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Kwaviya hwizauleka muhe wangu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">hwizanileka niye munhu wako mwaminika niwole.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Kwizanitenda niimanye nzila ya ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kuulongozi wako kuna deng'ho ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kuna umkono wako wa kulume kuna mbuli zinogile siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ziyopula munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile</para>
  <para style="d">Mbuli za Daudi zoyompula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unitegeleze vonikulamba kwaviya notenda mbuli zilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">kinga gutwi jako, utegeleze vonikulamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Uhulike mbuli zangu zonikupula zilibule udelenya.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Weye kodaha kunihumiza fana voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">kwaviya kuvimanya niye notenda voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Weye kuumanya moyo wangu. Konizila ichilo na kunigeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">mbali hwizawona wihi kumwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">Sizatenda uhasanyi kwa kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Kwa sang'hano ziwosang'hana wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">niye nizindilila lagilizo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">niyepula na nzila za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Nyayo zangu ziilumbagiza na nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">migulu yangu haisegezigwe.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Nokulamba weye Mulungu, kwaviya weye konidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">unikingile digutwi, uhulike mbuli zangu.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Lagusa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">uwakombole kulawa kwa wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">waja wokimbilila kumwako muladi kukala goya.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Unikalize fana voudikaliza ziso jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">unifise muna disisila da mabawa yako.<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />Unifise kutali na ng'hondo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">kutali na wehi wangu weli banzi zose.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Wawo wabule ubazi muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">wamema mbuli za magoda muna imilomo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Wonisondelela na kunizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">wonisepa muladi wanigwise hasi.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Waisasala kunivavatula fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">fana simba viyosepasepa ukala.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Inuka weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">uwawinge na kuwapolomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">Kwa panga unilopole kulawa kwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwa mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">unilopole muna yamakono ya wanhu wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Wohokela gweko muna uugima uno muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Uwamemeze nhaguso youwekile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wapate ya kuwafaya na wana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wawalekele mbaka wazukulu zawo.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Mbali niye nikulole chihanga chako, kwaviya nitenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">nihalamka nimemezigwe na deng'ho kwa kuchiwona chihanga chako.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa uhumi</para>
  <para style="d">Kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, zabuli ya Daudi msang'hani wa Mulungu, kamwimbila Mulungu wila uno kusonhela lusita Mulungu viyamulopole kulawa kwa Sauli na wehi wake wose</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Nokulonda weye Mndewa Mulungu, nguvu yangu!<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Mndewa Mulungu ni luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">mhongono yangu na mulopozi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Mulungu wangu ni luwe wangu yonimkimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">yeye ni kimililo jangu na nguvu za ulopozi wangu na mhongono yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Nomulamba Mndewa Mulungu yofaya kwing'higwa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">na nolopoligwa kulawa kwa wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Nzabi za ifa zinizinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">mazi mengi yokuluma yanigubika.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Nzabi kulawa kuzimu zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">mitego ya ifa ininamata.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Muna uuzidilwa wangu nimtanga Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">nimulamba Mulungu wangu yanitaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">Kahulika dizi jangu kuna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">kahulika vinimpulile yanitaze.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Isi igudemeka na itingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">vandusilo va milima vigudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">vigudemeka kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawona ludoko.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Yosi difuka kulawa muna imhula yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">moto woulunguza ulawa muna umulomo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">makala ya moto yazipuka kulawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Kaunamiza ulanga nayo kahulumuka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">kukala na wingu titu hasi ya magulu yake.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Kakwela mchanyha ya kelubi, kazumha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">kaguluka himahima uchanyha fana mabawa mudibeho.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Kaigubika ziza banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">kazungulukigwa na mawingu yazamile yamemile mazi.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Lumwemwe lumweka kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">kuulanga kulawilila mvula ya mabwe na makala ya moto.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kaduma kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kalava dizi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">kulawilila mvula ya mabwe na makala ya moto.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Kawatowa misale yake wehi na kawapwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">lumwemwe lukulu luwatimula.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Bawe dili hasi ya bahali diwoneka, vandusilo va isi vigubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kwa kubwakila kwako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">vigubuligwa kwa luvumo lwa mhumuzi ya mhula yako.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Kahulumuka kulawa uchanyha na kanyamhilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">kanivabula muna yamazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Kanilopola kulawa kwa mwihi wangu yeli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kanilopola kulawa kwa waja wanihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kwaviya wakala na nguvu kufosa niye.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Wanitowa vinikalile muna uuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kakala mtazi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Kanilava kanigala hanhu ha kuilegeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">kanilopola kwaviya kanogelwa na niye.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kaning'ha gweko kwa unovu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">kanigweka kwaviya niye nabule ubananzi.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Kwaviya nizisondelela nzila za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">na sikalile kutali na Mulungu wangu kwa wihi.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Kwaviya nizindilila malagilizo yake yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">silekile kusondelela ndagilizi zake.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Nikala voilondeka haulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">niiteganya na wihi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Mndewa Mulungu kaniliha vonilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">yeye kovimanya kuwa makono yangu yabule ubananzi.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Weye kokwaminika kwa wanhu wokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">kolagusa unovu wako kwa wanhu weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Weye kowatendela mbuli zinogile wanhu weli na mizoyo inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">mbali kwa waja wabalabala koilagusa kuwa mbala kufosa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Weye kowakombola wanyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">mbali waja woigoda kowahulumusa.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kobwinha chitasa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">weye konimwemwesela ziza jangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Kwa utazi wako nodaha kudihuma bumbila da wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">kwa kutazigwa na Mulungu wangu nodaha kukwela ng'huta.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Nzila yake Mulungu igoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu izalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">yeye niiyo kimililo kwa wose womkimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Habule yeli Mulungu, mbali Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">habule yeli mhongono mbali Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Mulungu niiyo yoning'ha nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">na konilanguliza vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Kaitenda migulu yangu sekeitelebuke fana migulu ya ng'hulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">na kanidahiza nime uchanyha ng'hani kulugongo.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Koifunza makono yangu kuitowa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">makono yangu idahe kukwega upinde ugangamale.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Kuning'ha kimililo da ulopozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">na mkono wako wa kulume unitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">unovu wako unitenda niwe mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Kuzigalamulila nyafasi nzila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">magulu yangu hayatelebuke.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Niwawingisa wehi wangu na kuwagwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">sibwelile kuchisogo mbaka viniwanangile.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Niwagwisa hasi muladi sekewadahe kwinuka kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">wagwa hasi ya migulu yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Kuning'ha nguvu ya kuitowa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">kuwagwisa hasi yangu wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Kuwatenda wehi wangu wakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">na waja wanihile niwananga.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Walamba kutazigwa, mbali habule wa kuwalopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu, mbali hawedike.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Niwadunda wawa fana timbwisi dihembelusigwa na mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">niwabojoga fana nhope ya muna inzila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Kunilopola kulawa kwa wanhu wonitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">kunitenda mtawala wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">wanhu siwamanyile wanisang'hanila.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Bahaja viwahulike mbuli zangu wanitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">nyambenyambe watogola niwalangulize.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Nyambenyambe wafa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">weza wogudema kulawa muna zimhongono zawo.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Mndewa Mulungu mgima! Luwe wangu yatogozigwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">Mulungu Mulopozi wangu yenuligwe!<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Yeye ni Mulungu yolihiliza kwa ichimu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">na kuzika zisi hasi yangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Kanilopola kulawa kwa wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">kanitogoza kwa wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">na kanyepula na wanhu wasede.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Ivo nizakutogoza weye Mndewa Mulungu hagati ya zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">nizadimbila nhogolwa zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Yeye komwing'ha mfalume wake uhumi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">kolagusa ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo kwa munhu yoyamsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">komulagusa ulondo Daudi yoyekigwe hakwe na welesi wake siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mulungu na malagilizo yake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Munhu yahalola ulanga, koumanya ukulu wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">langa dolagusa sang'hano ya makono yake.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Chila siku yolonga ukulu wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">chila ichilo yomfambula Mulungu viyeli.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Habule mbuli zilongeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">hebu dizi dihulikika.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Mbali dizi jawo dohulikika muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">mbuli zawo zofika uhelelo wa isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Mulungu kadikila zuwa hanhu hake kuulanga,<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />dolawa fana msola viyolawa muna ichiheleto chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">dodeng'helela fana munhu yohuma kuna ukukimbila.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Dosomoza ubanzi umwe wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">na dozungulukila ubanzi umwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">Habule chinhu chidaha kuyepula na vuke jake.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu digoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">dombwelezela munhu ugima wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">ndagilizi za Mndewa Mulungu zohuwiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">zoweng'ha ubala wanhu wabozi.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu yanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">youdeng'heleza moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu jela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">dochitaza kuzimanya nzila zake.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">na yeye kezadumbigwa siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">yose yagoloka.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Malagilizo yake yomeliligwa mate kufosa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kufosa zahabu yelile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">yamulile kufosa uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">kufosa lala da uki.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Malagilizo yako yonizuma niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">wanhu woyazindilila wopata gweko kulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Yelihi youmanya ubananzi wake mwenyewo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Weye Mndewa Mulungu unilekelele na ubananzi siumanyile.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Unikimilile niye msang'hani wako na ubananzi wa kuilunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">sekeutogole uwo unitawale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Baho nizakuwa nabule wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">na sizabananga ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Mbuli za mulomo wangu na magesa ya moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">zitogoleke haulongozi wako weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Mndewa Mulungu iyo luwe wangu na mulopozi wangu!<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Kumpulila mfalume yahume</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yakwidike voukuwa muuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">zina da Mulungu wa Yakobo dikukalize.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Yakugalile utazi kulawa kuna ikaye yake yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">yakutaze kulawa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Yazihokele nhosa zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">yazitogole nhambiko zako za kutimbula.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Yakutendele mbuli ziugesa muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">chila mbuli iuilungile ilawilile.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Chizakwimbila kwa deng'ho kwa ichimu cha uhumi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">chizadeng'helela kwa zina da Mulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">Mndewa Mulungu yakwing'he chila chiupulile!<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Novimanya Mndewa Mulungu komtaza ija yamsagule kuwa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kezamwidika kulawa hanhu hake helile kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kwa mkono wake wa kulume kezamwing'ha uhumi mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Wamwenga woigodela matololi yobululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">wamwenga woigodela falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">mbali cheye choigodela zina da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Wawo wezaikwala na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">mbali cheye chizakwinuka na kwima chigangamavu.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, umtende mfalume yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">na uchidike vochikupula uchitaze.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s">Hewela kwa kuhuma</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, mfalume kodeng'helela kwa ichimu cha nguvu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">kodeng'helela ng'hani kwa viya viumtazile.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Kumwing'ha viyolonda muna umoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">hulemile chiyapulile.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Kumwizila, kumwing'ha vitumetume vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">kumvaza kombelo da zahabu yelile muna iditwi jake.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Kakupula ugima, kumwing'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">kumtenda yakale siku nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Mfalume kohishimigwa kufosela uhumi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">kumwing'ha nhogolwa na hishima.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Kumtemela mate siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">kumdeng'heleza haulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Kwaviya mfalume komuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">kwa ulondo wa Mulungu wa kufunya umoyo kezasigala mgangamavu.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Weye mfalume, mkono wako wizawagwila wehi wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">mkono wako wa kulume wizawagwila waja wokwihila.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Vondaulawilile, kwizawatakamiza fana tanuli da moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Mndewa Mulungu kezawananga kwa ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">moto wizawatimbula.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Kwizawananga welesi wawo muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">wana wawo hawezasigala hagati ya wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />One wahailungila mbuli zihile kusonhela weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">wezapotwa kufikiza malungilo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Kwaviya kwizawatenda wakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">kwizawalinga muna ivihanga kwa misale yako.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Utogoligwe weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha nguvu yako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">Chizakwimba na kuutogoza udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwimbiligwa fana wila utangigwa “Mhala Mbuguma wa Mhwani Yau.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu, habali kunileka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Habali kwa kutali kuno nokulamba unikombole?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Habali huhulika voniiyalala?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nolila imisi, mbali hunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">na ichilo iviya, mbali sipata muhavu.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Mbali weye kwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">weye kotogozigwa na Waisilaili.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Wasaho zetu wakuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">wakuhuwila weye na kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Wakulamba weye na wakomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">wakuhuwila weye, nawo hawagwile chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Mbali niye mng'onyo siyo munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">nyehuligwa na kuzehigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Wose woniwona wonizeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">wonifonza na kutingisa matwi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Wolonga, “Kamuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">lelo Mulungu nayamkombole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">One Mulungu kanogelwa nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">nayamkombole.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Kunilava muna iinda ya mami yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">kunikaliza vinikalile nokong'ha tombo da mami yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Kwandusila vinyelekigwe, kunilola goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">kwandusila vinyelekigwe, weye kuwa Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Sekeunileke, kwaviya uzidilwa wahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">habule wa kunitaza.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Wehi wengi wanizinga fana ng'ombe lume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">Wonisondelela fana ng'ombe walume wakali wa Bashani!<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Wogubula milomo yawo fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">fana simba yovavatula na kubuma.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Nitika fana mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">mavuha yangu yose yasiguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">moyo wangu ulinga fana uhula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">wolumbuka mgati yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Mulomo wangu unyala fana zae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">lulimi lwangu lonamata muna umulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">weye konitambalisa muna yamatimbwisi ya ifa.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Wehi wanizinga, fana bumbila da zimbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">watobola makono yangu na magulu yangu fana simba.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Nodaha kuyapeta mavuha yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">wehi wangu wonibunhulila meso na kuigoda.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Woigolela mawalo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">na woditowela mhiya walo jangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu sekeunileke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">weye uli chandusilo cha nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">wize himahima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Unilopole na upanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">unikombole muna zinguvu za zimbwa wano.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Unilopole muna imilomo ya simba wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">unikombole kulawa muna zinguvu za ng'ombe mbago wano.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Nizawalongela ndugu viya viwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">nizakutogoza hana umting'hano.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Mweye womumdumba Mndewa Mulungu, mtogozeni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mweye welesi wose wa Isilaili, mumuhishimu yeye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Mweye welesi wose wa Isilaili, mdumbeni yeye!<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Kwaviya yeye hehula unyondenyonde wa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">na haifisa kutali nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">mbali komtegeleza viyompula yamtaze.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Kwa ichimu chako nizakutogoza hana umting'hano wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">nizafikiza vilaho vangu haulongozi wa waja wokudumba.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ngayengaye wezakuja na kwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">womzahila Mndewa Mulungu, wezamtogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">mweye mkale goya siku zose!<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wezakumbuka na kumbwelela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">wanhu wa zisi zose wezamtambikila,<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu ni mfalume na kozitawala zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Matajili wose wa isi wezadeng'helela na kutambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">wose wodanganika na wezamtumbalila mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">wose hawadaha kwamhilila ugima wawo.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Nyelesi zikwiza zizamsang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">wanhu wezazipeta mbuli za Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Wezagong'onda sang'hano zake zigoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">wanhu weli hawanavumbuka wezalongeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">“Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yatendile mbuli izo!”<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mdimi wangu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mdimi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">sizahungukilwa na chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Konitambalisa hana ukudimila mgina mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">konilanguliza hamgwazo hana yamazi yaholile.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Konibwelezela ugima wa muhe wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">Konilongoza muna inzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">kwa ichimu cha zina jake.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Nihafosa hagati ya kolongo da ziza kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">sizadumba mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu kwahamwe na niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">Balati jako na mhome yako, vonikaliza.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Kosasala ndiya kuulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kuno wehi wangu wolola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">Kunihaka mavuta muna iditwi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">nhungo yangu imema.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Kweli unovu wako na ubazi wako vizakuwa hamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">siku zose za ugima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">Nizakala muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume mkulu</para>
  <para style="b">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Isi na chila chinhu chili umo cha Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">isi yose na wanhu wokala umo ni wake.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Kwaviya keka isi uchanyha ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">kaitenda isi igangamale uchanyha ya mazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Yelihi yondayakwele kuna umulima wa Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Yelihi yondayeme hanhu hake helile?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Munhu yosang'hana mbuli zinogile na yeli na moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">ija hatambikila vinhu va uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">na heka chilagano cha uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Kezatemeligwa mate na Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">na kezapetigwa kanoga kwa Mulungu wa ulopozi wake.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Niivo ili kwa welesi wa wanhu wokwiza kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">wanhu wokwiza kumtambikila Mulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Vugukeni mweye nyivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">vugukeni mweye nyivi za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">muladi mfalume mkulu yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Mfalume mkulu yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Mndewa Mulungu yeli na nguvu na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Mndewa Mulungu yeli na nguvu kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Vugukeni mweye nyivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">vugukeni mweye nyivi za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">muladi mfalume mkulu yengile.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Mfalume mkulu niiyo yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">yeye niiyo mfalume mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu ulangulizi na ukalizi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba.<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Nokuhuwila weye Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">sekeunileke nigwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">sekeuleke wehi wangu wadeng'helele vondanihumigwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Wanhu wokugozela, hawagwa chinyala hata imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">mbali wogaya bule waja wose wotenda mbuli zihile wezakugwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unilagusile nzila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">unifunze nzila zako.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Unilongoze muna ikweli yako na unifunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">kwaviya weye ni Mulungu wa ulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">nokuhuwila weye siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ukumbuke ubazi wako na ulondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kwaviya vikala uko kwandusila umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Sekeukumbuke uhasanyi na ubananzi wa ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako na unovu wako, unikumbuke.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kanoga na kolonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">ivo kowafunza wahasanyi nzila zake.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Kowalongoza wanyendanyenda muna inzila inogile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">na kowafunza nzila yake.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Nzila zose za Mndewa Mulungu ni za ulondo na kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">kwa waja wokwamha lagano jake na ulamuzi wake.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwa ichimu cha zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">unilekelele ubananzi wangu, kwaviya wiiyoha.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Chila munhu yomdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Mndewa Mulungu komfunza nzila ya kusagula.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Munhu fana iyo kezatemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">na welesi wake wezaihazi isi.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mbwiya wa waja womdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">kowafundiza lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Nomuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu yanitaze siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">yeye konyonzola muna umtego wa wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Unilole na uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwaviya niye nadumwe na nogaya.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Moyo wangu wosafagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">unisegeze muna uzidilwa wangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Lola unyondenyonde wangu na magayo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">unilekelele uhasanyi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Lola wehi wangu viweli wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">uwone viya viwonihila kwa usede.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Unikalize na unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">sekeunileke nigwe chinyala, kwaviya nokukimbilila weye.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Unovu na kwaminika vinilolese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwaviya nokuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwakombole wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:22">muna yamagayo yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s">Munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile kopula</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwataguse wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">mana nikala bila kutenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwaviya nikuhuwila weye Mndewa Mulungu bila kusinha.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unigeze na unilinge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">ulole moyo wangu na magesa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Kwaviya ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo wonilongoza siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">na nokala kwa ichimu cha waminika wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Sikala na wanhu wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">na siilumba na wadelenya.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Nokwihila mting'hano wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">na sizakala na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Nonawa makono yangu kulagusa nabule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">notambika hana ulupango lwako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />muladi nigong'onde wila wa hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">na kuzisimulila sang'hano zako za kudumbiza.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Mndewa Mulungu, noilonda kaye yako youkala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">hanhu houkala ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Sekeuninange hamwe na wahasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">iviya sekeunange ugima wangu hamwe na wakomaji.<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />Lusita lose wosang'hana zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">makono yawo ya kulume yamema lushwa.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Mbali niye nokala kwa unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">unikombole na unitendele mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Niye nima hanhu hagangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu kuna umting'hano mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukala na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Mndewa Mulungu niijo bung'hulo jangu na ukombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">nimdumbe yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mhongono ya ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">nimgudemekele yelihi?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Wehi wahanikwenhukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wahalonda kuninanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wezaikwala na kugwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Hata watowang'hondo wahanizinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">muhe wangu hawizadumba chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">One ng'hondo yahanilawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">baho nizamuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Nompula Mndewa Mulungu mbuli imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">mbuli iyo niiyo yoniizahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">nidahe kukala muna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">niuwone unovu wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na kumtambikila muna ikaye yake.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Kezanikaliza lusita lwa magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">kezanilolesa muna dihema jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">kezanika hanhu goya uchanyha ya uluwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Maabaho nizawahuma wehi wangu wonizunguluka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">Nizamulavila Mulungu nhambiko kwa deng'ho mwiikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nizakwimba na kumdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uhulike vonikulamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">uniwonele ubazi na unidike.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Moyo wangu wonilongela, “Izo umtambikile Mulungu,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">“Nokutambikila, weye Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Sekeunifise chihanga chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Sekeumuleme msang'hani wako kwa ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">weye kuwa mtazi wangu siku zose, sekeunyase.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Sekeunileke weye Mulungu wangu na mkombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Hata one tati yangu na mama yangu wahanileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">Mndewa Mulungu kezanihokela kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unifunze nzila yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">unilongoze muna inzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">kwaviya wehi wangu ni wengi.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Sekeuwaleke wehi wangu wanitende viwolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwaviya wasindila wa uvwizi wonikwenhukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">nawo wogala woga wa usede.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Nizagendelela kuhuwila vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">nizauwona unovu wake Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">kuna iisi ya wagima.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Mgoze Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">ugangamale na sekeudumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">umuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu yataguse voilondeka</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Nokulamba weye Mndewa Mulungu, luwe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">sekeuwe fana msuwamagutwi kumwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">One uhanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">nizakuwa fana waja wohita kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Hulika dizi jangu vinikulamba unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">vininula makono yangu mchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">kusonhela kaye yako yelile.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Sekeunibulule hamwe na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">wanhu wolonga na wayawo mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">mbali muna imizoyo yawo woilungila mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Uwalihe kwa sang'hano zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">kwa mbuli ziya zihile ziwatendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">Walihigwe kwa sang'hano ziwatendile kwa makono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">uwasang'hanile fana viya viwasang'hane.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawazigesa sang'hano za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">hebu sang'hano za makono yake ziyasang'hane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">Kezawananga na hezawazenga kaidi bule.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogozigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">mana kahulika vinimulambile kunitaza.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo nguvu yangu na kingilo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">nomuhuwila yeye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">na nizamwimbila wila wa kumwing'ha hewela.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kowagangamiza wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">komkombola na komkaliza mfalume wake yoyasaguligwe.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Weye uwakombole wanhu wako na uwatemele mate wanhu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Uwe mdimi wawo na uwapape siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">Dizi da Mulungu muna divulavumbi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Mwing'heni Mndewa Mulungu hishima mweye wasenga wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">Longeni, “Mndewa Mulungu kana ukulu na nguvu.”<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Gong'ondeni ukulu wa zina da Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">Mtambikileni Mndewa Mulungu hanhu hake helile.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dohulikika muna dibeho kulu muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Mulungu mkulu koduma mchanyha ya mazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dina nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dina udahi.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dobena mibiki ya mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Mndewa Mulungu kobena mibiki mikulu ya mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">mielezi yotile muna iisi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Muna digudemeko da isi, Mulungu koipigisapigisa Lebanoni fana viya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe vidizumhazumha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">mulima Silioni wopigisigwa fana viya mwana ng'ombe mbago voyozumhazumha.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dolawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:7">fana lumwemwe lomweka.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu dogudemeza chuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Mndewa Mulungu kogudemeza chuwala cha Kadeshi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Dizi da Mndewa Mulungu doitenda mibiki mitali kunyopanyopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">yokwanyula mayani ya mibiki mwiimbago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">Muna Ikaye ya Mulungu wanhu wose walandule madizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">“Mtogozeni Mulungu!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kotawala gombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Mndewa Mulungu ni mfalume siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Mndewa Mulungu yaweng'he nguvu wanhu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">Mndewa Mulungu kowatemela mate wanhu wake wakale kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s">Kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu kwa utazi wake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi, wila wa kuika Kaye ya Mulungu kwa sang'hano yelile</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nizakutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">kwaviya kunilopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">na huwalekile wehi wangu wadeng'helele vonihumigwa.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, nikulamba unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">na weye kunihonya.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kuninyang'hula kulawa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">kunibwelezela ugima kulawa kwa waja wohita kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Mwimbileni wila wa nhogolwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">mweye wanhu wake waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">kumbukeni zina jake jelile na mumwing'he hewela.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Ludoko lwake lokala chidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">Ndilo yodaha kuwa uko hata ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">mbali deng'ho dokwiza imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Niye vinimwedile, nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Habule munhu wa kunihuma!”<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Kwa unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">kunigangamiza fana mulima mkulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">mbali vouifisile kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">niye nigwa luholozi.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Nikulamba weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">nikupula uniwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Vino nihadanganika, kwizapata choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Hebu nihahita kuzimu, kwizapata choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Vino matimbwisi ya wanhu yodaha kukutogoza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Vino matimbwisi yodaha kusimulila uwaminika wako?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unihulike na uniwonele ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unitaze!”<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Weye kugalusa kulila kwangu kuwa sona za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">kunihambula viwalo va ndilo, kuniyawaliza deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Niye nizakutogoza na sizakala hupi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, nizakwing'ha hewela siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula lusita lwa uzidilwa mkulu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Nikukimbilila weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">muladi sekenigwe chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">Unilopole kwa unovu wako.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Kinga magutwi na unikombole himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">kumwangu uwe fana luwe lwa kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">uwe fana kaye ili na mhongono ya kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Weye niiyo luwe wangu na mhongono yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">Muladi zina jako dihishimigwe, unikalize na unilangulize.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Unilave muna ulwavu luja wanhu luwanitegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">kwaviya weye niiyo kimbililo jangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Muna yamakono yako nowika muhe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">kunikombola, weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu mwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Nowehila wanhu wose wotambikila milungu ya uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">mbali nomuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Nizadeng'helela ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwaviya kuwona manhesa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kuumanya moyo wangu muna uuzidilwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Weye hunigumile muna yamakono ya wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">kuyemiza magulu yangu hanhu ha kukala goya.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Uniwonele ubazi, kwaviya namuna uuzidilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">Meso yangu yalegela kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">iviya moyo wangu na lukuli lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Ugima wangu umala kwa ichimu cha masozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Miyaka yangu imala kwa ichimu cha ndilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Nguvu zangu zinimala kwa ichimu cha manhesa yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Nisoka mavuha muhala.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Kwa ichimu cha wehi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">niwa chilozo kwa wakaya wayangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">Mbaka mbwiya zangu wodumba kunikwenhukila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">Wahaniona mwiinzila wonikimbila.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Nizimizigwa fana nidanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">niwa fana nongo itulike.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Niwahulika wanhu wengi woinyong'onyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">ludumbo lwa banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">viwalonganye vihile kusonhela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wailungila kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Mbali niye nikuhuwila weye Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">Nilonga, “Weye ni Mulungu wangu!”<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Ugima wangu wamuna yamakono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">unikombole kulawa muna yamakono ya wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">na kulawa kwa wose wonigaza.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Unilole vinogile niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">unikombole kwa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeunileke nigwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwaviya niye nokutanga unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">mbali waleke wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wagwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">waleke wagile kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Ifudaze milomo ya wanhu wawo wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">weli watatali na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">waja wowazeha wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Lola unovu wako viwili mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">wouwekile wanhu waja wokudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">unovu wouwatendele waja wokukimbilila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">Kuweng'ha mbuli zinogile kuno wanhu wose wolola.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Kwizawafisa hanhu hanogile baho hawili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kutali na malungilo yehile ya wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">Kowafisa hanhu hanogile kutali na wehi wawo wowaliga.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">kwaviya kanilagusa ulondo wake wa mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">vinizungulukigwe fana bululu doditowigwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Niye nidumba na kugesa kuwa kunyasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">Mbali kuhulika ndilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">vinikutangile unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Mulondeni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye waminika wake wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">mbali waja weli na magoda ng'hani, kezawatagusa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Mweye wose womumgozela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">muwe wagangamavu na mufunye umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s">Hewela kwa ichimu cha kulekelelwa uhasanyi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa kufundiza</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Wamweda wanhu waja wosegeziligwa ubananzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">na wanhu waja wolekeliligwa uhasanyi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Wamweda wanhu waja uhasanyi wawo haupetigwa na Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">wanhu welibule uvwizi muna imizoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Vinikalile sinasama uhasanyi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">lukuli lwangu lusoka ng'hani kwa kulila imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Mndewa Mulungu, kunitagusa imisi na ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">nguvu zangu zifyonzigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">fana isi inyalile lusita lwa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Maabaho nikulongela uhasanyi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">iviya siufisile wihi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Nilonga, “Nizamulongela Mndewa Mulungu wihi wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Na weye kunilekelela uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Ivo chila munhu yokwaminika yakupule lusita vondayawe muuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">kweli gombo vondadize hadizamfikila mbee.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Weye niiyo hanhu hangu ha kwiifisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">kwizanikaliza kulawa muna yamagayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">kunizunguluka kwa madizi ya deng'ho ya ulopozi.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizakufunza na kukulagusa nzila ya kusondelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">nizakufundiza na kukulolesa goya.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Sekemuwe fana falasi hebu vihongwe, hawavimanyile mbuli yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">mbaka wafungigwe imilomo na vikimililo, buleivo wezahita kutali.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezagaya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">mbali womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">wezazingigwa na ulondo wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye mutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">toweni ng'henze za kudeng'helela, mweye muli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Mtoweleni ng'henze Mndewa Mulungu mweye mutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">kumtogoza kowafaya wanhu weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa zeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">mwimbileni kwa kutowa bango.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Mwimbileni wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">toweni vinogile via va nyila na kudeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Kwaviya mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu ni ya haki na kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">na sang'hano zake zose zokwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Kolonda mbuli zigoloke na kuhumiza vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">isi imema ulondo wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Ulanga ulumbigwa kwa mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">na nhondo za kuulanga zilumbigwa kwa mumhuzi ya mulomo wake.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Keka mhaka muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">mazi mengi yosigala hanhu hake.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Wanhu wa ziisi zose wamdumbe Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">waleke wanhu wose wa isi wamuhishimu.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Kwaviya kalonga na isi ilumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">kalava lagilizo na chila chinhu chilawilila.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kogalula malungilo ya zisi zose kuwa si chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">kochibananga chiya chowogesa wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Gesa da Mndewa Mulungu dokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">malungilo ya moyo wake yokala nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Imweda isi ija Mndewa Mulungu ni Mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">wamweda wanhu woyawasagule kuwa wanhu wake mwenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolola hasi kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">kowalola wanhu wose.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Kulawa hana ihanhu hoyokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">kowalola wose wokala muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Yeye yousa mizoyo ya wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">kovimanya chila sang'hano yowotenda.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Habule mfalume yokomboligwa kwa kuwa na watowang'hondo wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">na galu hadaha kuhuma kwa nguvu zake nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Falasi hadaha kumtenda munhu yahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">na hamulopola munhu kwa nguvu zake nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Ziso da Mndewa Mulungu dowalola waja womdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">waja wohuwila ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />kuwakombola kulawa muna iifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">na kuweka wagima lusita lose lwa nzala.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Cheye chomgozela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">yeye niiyo mtazi wetu na kingilo jetu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Mizoyo yetu yomdeng'heleza yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">kwaviya chodihuwila zina jake jelile.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo ukale na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">fana vochikuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s">Unovu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kusonhela lusita viyaitendile chichala haulongozi wa Abimeleki yoyamuwingile</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu lusita lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">nizamtogoza kwa mulomo wangu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Nizaigoda kwa chiya Mndewa Mulungu choyatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">leka wanyendanyenda wahulike na wadeng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Longeni na niye “Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">chose chidigong'onde hamwe zina jake.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Nimpula Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kanidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">na kanisegezela ludumbo lwangu lose.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Wanhu womuhindukila Mndewa Mulungu wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">na vihanga vawo havizagumigwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Niye nyondenyonde nimtanga Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">nayo kanihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">kanilopola kulawa muna yamagayo yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wose womdumba Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">na kowalopola.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Gezeni mulole Mndewa Mulungu kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">kamweda munhu ija yomkimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Mdumbeni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">mweye wanhu wake welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwaviya wanhu womdumba hawezahungukilwa na chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Kweli simba wohungukilwa na chinhu na kuwona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">mbali wanhu womzahila Mndewa Mulungu hawahungukilwa na chinhu chochose chinogile.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Wanangu izoni munitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">niye nizawafunzani kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Vino yelihi vimwili yolonda ugima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">Hebu yelihi yodeng'helela kukala vinogile siku nyingi?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Ivo uyepule kulonga mbuli zihile na uleke kulonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Uleke kutenda mbuli zihile na utende mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">na ukale kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Meso ya Mndewa Mulungu yowalola goya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">magutwi yake yowategeleza waja wompula yawataze.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kowatumbila ichisogo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">na kowatenda wanhu wamwenga sekewawakumbuke kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahapula kutazigwa, Mndewa Mulungu kowahulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">na kowakombola kulawa muna yamagayo yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kahabehi na wanhu waja wafile moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">kowakombola wose welibule chochose cha kugozela.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wopata magayo mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kowalopola muna yamagayo yayo yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Kokwika goya mavuha yawo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">habule hata vuha dimwe dondadibeneke.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Wihi wizamkoma munhu yotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">na wanhu womwihila munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile, wezatagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawakombola wasang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">habule munhu yoyose yokimbilila kumwake yondayatagusigwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu uhumi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwaleme waja wonilema niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">uitowe na waja woitowa na niye.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Usole kimililo jako na kingilo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">winuke na wize kunitaza.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Sola mgoha na zele jako uwatowe waja woniwinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">longa na moyo wangu, “Niye ni mulopozi wako.”<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Wanhu wousaka ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wagumigwe chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wabwelezigwe kuchisogo na wapate chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">waja wowopanga kunitendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Wawe fana makang'ha yohembelusigwa na mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">wasenga wa kuulanga wowagwisa hasi.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Nzila yawo iwe na ziza na utelebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">kuno wasenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa Mulungu wowawinga.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Wanitegela lwavu bila ya chimu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">wanihimbila kombo bila chimu chochose.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Wanangigwe kwa kusinhukiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">lwavu luwanitegele wenzeke wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwile muna dikombo ijo na wadanganike.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Muhe wangu wizamdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">na kudeng'helela ulopozi wake.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Nizamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Habule yalingile fana weye Mndewa Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Weye kowakombola ngayengaye kulawa kwa wene nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Weye kowakaliza nyondenyonde sekewabawigwe.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Wasindila wa uvwizi wokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">wolonga nitenda mbuli sizimanyile.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Woniliha mbuli zihile kwa zinogile zonitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">nisigala na usungu.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Mbali wawo viwawile watamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">niye nivala maguniya, muladi kulagusa nina usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">niigaza kwa kuleka kuja.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">Nipula kuno nidulika iditwi.<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />Nilila fana viya nomulilila mbwiya hebu ndugu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">Niwegela kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">fana munhu yolila ndilo ya mami yake.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Mbali nihagaya, wawo wodeng'helela na kuiduganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">waiduganya wanhu chaka siwamanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">wanitowa bila kuleka.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Wonikwesela ng'hombali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">wanidundila meno yawo.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizagendelela kulola bila kutenda chochose mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Unikombole kulawa kwa wanhu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">na ugima wangu kulawa kwa wanasimba wawo!<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Maabaho nizakwing'ha hewela hagati ya mting'hano mkulu wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">nizakutogoza hagati ya bumbila kulu da wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Sekeuwaleke wehi wangu wanizehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">wanhu wonihila bila chimu, sekewaning'ong'e.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Hawalonga mbuli za tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">mbali wolonga mbuli za uvwizi kusonhela wanhu wahole wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Wonigubulila milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">wolonga, “Ehee! Ehee! Chiwona wenyewo kwa meso yetu.”<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kuiwona mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">sekeunyamale, weye Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">na sekeukale kutali na niye.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Inuka weye Mndewa Mulungu unigombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">wize weye Mndewa Mulungu ulole mbuli yangu muna ichitala.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, unihumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">sekeuwaleke wehi wangu waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Sekeuwaleke walonge, “Chipata vichilondile!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Hebu walonge, “Chimdahula munhu ino!”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Waleke wanhu wodeng'helela magayo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wahumigwe wose na wagwe chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Wawo wose woiwona fana viya wanoga kufosa niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wagumigwe chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Mbali waja wolonda kuwona nabule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">walandule madizi yawo walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">“Mndewa Mulungu mkulu ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">Kolonda msang'hani wake yamwede.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Lulimi lwangu lwizalonga unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">nizalonga nhogolwa zako imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s">Wihi wa munhu na unovu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Nina mbuli kulawa kwa Mulungu kusonhela uhasanyi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">hawamdumba Mulungu mbee.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile woikombakomba wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">wogesa uhasanyi wawo hawizamanyika na kwihiligwa.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Chila chiwolonga muna imilomo yawo ni uvwizi na wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">waleka kuvimanya kukala goya na waleka kutenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Viwogona wogesa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">wokala muna inzila ihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">na hawalema wihi.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">ulondo wako wokwenela mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">waminika wako mbaka kuna yamawingu.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Unovu wako ulinga fana milima mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">kuhumiza kwako kulinga fana vilindi va bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kowakaliza wanhu na wanyama.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Viya viuli mkulu ulondo wako, weye Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">Kowakaliza wanhu wako fana ndege viyokaliza wanage muna yamabawa yake.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Wokwigutizigwa na utajili wa kaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">kowang'wiza kulawa lwanda lwa unovu wako.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Kwaviya weye iyo nzasa na mwanduso wa ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">bung'hulo jako dochitendeza chiwone.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Gendesa ulondo wako kwa waja wokulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">weng'he unovu wako waja weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Sekeutogole weli na magoda wanikwenhukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">hebu wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile waniwinge.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Uko wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">wagwisigwa hasi, hawadaha kwinuka.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahapata sekeugaye</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Sekeugaye kwa ichimu cha wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">sekeuwawonele migongo wabananzi.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Kwaviya wezanyala fana mayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">wezadanganika fana mizugwana muna dizuwa kali.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Muhuwile Mndewa Mulungu na utende mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">muladi ukale muna iisi yonikwing'hile na utemeligwe mate.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Mdeng'helele Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">nayo kezakwing'ha vinhu viulonda muna umoyo wako.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Muleke Mndewa Mulungu yakulongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">muhuwile yeye, nayo kezakutaza.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Kezatenda unovu wako umelemete fana bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">na kuhumiza kwako kwizakuwa fana bung'hulo da zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Humula haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">mgozele kwa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">sekeugaiye wanhu waja wopata muna ugenzi wawo wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">viwodaha kufikiza malungilo yawo yehile.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Sekeuwe na ludoko na sekeuwe na ng'hasiliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">sekeugaye, buleivo kwizatenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">mbali wanhu womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu wezaihazi isi iyoweng'ha.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Lung'hali lusita ludodo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezasegezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">kwizawazahila, mbali hwizawawona.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Wanyendanyenda wezaisola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">wezadeng'helela kwa tindiwalo ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile woilungila mbuli zihile kwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">na wawagegedela meno yawo.<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kowaseka wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwaviya kovimanya uhelelo wawo wahabehi.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wosomola panga na kukwega pinde zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">muladi wawakome ngayengaye na wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawakome weli na ugenzi unogile.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Mbali mapanga yawo yezakwingila muna imizoyo yawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">na pinde zawo zizabenigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Muhavu chinhu chidodo chiyelinacho munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">kufosa vinhu vingi viwelinavo wanhu wengi wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Kwaviya nguvu za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zizabenigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kowataza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu welibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">na uhazi wawo wizakuwa wa siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Lusita lwa wihi luhafika, hawezapata chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">na siku za nzala wezakwiguta.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">wehi wa Mndewa Mulungu wezanyala fana maluwa ya kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">kweli wezasegela fana yosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokwazima bila kubweleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolava bila ya ugila.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Ivo waja watemeligwe mate na Mndewa Mulungu, wezaihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">mbali waja woyawaduwile wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">nayo kolanguliza nzila zawo.<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Yahaikwala hagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu komwamha mkono na kumtaza.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Nikala mbwanga, sambi namulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">sinawona munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile kalekigwa na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hebu wanage kupula ndiya.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Siku zose, munhu ija koweng'ha kwa makono maidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">na wanage wezawatemela mate wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Leka kutenda mbuli zihile na utende mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">muladi ukale muna iisi yako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolonda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">na hawazimiza waminika wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Kowakaliza siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">mbali wana wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezaihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">na wezakala umo siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolonga mbuli za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">na ndimi zawo zohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Malagilizo ya Mulungu wawo yamuna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">nawo hawezaleka nzila za Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wowasepa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">na wozahila nzila ya kuwakoma.<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Mndewa Mulungu hezawaguma wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile muna yamakono ya wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">hebu hezawaleka walongelizigwe vihile msemi vondayahumize.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Muhuwile Mndewa Mulungu na yamha nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">nayo kezakuhishimu na kukwing'ha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">na kwizawawona wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile viwonangigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Nimuwona munhu yotenda mbuli zihile viyowatendela wanhu mbuli za usede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">kaika uchanyha ya wanhu wose fana mibiki mikulu ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Maabaho nifosa baho, hakalile baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">nimzahila, mbali simuwone bule.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Mulole munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile, munhu goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">kuna mbuli zinogile kwa munhu yolonda tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Mbali wahasanyi wose, wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">na welesi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezasegezigwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Ulopozi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">yeye niiyo mtazi wawo lusita lwa magayo.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Mndewa Mulungu kowataza na kuwalopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kowalava muna yamakono ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile na kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwaviya wokimbilila kutazigwa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s">Kupula ulopozi kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi, komulamba Mulungu yamkumbuke.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu sekeunitaguse na ludoko lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">hebu sekeunibwakile kwa ludoko lwako.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Kwaviya misale yako inihoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">na mkono wako unitowa.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Lukuli lwangu loluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwa ichimu cha ludoko lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">Mavuha yangu yotula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Uhasanyi wangu uniyohela fana gombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">uhasanyi wangu ulinga fana mbahasha izamile ng'hani kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Malonda yangu yawola na yatunga ufila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">kwa ichimu cha ubozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Niikonga na niinama ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">nolila imisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Lukuli lwangu luna mawine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">lukuli lwangu lwose lwausungu.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Niwa nyondenyonde na nihondeka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">nogutilila kwa magayo yonilinayo muna umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, magesa yangu yose kuyamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">kuugula kwangu hakuifisile kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Moyo wangu wobigima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">nguvu zangu zimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">meso yangu hayalola goya.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Mbwiya zangu na wayangu wokimbila lemela jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">ndugu zangu wokala kutali na niye.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Waja wolonda kunikoma wotega mitego yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">waja wolonda kunitenda vihile wolonga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">na woilungila mbuli zihile imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Mbali niye sihulika, nilinga fana msuwamagutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">sidaha kulonga nilinga fana bubu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Nilinga fana munhu hahulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">nilinga fana munhu yelibule chochose cha kuigombela.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Mbali nokugozela weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">Mulungu wangu niiyo yondaunidike.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Kwaviya nilonga, “Sekeuwaleke waniseke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">hebu waigode magulu yangu viyotelebuka.”<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Kwaviya sambi niye nogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">usungu wa siku zose wahabehi.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Nolonga mbuli zihile zonitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">nogaya kwa uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Wengi wawa wehi wangu bila chimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">waja wonihila bila chimu wamema.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Waja woniliha mbuli zihile kwa mbuli zinogile zonitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">wonilema kwaviya notenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeunileke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">Mulungu wangu, sekeukale kutali na niye.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uli mulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">wize hima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s">Siku za kuwa mgima ndodo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa Yedusuni</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Nilonga, “Nizalola nzila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">muladi sekenitende uhasanyi kwa lulimi lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahawa habehi na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">nizafudala muladi sekenilonge mbuli ihile.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Mbali nikala silonga fana bubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">ninyamala mbali sipatile muhavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">Manhesa yangu yaiyoha.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Moyo wangu wokwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">moto waka muna ukugesa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">nilonga kwa lulimi lwangu,<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unilaguse uhelelo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">siku zangu za kuwa mgima zisigala nyingahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">nivimanye ugima wangu viukimbila!”<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Humbe kunilingila siku ndodo za kukala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">Ugima wangu si chinhu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">ugima wa chila munhu ulinga fana mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Kweli chila munhu kofosa fana sisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">kuiyoha kwake kose si chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">koduganya vinhu, mbali hamanya yondayavipate!<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Lelo Mndewa Mulungu, nogozela choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Nokuhuwila weye!<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Unikombole muna uuhasanyi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">sekeutogole wabozi waniseke.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Ninyamala, sinula mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">kwaviya weye niiyo unigalile magayo yano.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Unisegezele hulo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">nigwa kwaviya kunitowa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Voumkalikila na kumtagusa munhu yoyose kwa uhasanyi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">kobananga utajili wa munhu iyo fana sondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">Kweli chila munhu ni mhumuzi!<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uhulike vinipula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">utegeleze vonikulamba unitaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Sekeuyehule masozi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">kwaviya niye nyambenyambe wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">niye mfosanzila fana wasaho zangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Uleke kunitagusa muladi nideng'helele ugima kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">ing'hali sinadanganika na kusegela muna iisi.”<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kuzitogoza sang'hano za Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Nimgozela Mndewa Mulungu kwa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">kakinga digutwi vonimulambile yanitaze.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Kanisegeza kulawa hana dikombo digidimile gidigidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kanivabula muna inhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">kanimiza uchanyha ya luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">na kayagangamiza magulu yangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Kanifunza wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">wila wa nhogolwa kwa Mulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">Wanhu wengi wezawona na wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">na wezamuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Kamweda munhu yomuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">munhu ija hailumba na wanhu weli na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">waja wagile kwa kutambikila milungu ya uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">kuchitendela mbuli nyingi za mwazanyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">na vinhu vouilungile kuchitendela havipeteka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">habule yoyose yalingile fana weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">One nidahile kusimulila mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">sigambenidahe kuzipeta.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Nhambiko na nhosa hunogelwe navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">kunitenda nitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">nhambiko za kutimbula na nhosa huvilondile.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Maabaho nilonga, “Nabaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">mbuli zonilondeka kutenda zandikigwa muna ichitabu cha malagilizo.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Nodeng'helela kutenda viulonda weye, Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">kweli lagilizo jako damuna umoyo wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Nilonga mbuli ya ukombola hana umting'hano mkulu wa wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">Niye silekile kuigong'onda mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">fana viumanyile weye, Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Ukombola wouning'hile, siubagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">mbali siku zose nigong'onda kuwa weye ni mkombola mwaminika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Siufisile mting'hano wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo na uwaminika wako.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeunime ubazi wako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">Ubazi wako na waminika wako, vinike goya siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Kwaviya mbuli zihile hazipeteka zinizunguluka niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">uhasanyi wangu woniminya sidaha hata kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">mwingi kufosa nyele zili muna iditwi jangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">Niye nifa moyo.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unogelwe kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Mndewa Mulungu, wize hima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Wanhu woilungila kunikoma wagwe chinyala na wasekigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">waja wolonda nilumile wahumigwe na wapate chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Wanhu wodeng'helela vonihumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">wazanywe kwa chinyala chawo!<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Mbali waja wose wokuzahila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wadeng'helele na watowe ng'henze kwa ichimu chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">Wokulonda kwaviya kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">siku zose walonge, “Mndewa Mulungu mkulu.”<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Niye ngayengaye na nolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu konigesa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Weye niiyo mtazi wangu na mulopozi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">Weye Mulungu wangu, sekeukalame!<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula munhu yeli mtamu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Kamweda munhu ija yomgesa nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">Mndewa Mulungu kezamkombola siku ya magayo.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kezamwamila na kezamkaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">nayo kezapata choyolonda muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Mulungu hezamuleka munhu ija muna yamakono ya wehi wake.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kezamtaza yahawa mtamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">kezamuhonya utamu wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Nilonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, niwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">kwaviya nikuhasanya, unihonye.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Wehi wangu wonilonga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Kezadanganika zuwaki muladi zina jake dizimizigwe?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Wawo wokwiza kunilola wolonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">wozahila mbuli zihile kusonhela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">muladi wahalawa kunze, wawalongele wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Wanhu wose wonihila wonideta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">woilunga kunitendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />Wolonga, “Matamu yano yamnanahila yezamkoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">hezakwinuka kaidi muna dikomwa.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Mbaka mbwiyangu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">yadile hamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">kanibiduka.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu, uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">uning'he muhavu muladi niwalihilizile wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Novimanya kuwa weye kunogelwa na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">kwaviya mwihi wangu haigodela kunihuma.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Weye konitaza kwaviya nolonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">konikwenhusa niwe hamwe na weye siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Yatogozigwe Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">kwandusila umwaka na siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">Ivo! Ivo!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">Chitabu chekaidi</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 42-72">Zabuli 42-72</ref></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula munhu yakimbile kuna iisi yake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli za wana wa Kola kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Fana mhala viyeli na ng'hilu ya kung'wa mazi ya lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">niivo vinikulonda weye, Mulungu!<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Nowona ng'hilu ya Mulungu, Mulungu yeli mgima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">Nizahita kumtambikila zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Masozi yangu yawa ndiya yangu imisi na ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">nouzigwa chila siku, “Vino Mulungu wako kakulihi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Nokumbuka na kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">kwaviya umwaka nihita na lung'husesa lwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">niwalongoza kuhita muna Ikaye ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">kuno wotowa ng'henze za hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">lung'husesa lwa wanhu watenda dugila!<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Vino habali nonyululuka muna umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Habali moyo wangu wosafagila vino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Nizamuhuwila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">nizamwing'ha hewela kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">yeye niiyo Mulungu wangu yonitaza.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Moyo wangu wosafagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">ivo nokukumbuka weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">kulawa Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">kulawa mulima Helimoni na Mizali.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Nigaliligwa gombo da mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">gombo da mazi yeli habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">yotendeza makolongo yamwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Mawimbi yako makulu yanigubika.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kezaniwonela ubazi imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">ichilo nimwimbile wila wa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">nimpule Mulungu yoning'ha ugima.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Nomulongela Mulungu Luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Habali kunizimiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Nogendelela kulila kwaviya wehi wangu wonigaza.”<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Wehi wangu viwoniliga ilinga fana kunihonda mavuha yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">Wonilongela imisi yose, “Mulungu wako kakulihi?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Vino habali nonyululuka muna umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Habali moyo wangu wosafagila vino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Nizamuhuwila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">nizamwing'ha hewela kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">yeye niiyo Mulungu wangu yonitaza.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula munhu yakimbile kuna iisi yake zogendelela</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ulonge kuwa nabule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unigombele na wanhu hawakutambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unikombole kulawa mwa wavwizi na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Weye niiyo Mulungu uli nguvu zangu, habali kunyasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Habali nohita nilongelela kwaviya wehi wangu woniwonela?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Nigalile bung'hulo jako na kweli yako vinilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">vinigale kuna umulima wako welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">mbaka kuna ikaye yako.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Maabaho nizahita kuna ulupango lwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">nizahita kwa Mulungu yonitenda nideng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">nizakutogoza kwa kutowa bango, weye Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Vino habali nonyululuka muna umoyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Habali moyo wangu wosafagila vino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Nizamuhuwila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">nizamwing'ha hewela kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">yeye niiyo Mulungu wangu yonitaza.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s">Kulila kwa kuhumigwa kuna ing'hondo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli za wana wa Kola, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Weye Mulungu, chihulika kwa magutwi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">wasaho zetu wachilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">sang'hano ziuwatendele muna zisiku zawo umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Kuwawinga wanhu wa zisi nyingi kwa nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">hanhu hawo kuweng'ha wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kuzitagusa zisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kuwapwililisa wanhu wako muna izisi izo.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Wanhu wako hawaisolile isi kwa upanga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">na hawahumile kwa makono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">mbali kuwahuma kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kuwa hamwe nawo kwaviya kuwalonda.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Weye ni mfalume wangu, Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">kowatenda welesi wose wa Yakobo wahume.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Kwa nguvu zako chowahuma wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa zina jako chowabojoga waja wose wochitowa.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Sihuwila upinde wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">na panga jangu hadidaha kunilopola.<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Mbali kuchilopola kulawa muna yamakono ya wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">kuwaguma chinyala wanhu wose wochihila.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Chiigodela weye Mulungu imisi na ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">na chizaditogoza zina jako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Mbali sambi kuchileka na kuchiguma chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">huisondelela na mabumbila ya watowang'hondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Kuchitenda chiwakimbile wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">na wanhu wochihila wasola vinhu vetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Kuchitenda fana ng'hondolo wogaligwa kuchinjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">na kuchipwililisa muna izisi zimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Kuwachuuza wanhu wako kwa hela ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">na hupatile chochose chongezeke.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Kuchitenda chiwe chilozo kwa wakaya wayetu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">wochizeha na kuchiseka ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Kuchitenda chehuligwe na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">wanhu wochitingisila yamatwi.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Siku zose nina chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">Chihanga changu cholagusa kuwa nowona chinyala,<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />kwa mbuli zihile za waja woniliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">na wehi wangu na waja wolihiliza.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Mbuli zino zose zichilawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">mbali hachikuzimize weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">na hachibenile lagano jako.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Chikala waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">na hachilekile kuzindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Kuchitowa na kuchileka hanhu howokala mbwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">na kuchileka muna diziza totolo.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />One chidizimiza zina da Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">na kumtambikila mulungu wa uvwizi,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />Mulungu koimanya mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">kwaviya kozimanya mbuli zili muna imizoyo ya wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Kwa ichimu chako chokomigwa chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">chiwa fana ng'hondolo wogaligwa kuchinjigwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Lamuka, weye Mndewa! Habali kugona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Inuka! Sekeuchileme siku zose!<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Habali kofisa chihanga chako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Habali kozimiza vichiwoneligwa na vichibamanyigwa?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Kwaviya chigona chingubingubi muna ditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">ng'huli zetu ziilumba na isi.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Inuka wize uchitaze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">Uchikombole kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza mfalume siku ya dugila jake da sola</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, simwe dinogile da zabuli, yokwimbigwa fana wila utangigwa “Maluwa ya Vibesa,” wila wa ulondo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Moyo wangu wogesa mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">nomulongela wila unogile mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">lulimi lwangu lulinga fana kalamu ya mwandikaji yanogile.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Weye mfalume, kuna chihanga chinogile kufosa wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">na kolonga mbuli zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">Ivo Mulungu kakutemela mate siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Weye uli galu wa ng'hondo, ifunge panga jako hana ichigudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">weye kwa mkulu na kotogozigwa.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Kwela falasi wako na genda kwa udahi wako muladi uhume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">ugombele kwa kuwinza inhululika na kuukaliza ukweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">Mkono wako wa kulume utende mbuli ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Misale yako yokutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">yohoma mizoyo ya wehi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">wanhu wogwa hasi yako.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Weye Mulungu, chigoda chako cha chifalume ni cha siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">kotawala voilondeka na fimbo yako ya chifalume.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Weye kolonda mbuli zinogile na kokwihila mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">ivo Mulungu, Mulungu wako, kakuhaka mavuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">na kakutenda udeng'helele na winuligwe kufosa wayago.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Mawalo yako yonung'hila goya udi na mdalasini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">wembaji wokwimbila muna zikaye zozihambigwa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">wanhu wokudeng'heleza kwa kutowa bango.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Wandele wa wafalume wamwenga wokusang'hanila kwa hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">muke yolonda kusoligwa na mfalume kema ubanzi wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">kaihamba mahambo ya zahabu inogile kulawa uko Ofili.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Weye mndele usoligwa, kinga digutwi utegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">uwazimize wanhu wako na kaye ya tati yako.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Mfalume kezanogelwa na unovu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">Yeye niiyo mwenevale wako, umsang'hanile.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Wanhu wa Tilo wolonda kukunogeza kwa kukugalila vitumetume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">wanhu weli na vinhu vingi wezazahila unovu wako kufosela vitumetume vingi.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Mhambe yosoligwa na mfalume kokwingila muna ikaye ya mfalume kwa kunogeza ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">mawalo yake yahogosigwa kwa singija za zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Kogaligwa kwa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">na mawalo yafumigwe goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">wali wayage wowomsondelela, iviya wahita kwa mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Wezagaligwa kwa deng'ho na ng'henze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">kuno wokwingila muna ikaye ya mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Weye mfalume, welesi wako wezakuwa wafalume fana wasaho zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">kwizawatenda kuwa walangulizi wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Nizaditenda zina jako dikumbukigwe na nyelesi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezakutogoza siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kaubanzi wetu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, wila kwa dizi da wandele</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Mulungu ni kimbililo jetu na nguvu yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">Siku zose kaisasala kuchitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">muna ulusita lose lwa magayo.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Ivo hachizadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">hata one isi yahagudemeka na milima yahatingisika na kugwa muna ibahali,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />hata one mazi yake yahakuluma na kutibuka, milima nayo yahagudemeka ng'hani, hachizadumba.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Lwanda na vizanda vake vowatenda wanhu wa bululu da Mulungu wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">bululu dili na kaye yelile iyokala Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Mulungu kahagati ya bululu, hadizatingisigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">kezaditaza chilochilo.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga woisovula na falume zogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">yeye kolava dizi jake na wanhu wogudemeka kwa kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi Wose kahamwe na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Mulungu wa Yakobo niiyo kimbililo jetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Izoni mulole sang'hano za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">loleni sang'hano zake za kudumbiza ziyatendile muna izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Kokomeleza ng'hondo muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">kobena mhinde na migoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">na kozisoma ngao.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />Mulungu kolonga, “Humuleni, muvimanye kuwa niye Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">Nizatogozigwa na makabila yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">nizatogozigwa muna iisi yose.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi Wose kahamwe na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Mulungu wa Yakobo niiyo kimbililo jetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mfalume wa zisi zose</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli za wana wa Kola, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Mweye wanhu wose toweni mang'huwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">Mtogozeni Mulungu kwa nyila za deng'ho!<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kodumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">yeye ni mfalume wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Kachitenda chiwahume wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">katenda chizitawale zisi.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Kachisagulila isi yochikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">wanhu wa Yakobo woyowalonda Mulungu, woigodela isi iyo.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kakwela na kakala muna ichigoda chake cha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">kuno kotowiligwa ng'henze za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">kuno kotowiligwa mhalati.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Mwimbileni Mulungu wila wa nhogolwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">Mwimbileni Mulungu mfalume wetu nyila za kumtogoza!<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Kwaviya Mulungu ni mfalume wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">mwimbileni wila wa kumtogoza!<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Mulungu ni mfalume yotawala zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">Mulungu kokala muna ichigoda chake chelile cha chifalume.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Walangulizi wa zisi weli wanhu wa Mulungu wa Bulahimu woiduganya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwaviya wafalume wa zisi wekigwa na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">yeye ni mkulu wa kutogoligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s">Sayuni bululu da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli za wana wa Kola</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mkulu na kolondeka yatogoligwe ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">yatogozigwe muna dibululu jake na muna umulima wake welile.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Sayuni mulima mtali wa Mulungu ulinga fana mulima Zafoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">bululu kulu da mfalume, dowatenda wanhu wa zisi zose wadeng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Mulungu kozikaliza mhongono zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">yeye kowakaliza vinogile wanhu wa bululu ijo.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Wafalume wamwenga waiduganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">weza wose hamwe kuditowa bululu diya.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Mbali viwadiwone bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">wazanywa na wakimbila.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Wadumba ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">fana muke yolumwa usungu.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Wadumba fana waja wohembelusigwa na beho da ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">dozibena meli ng'hulu za Talishishi.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Fana vichihulike, ivo vichiwonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">muna dibululu da Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi Wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">muna dibululu da Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">diya dondayadigangamize Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Weye Mulungu wetu, muna ikaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">chougesa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Fana vidili kulu zina jako, weye Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">niivo ili nhogolwa yako mbaka uhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">kotawala voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Mulima Sayuni wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">mabululu ya Yuda yosekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">kwa ichimu cha kuhumiza kwako.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Gendeni Sayuni mkadizinge bululu diya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">peteni malingo yake.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Ziloleni ng'huta zake vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">na muzipelembe mhongono zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">mudahe kuwalongela welesi wenu ukwiza.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Kwaviya niivo yeli Mulungu, Mulungu wetu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">kezakuwa mulangulizi wetu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s">Ubozi wa kuhuwila vinhu kufosa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli za wana wa Kola kwa mulangulizi wa nyila.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Mweye wanhu wose tegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">kingeni yamagutwi mweye wanhu womukala muna izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />Mweye wanhu wose tegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">tajili na ngayengaye.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Mulomo wangu wolonga mbuli za kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">na magesa yangu yana umanyi.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Nokinga digutwi jangu nitegeleze simwe za kuvimanya kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">na kufambula mbuli yangu ifisike kwa wila wa bango.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Habali nidumbe lusita lwa magayo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">Habali niwadumbe wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile viwonizinga?<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wohuwila utajili wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">na woigodela vinhu vawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Habule munhu yodaha kumkombola ndugu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">hebu kumuliha Mulungu kwa ichimu cha ndugu yake.<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />Maliho ya ugima ni makulu ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">Hadaha kulava chinhu chochose chochifaya,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />muladi yawe mgima siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">na sekeyadanganike.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Chovimanya kuwa hata wabala wodanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">iviya wabozi na mambunye wokwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">na kuwalekela wamwenga vinhu vawo.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Wezadanganika, maabaho maleme yezakuwa kaye zawo na kaye za nyelesi zawo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">mbali umwaka wakala na isi yawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Munhu hezakala na vinhu vake siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">mbali kalinga fana wanyama wofa.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Mbuli zino zowalawilila wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">na wose wowotogola mbuli zawo za ubozi.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Wezalongozigwa fana ng'hondolo mbaka kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">wezalongozigwa na ifa fana mdimi viyolongoza ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">wanhu wanogile wezawatawala imitondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">Ng'huli zawo zizawolela mudileme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">kutali na kaye zawo za kuigodela.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Mbali Mulungu kezanikombola kulawa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">kwaviya kezanihokela.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Sekeumdumbe munhu yahawa na vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">lusita vinhu va kaye yake vondavongezeke.<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Kwaviya vondayadanganike hezasola chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">utajili wake hawizamsondelela mudileme.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Viyakalile mgima kailongela mwenyewo, “Nimweda,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na wanhu womtogoza kwa mbuli zinogile ziyatendile,<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />mbali kezailumba na wasaho zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">hezawona bung'hulo kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Munhu yeli na utajili bila kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">kalinga fana wanyama wofa.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya kweli</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kowatanga wanhu wokala muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">kwandusila ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Bung'hulo da Mulungu domwemwesa kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">kudibululu dinogile da Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Mulungu wetu kokwiza kwa dizi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">moto mkulu ng'hani womulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">na vulavumbi domzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Mulungu kowatanga wasenga wa kuulanga na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">muladi wawe wasindila viyowahumiza wanhu wake.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Mulungu kolonga, “Niduganyileni wanhu wangu wokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">waja wowatendile lagano na niye kwa nhambiko ya kutimbula!”<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Ulanga wogong'onda unovu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">kwaviya yeye niiyo yohumiza!<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />“Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wangu, nizalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Weye Isilaili, nizakulongeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Niye iyo Mulungu, Mulungu wako.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Siwakalikila mweye kwa ichimu cha nhambiko zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">hebu nhambiko zenu za kutimbula, zimugendelela kunilavila.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Siwalonda ng'ombe walume kulawa muna yamabumba yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">hebu luti kulawa muna ivikwama venu.<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />Kwaviya wanyama wose wa kumbago ni wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">na ng'ombe wa vilima elufu ni wangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Nowamanya ndege wose kuna imilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">na vilumbe va kumbago ni vangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />One niwile na nzala sigambenimulongeleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwaviya isi yose ni yangu, vose viliumo ni vangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Vino niye noja nyama ya ng'ombe walume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">hebu nong'wa damu ya luti?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Hewela iwe nhambiko yenu kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">mfikizileni vilaho venu Mulungu Yeli Kuchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Muhagaya nipuleni niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">nizawalopola na mwizanihishimu.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Mbali Mulungu komulongela munhu yotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">“Habali kogong'onda malagilizo yangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">Habali kolonga mbuli za lagano jangu?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Weye kolema kuzumigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">na mbuli zangu kozasa kuchisogo.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Uhamuwona mbavi koilumba nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">na weye koilumba na wagoni.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Kuuleka mulomo wako ulonge mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">na lulimi lwako lolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Komulonga vihile ndugu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">na komulongeleza uvwizi sekulu wako mwenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Vino niivo viutendile, niye ninyamala hupi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">kugesa kuwa niye nilinga fana weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">Mbali nizakukalikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">nizakulongeleza kwa mbuli izo zose.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />“Geseni goya mbuli ino, mweye womumzimize Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">buleivo nizawatula vihandehande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">na habule munhu yondayamulopoleni.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Munhu yolava hewela fana nhambiko yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">iyo konihishimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">na yoyosondelela nzila inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">nizamulopola.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kulekelelwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kusonhela lusita mulotezi Nasani viyamgendele Daudi, viya Daudi viyamalile kumbandama Besisheba</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Mulungu, niwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">na kwa ichimu cha ubazi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">usegeze uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Usegeze ubananzi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">na unisafye uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Kwaviya niumanya ubananzi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">na sidaha kuzimiza uhasanyi wangu lusita lose.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Nikuhasanya weye wiidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">nitenda mbuli zihile haulongozi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">Ulamuzi wako ugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">kohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Niye muhasanyi kwandusila vinyelekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">namuhasanyi kwandusila ning'hali munda mwa mami yangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Weye konogelwa na ukweli wili mgati mwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">lelo nifundize ubala muna umoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Nisafye kwa mfumbasi muladi nyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">nisunhe muladi niwe mzelu fana pamba.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Unitende nihulike deng'ho na ng'henze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">mavuha yangu youhondile yadeng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Uchifise chihanga chako sekeulole uhasanyi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">na usegeze ubananzi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Weye Mulungu, unilumbile moyo welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">na wike moyo ugangamale mgati yangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Sekeunyase kutali na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">sekeunisegezele Muhe wako Yelile.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Unibwelezele deng'ho da ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">unitende nilonde kutegeleza na unidahize.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Maabaho nizawafunza wahasanyi malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">nawo wezabwela kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Unikombole na ubananzi wa kwitila damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">weye Mulungu wa ukombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">na mulomo wangu wizakwimba unovu wako.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unidahize kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">mulomo wangu uzilonge nhogolwa zako.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Kwaviya weye hunogelwa na nhambiko, one siivo nihakulavile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">hulonda nhambiko za kutimbula.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Nhambiko zimnogeza Mulungu ni kuinyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">weye Mulungu, hulema munhu yosama.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Uditendele mbuli zinogile bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uzigangamize ng'huta za bululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Baho kwizanogelwa na nhambiko zilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">hamwe na nhambiko zetu za kutimbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">ng'ombe walume wezalavigwa nhambiko hana ulupango lwako.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kotagusa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kusonhela Doegi Mwedomu viyamulongele Sauli kuwa Daudi kahita kumulola Ahimeleki</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Weye munhu wili na nguvu, habali koigodela mbuli zihile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Ulondo wa Mulungu wa kufunya umoyo wabaho siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Chila lusita weye kogesa kudanganiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">lulimi lwako lulinga fana mwele ukutwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">Kogesa kulonga mbuli za uvwizi muhala.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Kolonda mbuli zihile kufosa zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">na kulonga uvwizi kufosa ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Kolonda mbuli zose za kwagiza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">na kolonda mbuli za kuwalumiza wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Ivo Mulungu kezakunanga ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kezakusegeza na kukugandula muna dihema jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">kezakung'ola muna iisi ya weli wagima.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezawona na wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">wezamseka na wezalonga,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Muloleni munhu ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">yeye halondile Mulungu yawe mhongono yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">mbali kahuwila utajili wake uyaupatile kwa kuwananga wamwenga.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Mbali niye nilinga fana mzaituni mbisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">woukula muna Ikaye ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">Nohuwila ulondo wa Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Weye Mulungu, nizakutogoza siku zose kwa chiya chiutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">nizadigong'onda zina jako hana iwanhu wokwaminika, kwaviya dinoga.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s">Munhu hamtambikila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila kwa kufundiza, yokwimbigwa kwa luholozi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Wabozi wolonga muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">“Habule Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Wose waga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">na wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">habule munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Mulungu kowalola wanhu kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">muladi yawone fana kuna munhu yoyose yeli na ubala yomtambikila yeye.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Mbali chila munhu kahasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">wose waga hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">habule munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">habule hata imwe.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Vino wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawavimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Wowatowa wanhu wa Mulungu na hawampula.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Baho wodumba ng'hani hanhu heli siyo ha kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwaviya Mulungu kayapwililisa mavuha ya wehi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">Kuwaguma chinyala kwaviya Mulungu kawalema.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Ukombola wa Isilaili ulawe Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Mulungu vondayawabweleze wanhu wake wafungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">welesi wa Yakobo wizadeng'helela na Waisilaili wezasekelela.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kokombola</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kusonhela lusita wanhu kulawa Zifi viwamulongele Sauli kuwa Daudi kaifisa kumwawo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Weye Mulungu unilopole kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">na unihumize kwa nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Weye Mulungu, tegeleza chonipula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">uhulike mbuli zonilonga.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Wanhu siwamanyile wanitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wasede wonizahila wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">wanhu wonizahila hawamtegeleza Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Kweli Mulungu unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">Mndewa Mulungu unilolese.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Uwalihe wehi wangu kwa mbuli zihile zowanitendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">uwanange kwa waminika wako.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Mndewa Mulungu nizakulavila nhosa ya kulonda mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">weye Mndewa Mulungu, nizaditogoza zina jako kwaviya dinoga.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Kwaviya kunilopola muna yamagayo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">na meso yangu yalola wehi wangu viwahumigwe.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula munhu yogaya</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa via va nyila vili na lusingija</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Weye Mulungu, utegeleze chonikupula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">Sekewehule mbuli yangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Nolamba unitegeleze na unidike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">Nilegela kuiyalala,<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />kwa ichimu cha mbuli ziwolonga wehi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Wehi wangu wonigaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Woniwonela ludoko na wonihila.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Moyo wangu wobigima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">nodumba kudanganika.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Nodumba na nogudemeka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">moyo wangu wodunda.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Nilonga, “One nihawile na mabawa fana huwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">nihaguluke nihite kutali nikahumule.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />One nihitile kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">na kukala kuchuwala,<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />nihalopole kuzahila hanhu ha kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">muladi nidikimbile beho kulu na vulavumbi.”<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwazaganye wehi wangu na utibule ulonzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">kwaviya niwona usede na ndwagi muna dibululu.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Wozunguluka muna zing'huta za bululu ijo imisi na ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">wihi na magayo vamuna dibululu ijo.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Tibwilitibwili damuna dibululu ijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">ubamanyi na mbuli zihile vokala muna yamagulilo yake.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Yaniligile siyo mwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">one iwile ivo, nihafunyile umoyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">Yainule kumwangu siyo ija yonihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">one iwile ivo, nihaifisile sekeyaniwone.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Mbali niiyo weye, munhu fana niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">miyangu na mbwiyangu ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Chizowela kulonga zimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">vichiilongoze na wamwenga kuhita kuna Ikaye ya Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Leka ifa iwapate wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">wahumuluke kuzimu wang'hali wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwaviya wamema wihi muna imizoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Niye nomtanga Mndewa Mulungu yanitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">nayo kezanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Imitondo na imisi na ichigulogulo, nolila kwa kuiyalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">nayo kodihulika dizi jangu.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Konilopola muna ing'hondo inilinayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">inilungiligwe niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">ingawa wanhu wengi wonitowa.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Mulungu yotawala siku zose kezanitaza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kezanihulika na kuwatagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">wanhu waja hawagalula ugenzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">na hawamdumba Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Miyangu kagolosa makono kuwatowa mbwiya zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">kabena lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Mbuli zake zoguma mulile fana uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mbali magesa yake yogala ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">Mbuli zake zotelebuka fana mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mbali zokanha fana mwele ukutwa.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Umulekele Mndewa Mulungu magayo yako, nayo kezakutaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">kezamtenda munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile yagangamale.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Weye Mulungu kwizawahulumusa kuzimu wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Wanhu wolonda kukoma na wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">siku zawo za kuwa wagima zizahunguzigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Mbali niye nizakuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s">Kumuhuwila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kusonhela lusita Daudi viyagwiligwe na Wafilisiti uko Gasi, kwimbiligwa fana wila utangigwa, “Huwa wa kutali yonyamala hupi”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Weye Mulungu uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwaviya wehi wangu wonigaza siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">wonibamanya imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Wehi wangu wonisondelela imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">na wanhu wengi wonitowa.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Nihadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">nizakuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Nizaitogoza mbuli ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Nomuhuwila Mulungu, ivo sizadumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Munhu kezanitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Imisi yose wogalula mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">lusita lose woilungila kunitendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Woiting'hana na woifisa na wolola monifosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">kwaviya wanisepa muladi wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Weye Mulungu uwalihe kwa wihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">uwanange wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kwa ludoko lwako.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Yandika manhesa yonili nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">yeke goya masozi yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Vino yano hayeli muna ichitabu chako cha lukumbuso?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Maabaho wehi wangu wezabwela kuchisogo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">siku vondanikutange unitaze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Lelo novimanya kuwa Mulungu kaubanzi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Kwa kutazigwa na Mulungu nizaitogoza mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">kwa kutazigwa na Mndewa Mulungu nizaitogoza mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Nomuhuwila Mulungu, ivo sizadumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Munhu kezanitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Weye Mulungu, nizatenda fana viniilahile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">nizakulavila nhambiko zangu za hewela.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Kwaviya kunikombola kulawa muna iifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">hunilekile niikwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">muladi nigende haulongozi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">hana dibung'hulo dodigala ugima.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kokombola</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila yokwimbigwa fana wila wotangigwa “Sekeunange” kusonhela haja Daudi viyamkimbile Sauli na kuifisa muna dituka</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Uniwonele ubazi, weye Mulungu, uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kwaviya nokukimbilila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">nizakimbilila hana disisila da mabawa yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">mbaka vulavumbi da kunanga vondadifose.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Nompula Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Mulungu yofikiza malungilo yake kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Kezagala utazi kulawa kuulanga na kunilopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">kowakalikila waja woniwinza habehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Mulungu kezagendelela kunilonda na kuwa mwaminika kumwangu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Wehi wangu wonizinga fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">nigona hagati ya wanhu wano walingile fana wanyama weli na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">meno yawo yalinga fana migoha na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">milimi yawo ilinga fana mwele ukutwa.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Uhishimigwe weye Mulungu uli kuchanyha ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">Ukulu wako wenele chila hanhu.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Wehi wanitegela lwavu wanigwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">nifa moyo kwa ichimu cha uzidilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">Nidulisigwa hasi na manhesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">wanihimbila kombo muna inzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">mbali wadumbukila wawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Weye Mulungu, moyo wangu haudumba chinhu, moyo wangu haudumba chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">Nizakwimba na kudeng'helela kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Lamka, muhe wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Lamka bango na chinubi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Nizailamsa chilochilo kwa wila wangu!<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Weye Mulungu, nizakwing'ha hewela hagati ya wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">nizakwimbila nhogolwa hagati ya wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Ulondo wako mkulu umema mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">uwaminika wako umema mbaka kuna yamawingu.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Utogozigwe weye Mulungu uli kuchanyha ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">Ukulu wako wenele chila hanhu.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu msemi wa wasemi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, yokwimbigwa fana wila wotangigwa “Sekeubanange.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Mweye watawala, vino mohumiza viilondeka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Vino vomuhumiza wanhu, mogolosa zimbuli?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Mogesa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">mweye wenyewo motenda usede muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile kwandusila viwelekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">kwandusila mwiizinda za mami zawo, wawa watatali na wolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Wana sumu fana sumu ya zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">wasuwamagutwi fana zoka hadidaha kuhulika,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />diya hadihulika dizi da waganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">ingawa wotenda uganga vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Weye Mulungu ubene yameno muna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">weye Mndewa Mulungu ubene meno yawo yalingile fana meno yokutwa ya simba!<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Wage fana mazi yonyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">wahalinga shabaha misale yawo iwe midugi.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Wawe fana kola voyofa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">wadanganike fana wimo ulawile.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Uwasegeze himahima fana miwa viihembelusigwa yahamala kukanhigwa.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezadeng'helela wahawona wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wotagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezabojoga nyayo zawo muna idamu ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Wanhu wezalonga, “Kweli, wotenda mbuli zinogile wopata gweko!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">Kweli Mulungu kabaho yohumiza zisi zose.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukalizigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kusonhela lusita Sauli viyawatumile wanhu kumsepa Daudi ukaye yake muladi wamkome</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Mndewa Mulungu unilopole na wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unikalize na waja wolonda kunitowa.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Unilopole na waja wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">unilopole na waja wokoma wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, lola wonisepa muladi wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">wasede wonitendela mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">Niye siwabanange na sitendile uhasanyi.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Siwabanange chinhu, mbali waisasala kunitowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">Inuka unitaze, ulole mbuli zozilawilila.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Uli na Udahi, Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">inuka weye mwenyewo uwataguse wanhu wa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Sekeuwawonele ubazi wanhu woja kuno na kuno.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Wokwiza chila ichigulogulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">wobwaka fana zimbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">na wowegela muna dibululu.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Lola, muna imilomo yawo molawa maligo muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">mbuli zawo zokanha fana panga dikutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">mbali wogesa habule yowahulika.<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu kowaseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">kowehula wanhu wawo wose.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Weye uli nguvu yangu, nizakulola weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">weye Mulungu niiyo mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">weye niiyo Mulungu younilonda.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Mulungu wangu yonilonda kezanilopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">Nayo kezatenda niwasekelele waja wonilonga mbuli za uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Sekeuwakome himahima, buleivo wanhu wangu wezazimiza viya viuwatagusa wehi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu kingilo jetu, uwapwililise kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">na hamwande uwanange.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Kwaviya wawo wohasanya kwa mbuli zowolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">na mbuli zawo za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">ivo wanamate muna yamagoda yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">kwa ichimu cha kuduwila kwawo na mbuli zawo za uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />Uwanange kwa ludoko lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">uwasegeze sekewawe wagima kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">muladi wanhu wose wavimanye kuwa weye Mulungu kotawala welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">kotawala mbaka kuuhelelo wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Wokwiza chila ichigulogulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">wobwaka fana zimbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">na wozunguluka muna dibululu.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Wowegela wozahila ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">na one haweguta, wobwaka fana zimbwa.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Mbali niye nizakwimba nhogolwa za nguvu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">nizakwimbila wila wa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">kwaviya weye niiyo mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">nokukimbilila lusita lwa manhesa.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Weye uli nguvu yangu, nizakwimbila wila wa nhogolwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Weye Mulungu niiyo mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">weye niiyo Mulungu younilonda.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s">Uhumi uhamala kuhumigwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, wila uno usang'haniligwa kufundiza. Zabuli kusonhela lusita Daudi viyaitowile ng'hondo na Washami wa Zoba na Washami wa Nahalaimu na Yoabu viyabwelile kuchisogo na kuwakoma wanhu 12,000 muna Dibawe da Munyu.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Weye Mulungu, kuchasa na kuchipwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">kukala na ludoko na cheye, mbali sambi uchibwelele.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Kuigudemeza isi na kuitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">uhahonye hanhu hatulike, kwaviya yogudema.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Kuchitenda cheye wanhu wako chigaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">mbaka hachidaha kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Kwinula bendela muladi kuwalongoza wanhu waja wokuhishimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">na wadahe kuyepula misale ya wehi.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Uchikombole na uchitaze kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">muladi wanhu wouwalonda walopoligwe.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Mulungu kalonga kulawa hanhu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Nizaigola isi ya Shekemu kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">nizadilinga bawe da Sukosi.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Isi ya Gileadi yangu na isi ya Manase yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">isi ya Efulaimu niijo kingilo da ditwi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">isi ya Yuda niiyo fimbo yangu ya utawala.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Isi ya Moabu yonisang'hanila fana ziga da kunawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">nizayasila isi ya Edomu chilatu changu kulagusa kuwa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">nodeng'helela kupotigwa kwa Filisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Yelihi yondayanigale kuna dibululu dili na mhongono?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Yelihi yondayanilongoze mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Vino weye Mulungu huchilemile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Huhita kaidi na watowang'hondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Uchitaze chihaitowa na wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">kwaviya kutazigwa na wanhu hakufaya chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Mulungu yahawa na cheye, chizahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">na kezawahonda wehi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s">Kumpulila mfalume</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila na via va nyila vili na singija</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Mulungu, uihulike ndilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">unidike vinikupula.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Nokutanga kulawa uhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">nokulamba kuno moyo wangu woyangaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">Unilongoze nifike muna uluwe wonikaliza na gombo.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Kwaviya weye niiyo kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">mhongono yangu igangamale kwa wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Nolonda kukala muna ikaye yako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">muladi nikale goya fana kinda vidikala hasi ya mabawa ya mami yake.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Kwaviya weye Mulungu, kuhulika vilaho vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">kunitemela mate fana viuwatemele mate wanhu wodidumba zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Mongezele mfalume siku za kuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">miyaka yake kwa nyelesi nyingi.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Yakale haulongozi wako weye Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">uchilolese vinogile kwa ulondo wako na waminika wako fana voulongile.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Ivo lusita lose nizadimbila nhogolwa zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">na kufikiza vilaho vangu chila siku.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s">Muhuwile Mulungu muhala</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa Yedusuni</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Muhe wangu womgozela Mulungu yaidumwe chihupihupi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">ukombola wangu wolawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Yeye yaidumwe niiyo luwe lwangu na ulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">yeye niiyo mhongono yangu, sizagudemeka.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Mwizanitowa mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">Vino mweye mose mwizanitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">fana motowa ng'huta iyeguke na luwa luinamile?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Wailungila kumgwisa munhu goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">wodeng'helela mbuli za uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">Wotemela mate kwa mbuli zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mbali woduwila muna imizoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Muhe wangu uhumule vonimgozela Mulungu yaidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">huwilo jangu dolawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Yeye yaidumwe niiyo luwe lwangu na ulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">yeye niiyo mhongono yangu, sizagudemeka.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Ulopozi wangu na hishima yangu volawa kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">yeye niiyo luwe lwangu ugangamale na kimbililo jangu.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Mweye wanhu muhuwileni yeye siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">mgubulileni yeye mizoyo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">kwaviya Mulungu niiyo kimbililo jetu.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Wanhu wose walinga fana mhumuzi muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wose, wakulu kwa wadodo, hawafaya chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">Wahalingigwa nzamo, wose wahuha kufosa mhumuzi.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Sekemuhuwile ubamanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">na sekemuvihuwile vinhu vimubawile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Vinhu venu vihongezeka, sekemuvihuwile.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Mulungu kalonga miyanza mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">na niye nihulika kuwa Mulungu kana udahi,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />na kana ulondo wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">kwaviya komuliha chila munhu kwa chiya chiyasang'hane.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s">Kumgelegeza Mulungu kuchuwala</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi, kusonhela lusita viyakalile kuchuwala uko Yuda</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Weye Mulungu, niiyo Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nokuzahila kwa moyo wangu wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">Muhe wangu wokugesa ng'hani fana munhu yeli na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">ng'hilu fana isi inyalile ilibule mazi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Nikuwona hana ihanhu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">na niuwona udahi wako na ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Kwaviya ulondo wako wofaya ng'hani kufosa ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">nizakutogoza kwa mulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Nizakutogoza siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">nizayenula makono yangu kukutogoza na kukupula.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Niye nizadeng'helela fana kwiguta ndiya zili na mavuta na zinonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">mulomo wangu wokutogoza kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Nokukumbuka muna dikomwa jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">nokugesa weye ichilo chose,<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />kwaviya weye niiyo mtazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">nokwimba kwa deng'ho kwaviya novimanya na hanhu haholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">fana viya kinda da hasi ya mabawa ya mami yake.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Moyo wangu woilumba na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">na mkono wako wa kulume wonitaza.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Wanhu wolonda kunikoma wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">wezakwingila kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Wezakomigwa kwa upanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">wezadigwa na mbwizi.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Mbali mfalume kezamdeng'helela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">wanhu wose woilaha kwa zina da Mulungu, wezamtogoza Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">kwaviya milomo ya wavwizi izafudazwa.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kohumiza voilondeka</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Mulungu, tegeleza vonilongelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">ukalize ugima wangu na ukimilile chowailungila wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Unike kutali na malungilo yafisike ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">na unifise kutali na tibwilitibwili za wabananzi.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Mbuli zawo zokanha fana mapanga yokutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">na mbuli zawo za usede zohoma fana misale.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Maabaho kulawa hanhu howaifisile, womtowa munhu yelibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">womtowa kwa kusinhukila bila kudumba.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Waigangamiza muna zimbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">waitogolela hanhu ha kufisa mitego yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">Wolonga, “Yelihi yondayaiwone?<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Wailunga kuwatendela wanhu usede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Wagesa mbuli iwailungile izalawilila.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Ukweli lungilo da moyo wa munhu hadimanyika.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Mbali Mulungu kezawapigisila misale yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">wezalumizigwa kwa kusinhukila.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Wezanangigwa kwa chiya chiwalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">wanhu wose wondawawawone wezatingisa matwi.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Maabaho wanhu wose wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">wezaigong'onda sang'hano ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na kuzigesa sang'hano zake.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezamdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu na kumkimbilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">Wose weli na moyo unogile wezamtogoza yeye!<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nhogolwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi na wila kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Weye Mulungu wing'higwe nhogolwa uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">wanhu wezakufikizila vilaho vawo.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Kwaviya weye kochidika vochipula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">Wanhu wose wezakwiza kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Vichifa moyo kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">weye kochilihila wihi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Wamweda waja wose wouwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">na kuwagala habehi wakale muna uluwa lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">Vinhu vinogile muna ikaye yako yelile vochifaya.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Kwa sang'hano zako ng'hulu, kochidika voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">weye Mulungu wouchilopola cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">wanhu wose wokuhuwila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">wowokala zisi zose na kutali mwa bahali.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Kulumba milima kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">weye kuna nguvu ng'hani!<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Konyamaza msindo wa bahali na mawimbi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">na kozifudaliza nyangi za wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wokwazanywa kwa sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">zogala deng'ho chila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kwandusila ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Weye koilolesa goya isi kwa kuigalila mvula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Koutenda ulongo unoge na chondachihandigwe chikule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Mifulunda ya Mulungu yofakula mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">koitenda isi ipate ndiya ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Ivo niivo vousasala isi.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Mvula yotonya muna imigunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuitapagiza kwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">isi yotonyiligwa mawaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuitemela mate mibiki isuke.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Kuutenda mwaka unoge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">chila haufosele hamema mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Kohatonyela hanhu ha kudimila kuchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">kulagusa vilima vimema deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Hanhu ha kudimila hamema ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">mabawe yamema ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">chila chinhu chodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">mabawe yokwimba wila.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu katenda mbuli ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli na wila kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Mweye wanhu wose mdeng'heleleni Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Imbeni ukulu wa zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">mwing'heni nhogolwa!<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Mulongeleni Mulungu, “Sang'hano zako za mwazanyo ng'hani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Wehi wako wogubika meso yawo haulongozi wako, kwa ichimu cha nguvu zako ng'hulu ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wezakutumbalila mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">na wezakwimbila nyila za kukutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">nyila za kuditogoza zina jako.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Izoni mulole mbuli ziyatendile Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">kawatendela wanhu mbuli za mwazanyo.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Kayanyaza mazi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">wanhu waloka bahali kwa magulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Ivo chimdeng'helele yeye uko.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Kotawala siku zose kwa udahi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">meso yake yolola zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">wadugi sekewaigodele.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Mweye wanhu wose mtogozeni Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">gong'ondeni nhogolwa zake zihulikike.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Yeye kaching'ha ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">na hachilekile chigwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Kwaviya weye Mulungu kuchigeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kuchisafya fana zahabu viifosela muna umoto.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Kuchigala muna ulwavu muladi chinamate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">na kuchipapiza mbahasha izamile muna imigongo yetu.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Kuwaleka wakwelafalasi wachibojoge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">chifosela muna umoto na muna yamazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">mbali sambi kuchigala hanhu hanogile.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Nizakwiza muna ikaye yako na nhambiko ya kutimbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">nizatenda fana viniilahile,<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />viniilahile kwa mulomo wangu mwenyewo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">vinikalile muna yamagayo.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Nizakulavila nhambiko za kutimbula za wanyama wanenehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nhambiko za kutimbula za mabebelu ya ng'hondolo zizakunung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nizalava ng'ombe walume na mabebelu ya luti.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Izoni mutegeleze, mweye wose womumdumba Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">nizalonga mbuli ziyanitendele.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Kwa mulomo wangu, nimpula yanitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">nimtogoza kwa lulimi lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />One nigesile mbuli zihile muna umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Mndewa sigambeyanihulike.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Mbali Mulungu kanihulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">kahulika dizi jangu vonimpulile.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Mulungu yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwaviya halemile chonimpulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">na halekile kunilonda.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa zisi zose wamtogoze Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli na wila ukwimbigwa kwa via va nyila vili na singija, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Mulungu yachiwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">na yachitendele mbuli zinogile,<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />muladi nzila zako weye Mulungu zimanyike muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">na ulopozi wako umanyike kwa wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Wanhu wakutogoze weye Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">wanhu wa zisi zose wakutogoze weye.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wadeng'helele na kwimba kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwaviya kohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">na kowalongoza wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Wanhu wakutogoze weye Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">wanhu wa zisi zose wakutogoze weye!<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Isi ilava ndiya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, kochitemela mate.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Mulungu yagendelele kuchitemela mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">na wanhu wa zisi zose wezamdumba yeye.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kuhuma</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Mulungu yenuke, wehi wake wapwililike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">waja womwihila wakimbile na kuhumigwa!<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Fana yosi viditimuka na beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">niivo viyowasegeza wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">fana uhula viulumbuka muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">niivo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile vondawatakamile haulongozi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wadeng'helele haulongozi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wezatowa ng'henze kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Mwimbileni Mulungu, mwimbileni nhogolwa ya zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">mwimbileni wila yeye yokwela kuna yamawingu fana wanhu viwokwela falasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">Zina jake Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">ivo deng'heleleni haulongozi wake.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Tata wa wachiwa, ndolezi wa wagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">niiyo Mulungu yokala hanhu helile.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Wanhu welibule wanhu wa kukala nawo, Mulungu koweng'ha wanhu wa kukala nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">kowalekela wafungwa wailegehe na koweng'ha chiwolonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">Mbali wanhu womuleka Mulungu wokala muna iisi ilibule mvula.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Weye Mulungu, viuwalongolele wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">viufosile kuchuwala,<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />isi igudemeka, ulanga ulagaza mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">haulongozi wa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">haulongozi wa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Weye Mulungu kugala mvula nyingi muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">isi youweng'hile Waisilaili viilegele, kuitenda iwe na ulongo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Wanhu wako wakala uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">na weye Mulungu, kwa ubazi wako kuweng'ha ngayengaye mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Mndewa kolonga mbuli zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">na wanaake wogong'onda mbuli izo ni bumbila kulu.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Wolonga, “Wafalume na watowang'hondo wawo wokimbila!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Wanaake weli ukaye wogola vinhu vihokigwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Wamwenga wagona muna ivikwama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">mbali wapata nyang'hiti za mabawa ya nziwa yagubikigwe na hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">na machipilo yawo yomelemeta zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Mulungu yeli na udahi viyawapwililise wafalume muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">seluji ilagala kuna umulima Salimoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Mulima wa Mulungu, mulima Bashani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">mulima mtali, mulima Bashani,<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />weye mulima mtali, habali kouwonela migongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">mulima uyasagule Mulungu yakale uchanyha yake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Mndewa Mulungu kezakala uko siku zose!<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Hamwe na maelufu na maelufu ya matololi ya Mulungu ya kubululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Mndewa kokwiza kulawa mulima Sinai mbaka hanhu hake helile.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Viyakwelile kuchanyha ya mulima kasola mateka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">kahokela gweko kulawa kwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">mbaka kulawa kwa wanhu watatali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kokala uko.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Mndewa Mulungu, yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">yeye kochipapila mbahasha zetu chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Yeye iyo Mulungu yochilopola miyanza mingi.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Mulungu wetu ni Mulungu yolopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">yeye Mndewa Mulungu kanazo nzila za kuibanga na ifa.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Mbali Mulungu kezayahonda matwi ya wehi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">kezayahonda madosi yeli na nyele ya wanhu waja wogendelela kutenda uhasanyi.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Nizawasola wehi wenu kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">nizawasola kulawa vilindi va bahali,<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />muladi mubojoge damu yawo kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">na zimbwa zenu zipate ndiya.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Weye Mulungu, wanhu wawona viugenda kwa uhumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">weye Mulungu, mfalume wangu, viugenda mbaka hanhu hako helile.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Wembaji wolongola, wotowa via va nyila wokala kuchisogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">hagati wandele wotowa vigoma.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />“Mtogozeni Mulungu hana umting'hano wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye welesi wa Isilaili!”<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Kabila dodo da Benyamini jandusa kuwalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">maabaho wandewa wa Yuda na bumbila jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">maabaho wandewa wa Zabuloni na Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Weye Mulungu, lagusa udahi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">udahi ukutendeze kutenda sang'hano ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Kwa ichimu cha kaye yako iliuko Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">wafalume wezakugalila vitumetume.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Uwakalikile wehi wako waja fana wanyama wa kumbago wokala muna dilamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">na fana bumbila da mabebelu na ng'ombe walume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">mbaka wanhu wa zisi izo wakwing'he hewela na wakugalile hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Uwapwililise wanhu wolonda kuitowa ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Wasenga wezakwiza kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Wakushi wezamgalila Mulungu vinhu vawo.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Mwimbileni Mulungu, mweye falume za isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">mwimbileni nhogolwa Mndewa Mulungu,<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />mwimbileni yeye yokwela kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">ulanga wa umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">Yeye yobuma kwa msindo mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Gong'ondeni udahi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">ukulu wake wowoneka muna iisi ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">na udahi wake wolagusigwa kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Mulungu ni wa kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">kulawa helile hake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Niiyo Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">koweng'ha wanhu wake nguvu na udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, yokwimbigwa fana wila woutangigwa, “Maluwa ya vibesa.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Mulungu unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:1">mana mazi yafika muisingo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Nogidimila muna inhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">habule hanhu ha kubojoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Nifika hanhu heli na mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">nikulusigwa na mazi.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Niguta nyangi mbaka nimalilwa na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">melo jangu dinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Meso yangu hayalola goya kwaviya nilegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">nomzahila Mulungu wangu yanitaze.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Wanhu wonihila bila chimu ni wengi kufosa nyele zili muna iditwi jangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Wehi wangu wowolonda kuninanga wolonga uvwizi kusonhela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">woniwangiliza kubweleza vinhu sivibawile.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Weye Mulungu kuumanya ubozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">ubananzi wangu haufisika kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">sekeuleke waja wokuhuwila wagumigwe chinyala kwa ichimu changu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">Weye Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">sekewawone chinyala waja wokuzahila kwa ichimu changu.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Mana nizehigwa kwa ichimu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">chinyala chigubika chihanga changu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Ndugu zangu wonitendela fana hawanimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">simanyika na waja chelekwe hamwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Noilonda ng'hani kaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">mbaka moyo wangu wokwaka fana moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">wanhu wokuliga weye woniliga niye.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Vinilila na kufunga kuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">wanhu waniliga.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />Vinikalile na ndilo nivala guniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">mbali wanhu wanyehula.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Walangulizi wokala hana ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu wonizeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">iviya wanhu wakoligwe upele wonizeha kwa nyila zawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Mbali niye nokupula weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">lusita lukufaya weye Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Kwa ulondo wako mkulu, weye Mulungu unidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">na unilopole kwa uwaminika wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Unilopole kulawa muna inhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">sekeunileke nididimile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">Unikombole na wanhu wonihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">unilopole kulawa muna yamazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Sekeunileke nikulusigwe na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">sekeunileke ningile muna dikombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">muladi sekenigubikigwe na msanga muna dikombo.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">kwa unovu wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">unihindukile kwa ubazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Sekeunifise chihanga chako, niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">unidike hima, mana namuna uzidilwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Unikwenhukile na unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">unilopole na wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Weye kuvimanya viniligigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">vinizehigwa na vinigumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">weye kuwamanya wehi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Maligo yanibena moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ivo nolumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">nilonda munhu wa kunitaza, mbali simuwonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">munhu wa kuniguma moyo, nayo simuwonile.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Wanikila sungu muna indiya yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">na vinikalile na ng'hilu waning'ha siki.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Madugila yawo yawe mtego kumwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">yawe mtego kwa wambwiya zawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Meso yawo yagumigwe ziza muladi sekewalole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">na ng'huli zawo ziwe nyondenyonde siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Uwetilile ludoko lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">wahumigwe na ng'hasiliki yako.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Hanhu hawo ha kukala hawe matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">sekekuwe na munhu wa kukala muna yamahema yawo,<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />kwaviya wowagaza waja uwataguse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">na wosimulila mawine ya waja uwazumile.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Sekeuzimize ubananzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">sekeutogole kuwalekelela.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Uwasegeze muna ichitabu cha lukumbuso cha Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">sekewandikigwe hamwe na wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Mbali niye nyondenyonde na mtamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">Weye Mndewa Mulungu uninule na unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Nizaditogoza zina da Mulungu kwa wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">nizamtogoza kwa hewela.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Mbuli ino izamnogeza ng'hani Mndewa Mulungu kufosa kulava ng'ombe lume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">kufosa kumulavila ng'ombe yeli na mahembe.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Wanhu wawoneligwe vondawawone ukombola wangu wezadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">mweye womumzahila Mulungu, mugumigwe moyo!<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowahulika waja wolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">na hawazimiza wanhu wake wafungigwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Ulanga na isi vomtogoza yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">iviya bahali na vinhu vose vili umo vomtogoza.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Kwaviya Mulungu kezadikombola bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na kuyazenga kaidi mabululu ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">Wanhu wake wezakala muna yamabululu yayo na isi izakuwa yawo.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Wana wa wasang'hani wake wezaihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">na waja wodilonda zina jake wezakala umo.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukomboligwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi ya kukumbuka, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Weye Mulungu unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, wize hima unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Wanhu woilungila kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wagwe chinyala na wasekigwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">Waja wolonda nilumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wahumigwe na wapate chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Waleke waja wonilongela, “Weye! Weye!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">Wabwele kuchisogo kwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Waja wose wokuzahila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">wadeng'helele na watowe ng'henze kwa ichimu chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">Wokulonda kwaviya kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">walonge, “Mulungu yatogozigwe siku zose!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Niye ngayengaye na nolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">weye Mulungu, wize hima hima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Weye niiyo mtazi wangu na mulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeukalame.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu huwilo da walala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Nikukimbilila weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">sekenigwe chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Kwaviya kotenda voilondeka, unilopole na unihonye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">ukinge digutwi na unilopole.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Uwe luwe lwangu lwa kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">ulagilize nilopoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwaviya weye niiyo luwe lwangu na mhongono yangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Weye Mulungu wangu, unikombole na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">kulawa muna zinguvu za wasede na wabananzi.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Kwaviya nokuhuwila weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">nokuhuwila weye Mndewa kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Nikuhuwila weye kwandusila vinyelekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">weye niiyo unilavile muna iinda ya mami yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">Nizakutogoza weye chila siku.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Ugima wangu ulinga fana chilaguso chihile kwa wanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">mbali weye niiyo kimbililo jangu kulu.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Nokutogoza siku yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">iviya nolonga ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Vondanilale sekeunileme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">nihamalilwa nguvu sekeunileke.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Kwaviya wehi wangu wonilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">wanhu waja wolonda kunikoma wailumba hamwe.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Wolonga, “Mulungu kamuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">muwinzeni mukamgwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">na habule munhu yondayamkombole!”<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Weye Mulungu, sekeukale kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">weye Mulungu wangu, ulopole kunitaza.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Wose wonilongeleza wagumigwe chinyala na wanangigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">wanhu wolonda kunilumiza, wehuligwe na wazehigwe.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Mbali nizakulolela chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">nizakutogoza ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Mulomo wangu wizazilonga sang'hano zako zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">imisi yose nizagong'onda ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">mbali kutenda vinhu vikulu kufosa viya vonidaha kuvimanya.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Nizakwiza na mbuli za mwazanyo za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nizagong'onda unovu wako, weye kwadumwe.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Weye Mulungu, kunifunza kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">nigong'onda mauzauza yako mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Mndewa Mulungu vondaniwe mulala na uhenga sekeunileke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mbaka nigong'onde udahi wako kwa welesi ukwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">na nguvu yako kwa wose wokwiza hamwande.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Unovu wako, weye Mulungu, umema kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">weye kutenda mbuli ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Weye Mulungu, yelihi yalingile fana weye?<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Kunitenda niwone manhesa mengi ya usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">mbali kwizanibweleza kulawa muna dikombo digidimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">weye kwizaninula kaidi kulawa uko.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Kwizanyongezela hishima yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">na kwizaniguma moyo kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Nizakutogoza kwa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">kwa ichimu cha waminika wako, weye Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">nizakwimbila nyila za nhogolwa kwa zeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">weye, Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Nizakwimbila kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">ona, niye younikombole nizakutogola kwa wila.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Nizasimulila sang'hano zako zinogile siku yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwaviya waja walondile kunikoma wagumigwa chinyala na wazehigwa.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s">Kumpulila mfalume</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Sulemani</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Mulungu, mdahize mfalume yahumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">mdahize mwana wa mfalume yahumize voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Yawahumize wanhu wako fana voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">na yawahumize ngayengaye wako kwa haki.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Milima izawatenda wanhu wamwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">na muna ividundulima wanhu wakale voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Mfalume yawagombele nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">yawataze wana wa ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">na kuwananga wanhu wowagaza wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Mfalume yakale lusita lose fana zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">na yakale fana mwezi kwa nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Yawe fana mvula yoihumuluka hana yamayani yakanhigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">fana mawaga yolagala muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Wotenda mbuli zinogile wakale goya siku zose za ugima wake mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">na wamwede kwa wingi mbaka mwezi ufe.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Yatawale kulawa bahali mbaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">na kulawa lwanda mbaka uhelelo wa isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Wanhu wokala kuchuwala wotumbala mavindi haulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">na wehi wake wezatambala haulongozi wake.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Wafalume wa Talishishi na visiwa wezamwing'ha kodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">wafalume wa Sheba na Seba wezamgalila vitumetume.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Wafalume wose wamtumbalile mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">wanhu wa zisi zose wamsang'hanile.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Kwaviya kezamkombola munhu yolonda kutazigwa viyopula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">na kezamtaza ngayengaye yelibule munhu wa kumtaza.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Kowawonela ubazi ngayengaye na nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">na kuwakombola wanhu wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Kezawakombola kulawa muna ukuzehigwa na kutendiligwa usede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">kwaviya kogesa ng'hani ugima wawo.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Mfalume yakale siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Yahokele chitumetume cha zahabu kulawa Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">wanhu wampulile mfalume kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">na kumtemela mate siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Isi ipate ndiya nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">vilima vimeme mavuno fana ya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">na wanhu wawe wengi muna yamabululu fana mayani.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Zina jake dikale siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">zuwa dihaka, hishima yake yongezeke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Wanhu wa zisi zose watemeligwe mate kufosela yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">na kumtanga kamweda.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Yatogozigwe Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">yeye muhala yotenda mauzauza.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Zina jake kulu ditogozigwe siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">zisi zose zimeme ukulu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ivo, Ivo!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Uhelelo wa mbuli ziyapulile Daudi mwana wa Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">Chitabu cheketatu</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 73-89">Zabuli 73-89</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zinogile zizatawala</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Kweli Mulungu kanoga kwa Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">kwa waja weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Isigala hadodo niikwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">isigala hadodo nitelebuke,<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />kwaviya niwawonela migongo waja weli na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">viniwawonile wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wopata chiwolonda.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Wabule usungu muna iifa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">ng'huli zawo zitelela na zigangamala.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Hawagaya fana viwogaya wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">na hawapata manhesa fana viwopata manhesa wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Ivo magoda yawa fana usalu muna zisingo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">na usede ni fana mawalo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Wihi wolawa muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">magesa yehile mengi yolawa muna imizoyo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Wowaseka wamwenga na wowawonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">woigoda na woilungila kutenda vinhu vihile.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Kwa milomo yawo wolonga woulanguliza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">kwa mbuli zawo woitogoza muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Ivo, wanhu wowategeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">hawawona dihile jojose kumwawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">na wotogola chila mbuli yowolonga.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Wolonga, “Mulungu kodahaze kuvimanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Vino yeye Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kanawo umanyi?”<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Vino niivo viwokuwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">wana chila chinhu na wopata vinhu vimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Kweli niusafya moyo wangu, mbali haifaiye chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">na ninawa makono yangu muladi sekenitende uhasanyi.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Nigazigwa imisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">nitagusigwa chila imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />One nilongile fana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">nihawile mdelenya kwa wanago.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Mbali vinigezile kuvimanya mbuli zino zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">iwa vidala ng'hani kumwangu,<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />mbaka voningile muna ikaye ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">niumanya uhelelo wawo.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Kweli weye Mndewa Mulungu kuweka hanhu hotelebuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">kuwatenda wagwile hehile.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Viya viwanangigwa kwa kusinhukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">wosegezigwa muna iisi kwa vinhu va kudumbiza.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Wage fana nzozi viikwaga lusita lwa kulamka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">weye Mndewa, vondaulamke kwizawehula.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Viniwonile usungu muna umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">na viningiligwe na luholozi muumoyo,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />simanyile chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">niwa mbunye fana mnyama haulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Mbali niye nahamwe na weye siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">kunyamha mkono wangu wa kulume.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Konilongoza kwa ubala wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">maabaho kwizanihokela kwa hishima.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Nabule imwenga kuulanga mbali weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">habule chinhu chonilonda muna iisi mbali weye.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />One nihapuwa nguvu muna ulukuli lwangu na muna umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">weye Mulungu konitendeza niwe na nguvu siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">Nikusagula weye siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Kwaviya waja woinega na weye wezakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">kuwananga wose wakulekile weye.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Mbali niye nowona vinoga niwe habehi na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">nimtenda Mndewa Mulungu kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">nizazigong'onda sang'hano zake zose.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s">Kulila kwa ichimu cha kubomoleligwa kaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya kufundiza ya Asafu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Habali Mulungu kuchilema siku zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Habali kowawonela ludoko ng'hondolo wa bumbila jako?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Uwakumbuke wanhu wako wouwagulile umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">wanhu waja wouwakombole kuwa wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">Ukumbuke mulima Sayuni, woutendile kaye yako.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Fosa uchanyha ya matongo yondayasigale siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">wehi wainanga kaye yako.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Wehi wako wobuma haja houiting'hane na cheye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">Wokwika bendela zawo fana chilaguso cha kuhuma!<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Wavinanga vinhu vose va kaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">fana wanhu wosang'hanila nhemo kukanha mibiki muna imbago.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Wakanha mibiki isongoligwe goya ya kaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">waitula kwa nhemo na nyundo.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Wahatimbula hanhu hako helile na kuhagwisa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">waitenda kaye ya zina jako yambule mwiko.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Walonga muna imizoyo yawo, “Chizawadanganiza ng'hani,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">na watimbula chila hanhu hako ha kuiting'hana muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Haching'higwe vilaguso va mauzauza kulawa kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">habule walotezi wasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">habule yoyose vichili yovimanya mbuli ino izamala zuwaki.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Weye Mulungu, mwihi kezakuzeha mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Vino wehi wezadiliga zina jako siku zose?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Habali kobweleza kuchisogo mkono wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Uulave mkono wako ukawanange.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Mbali Mulungu ni mfalume wangu kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">kogala ukombola muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Kuigola bahali kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">kuyatula matwi ya mazoka makulu muna yamazi.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Kuhonda matwi ya Lewiasani, ng'onyo kulu muibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">yawe ndiya ya vilumbe va kuchuwala.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Weye kutenda nzasa na vizanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">weye kunyaza mizanda ikalile na mazi siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Imisi ni yako na ichilo ni yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">weye niiyo utendile mwezi na zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Weye kwika mhaka zose za isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">kwika chiangazi na chihuhwe.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Mndewa Mulungu, kumbuka viya mwihi viyakuzehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">na wabozi viwadiligile zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Sekeumwing'he mnyama wa kumbago nziwa wako Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">siku zose sekeuwazimize wanhu wako wowogaya.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Ukumbuke lagano jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">kwaviya wasede wokala chila hanhu hana diziza muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Sekeumuleke munhu yawoneligwe yawone chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">ngayengaye na munhu yolonda kutazigwa waditogoze zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Weye Mulungu, inuka uigombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">kumbuka viuligigwa na wabozi siku yose.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Sekeuzimize nyangi za wehi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">ndwagi za waja wokulema zogendelela siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu msemi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu na wila kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, yokwimbigwa fana wila woutangigwa, “Sekeubanange.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Chokwing'ha hewela weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">chokwing'ha hewela, kwaviya kwahabehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">Wanhu wolonga sang'hano zako za mwazanyo.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Mulungu kolonga, “Vondalufike lusita loniusagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">nizahumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Isi ihagudemeka hamwe na vinhu vake vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">niye mwenyewo nizakimilila sekeinangigwe.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Nowalongela wanhu woigoda, ‘Sekemuigode’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, ‘Sekemuwe na ditwi kulu.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Sekemuwe na ditwi kulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">na sekemulonge kwa magoda.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Habule yoyose yolawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa hebu ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">hebu muichuwala yondayadahe kumwinula munhu.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Mana Mulungu niiyo msemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">komuhumulusa munhu na komwinula imwenga.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamha nhungo muna umkono wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">imema ludoko lwake fana upele ulawa hovu wouhanganyigwe na vikolezo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">Kougida na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wose muna iisi yose wezaung'wa na kuumala.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Mbali niye nizadeng'helela siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">nizamwimbila Mulungu wa Yakobo wila wa nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Kolonga, “Nizawatenda nyondenyonde wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">mbali nizazongeza nguvu kwa wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zinogile.”<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu muhumi</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu na wila kwa via va nyila vili na singija kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Mulungu komanyika muna iisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">zina jake ni kulu muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Kuikaye yake uko Salemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">hanhu ha ukazi wake niuko Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Uko kaibena misale ikwaka ya mwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">kabena ngao na mapanga na via va ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Weye Mulungu kotogoligwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">ukulu wako wofosa milima ikala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Weli na nguvu wahokigwa vinhu vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">lelo wadanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">habule hata imwe wa wanhu wa ng'hondo yodaha kwinula makono yake kuchitendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Viuwabwakile, weye Mulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">mwihi na falasi wake wadanganika.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Weye muhala iyo Mulungu wa kudumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">Vino yelihi yondayeme haulongozi wako viuwa na ludoko?<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Kugong'onda nhaguso yako kulawa kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">Isi idumba na inyamala hupi,<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />weye Mulungu viuhumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">kuwakombola wanhu wehuligwe muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Kweli nhaguso yako kusonhela wanhu yokugalila nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">na wanhu wakomboligwe kwiing'hondo wezawona ludoko lwako.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Mfikizileni vilaho venu Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">wanhu wose wokala muna izisi zili habehi na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">wamgalile vitumetume yeye muhala yodumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Kosegeza magoda ya watawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">na kodumbigwa na wafalume wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kuguma moyo lusita lwa uzidilwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu kwa Yedusuni mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Nomulilila Mulungu muladi yanihulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">nomulandulila dizi Mulungu muladi yanitegeleze.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Lusita vinikalile na magayo nimzahila Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">ichilo nimpula bila kulegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">na moyo wangu ulema kusangalala.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Vinimgesile Mulungu ningiligwa na luholozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">viniiuzagize, moyo ubeneka.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Kunitenda sekenipate nhongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">nikala na magayo na nipotwa kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Nigesa siku zifosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">na nikumbuka miyaka ya umwaka ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Nikumbuka nyila zonikwimbile ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">nigesa na kuiuza muumoyo,<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Vino Mndewa Mulungu kachilema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Vino hezachilagusa ulondo wake kaidi?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Vino ulondo wake umala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Vino chilagano chake hachizalawilila?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Vino Mulungu kazimiza kulagusa ubazi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Vino ludoko lwake lusegeza ulondo wake?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Maabaho nigesa, “Uno niuwo usungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kaleka kuchitaza kwa nguvu yake.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Nizakumbuka sang'hano zako zose weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">kwa vinhu viutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">na mauzauza yako ya umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Nizakumbuka sang'hano zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">na kuzigesa sang'hano zako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Weye Mulungu, nzila zako zela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">ni mulungu yelihi yeli mkulu fana Mulungu wetu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Weye niiyo Mulungu youtenda mauzauza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">kulagusa udahi wako kwa wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Kuwakombola wanhu wako kwa mkono wako uli na nguvu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">nyelesi za Yakobo na Yosefu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Mazi viyakuwone weye Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mazi viyakuwone yakimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mazi mengi ya bahali yagudemeka.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Mawingu yetila mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">ng'huwa zibuma kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">lumwemwe lumwemwesa banzi zose fana misale.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Mbumo wako uhulikika muna divulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">lumwemwe lwako lumwemwesa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">isi yose igudemeka na itingisika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Nzila yako ifosela mwiibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">nzila yako ifosela muna yamazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">mbali nyayo zako haziwoneke bule.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Kuwalongoza wanhu wako fana viya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">kwa mkono wa Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu na wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu kwa kufundiza</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Nowalamba, wambwiya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">mkinge digutwi mtegeleze mbuli zonimulongelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">mtegeleze mbuli zonimfunzani.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Nizalonga na mweye kwa masimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">nizawafambulila mbuli zifisigwe zilawile kulingwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />Chizihulika mbuli izo na kuzimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">mbuli zowachilongele wasaho zetu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Hachizawafisa wanetu mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">mbali chizawalongela welesi ukwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">sang'hano ng'hulu za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">na mbuli za mauzauza zoyatendile.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Mulungu kaweng'ha wanhu wa welesi wa Yakobo malagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">na keka ndagilizi kwa wanhu wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">Kawalagiliza wasaho zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">wawafundize wana wawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />muladi wanhu wa welesi wondawize wayamanye malagilizo yake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">na kuwalongela wana wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Iviya wamuhuwile kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">na sekewazimize sang'hano za Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">mbali wazindilile malagilizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Sekewawe fana wasaho zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">wanhu watatali na hawategeleza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">welesi uyangaya muna uhuwilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">mizoyo yawo haikalile na uwaminika kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Waefulaimu weli na mhinde na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">wakimbila siku ija ya ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Hawazindilile lagano da Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">na walema kukala kwa malagilizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Wazimiza mbuli ziyatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">na mauzauza yoyawalaguse.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Katenda mauzauza haulongozi wa wasaho zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">muna iisi ya Misili, muna dibululu da Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Kaigola bahali, kawafoseza umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">na kayatenda yamazi yeme fana ng'huta.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Imisi kawalongoza kwa wingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">ichilo chose kawalongoza kwa bung'hulo da moto.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Katula miluwe uko kudibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">kaweng'ha mazi mengi fana bahali.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Katenda nzasa ilawe muna uluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">katenda mazi yakilime fana lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Mbali viwakalile kudibwilingu wamuhasanya Mulungu Yeli Kuchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Wamgeza Mulungu muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">na wamuwangiliza yaweng'he ndiya ziwalondile wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Wamuliga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">walonga, “Vino Mulungu kodaha kuchigolela ndiya muno muna dibwilingu?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Kweli, kalutowa luwe na mazi yalawa fana lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">mbali kodahaze kuching'ha cheye wanhu wake ndiya na nyama?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Mndewa Mulungu viyahulike, kehilwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">ludoko lwake luwakila wanhu wa Yakobo fana moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">Wanhu wa Isilaili walaviligwa ludoko,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />kwaviya walema kumuhuwila Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">na hawamuhuwile kuwa kodaha kuwalopola.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Mbali kayalagiliza mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">na kavugula mazonzo ya kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />Kaweng'ha mana muladi waje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">kaweng'ha ndiya ya kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Wanhu waja gate da wasenga wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">kawagalila ndiya yofaya.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Kadilekela beho kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">na kadigala beho da kusi kwa udahi wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Kawagalila nyama fana matimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">na ndege woguluka fana msanga wa mhwani.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Maabaho Mulungu kawatenda ndege wagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">muna dilago da wanhu wake habehi na mahema yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Wanhu waja mbaka weguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">kwaviya kakala kaweng'ha chiya chawachilondile.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Wang'hali hawanakomeleza kuja chowachilondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">hata vichikalile ching'hali muna imilomo yawo,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Mulungu kawawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">na kawakoma wanhu weli na nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">Kawagwisa wabwanga wa Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Mbali wagendelela kuhasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">hawayahuwile mauzauza yake.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Ivo kazikanhiza siku zawo fana si chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">na miyaka yawo kwa ndilo za kusinhukiza.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Viyawakomile, wamwenga wamzahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">wasigale wambwelela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">wamkwenhukila Mulungu kwa moyo umwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Wakumbuka kuwa Mulungu kakala luwe lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani, mulopozi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Mbali wamvwizila kwa milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">walonga uvwizi kwa milimi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />Mizoyo yawo haigangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">iviya hawazindilile lagano jake.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Mbali Mulungu kakala na ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">kawalekelela uhasanyi wawo na hawanangile bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">Miyanza mingi kalukimilila ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">hebu halaguse ludoko lwake lose.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Kakumbuka kuwa wawo wakala nyama muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">wakala fana beho difosa na hadibwela.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Wamulema kudibwilingu miyanza mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">na kumguma luholozi.<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Wamgeza Mulungu chila lusita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">wamsovula Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Hawakumbuke udahi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">siku viyawakombole kulawa kwa wehi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />Hawakumbuke vilaguso vake muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">na mauzauza yake muna dibawe da Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Kaigalula mizanda yawo kuwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">muladi sekewadahe kung'wa mazi ya vizanda vawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Kawagalila mabumbila ya ng'honzi kuwagaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na mabula kuwabananga.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Kawagala nzige waja ndiya zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na kunanga migunda yawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Kaibananga mizabibu yawo kwa mvula za mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">na kaibena mikuyu yawo kwa vulavumbi.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Kawakoma ng'ombe wawo kwa mvula ya mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">na kawakoma wanyama wawo kwa ng'huwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Kawagalila manhesa makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">ludoko lwake luwa lukulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">na kawagalila bumbila da wasenga wa kuulanga waja wonanga chila chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Kawalavila ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">na hawasegezele ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">mbali kawagalila hulo.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Kawakoma waudele wose wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">wana wa mwanduso wa wanhu weli muna zikaye zose za Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Mbali kawalongoza wanhu wake fana ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">kawadima fana mifugo muna ichuwala.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Kawalongoza vinogile na hawadumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">mbali bahali iwagubika wehi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Kawagala mbaka muna iisi yake yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">kuna umulima uyausolile kwa nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Kawawinga wakaya wa zisi zimwenga haulongozi wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na kuwagolela zisi zawo fana uhazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">muladi makabila ya Isilaili yakale muna zikaye zawo.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Mbali wanhu wamgeza Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">na walema kuzindilila ndagilizi zake.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Wahasanya fana wasaho zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">hawafaya fana msale ubeneke viuhembeluka.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Kwaviya watambikila nyang'hiti zawo za milungu hana ihanhu hawo ha kutambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">wamtenda Mulungu yawone ludoko.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Mulungu viyawawonile, kengilwa na ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">kawalema ng'hani Waisilaili.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Kasegela hanhu hayakalile uko Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">hanhu hayakalile hagati ya wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Kawalekela wehi wawo wasole Sanduku da Lagano dikalile chilaguso cha nguvu zake na ukulu wake.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Kawalekela wanhu wake wakomigwe kwa mapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">kauwonela ludoko ng'hani uhazi wake Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Ng'hondo iwakoma wabwanga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">na wandele wawo wa chike hawawile na walume wa kuwasola.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Wakulu wa nhambiko wawo wakomigwa kwa mapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">mbali wagane wawo wapotwa kulila.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kenuka fana viya kalawa mzinhongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">fana viya munhu yasinduke viyokwinuka.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Kawatowa na kuwahuma wehi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">kawaguma chinyala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Kaulema welesi wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">hadisagule kabila da Efulaimu.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Mbali kadisagula kabila da Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">mulima Sayuni, uyaulondile.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Kazenga kaye yake ya kutambikila igangamale fana ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">fana isi iyaigangamize siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Kamsagula Daudi msang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">kamulava muna ivikwama va ng'hondolo.<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />Kamulava muna usang'hano wa kudima ng'hondolo wokong'heza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">yawe mdimi wa wanhu wake Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">na wanhu wa Isilaili, wanhu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Daudi kawalolesa goya kwa moyo wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">kawalanguliza kwa ugalu ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo ya kubanangigwa kwa isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Weye Mulungu, zisi zingila muna iisi yako youisagule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">Waitenda kaye yako yelile yambule mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">wadileka bululu da Yelusalemu kuwa matongo.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Wailava mitufi ya wasang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">kuwa ndiya ya ndege wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">na mitufi ya wanhu wako waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">iwe ndiya ya wanyama wa kumbago.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Damu yawo itika fana viya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">kudizinga bululu jose da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">na habule munhu yoyose wa kuwawanda.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Chiwa na chinyala kwa wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">Wanhu wa zisi zilihabehi na cheye wachizeha na wachiseka.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwizakuwa na ludoko mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Vino kwizakuwa na ludoko siku zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Wivu wako wizakwaka fana moto?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Uwetilile ludoko lwako wanhu wa zisi zose weli hawakumanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">na kwa falume, hawaditambikila zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Kwaviya wauja welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">na waunanga ukazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Sekeukumbuke uhasanyi utendigwe umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">ubazi wako wize himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">kwaviya chigaya ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Weye Mulungu mulopozi wetu, uchitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa ichimu cha ukulu wa zina jako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">Weye Mulungu uchikombole na uchilekelele uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwa ichimu cha zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Habali wanhu wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Kakulihi Mulungu wawo?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Chiwone viuwalihiliza damu ya wasang'hani wako itike.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Masozi ya lugano ya wafungwa yafike kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">kwa udahi wako mkulu kuwalopola wanhu watagusigwe ifa.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Uwalihe miyanza saba wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">kwa mbuli zawo zihile zowakulongile, weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Maabaho cheye wanhu wako, ng'hondolo wa bumbila jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">chizakwing'ha hewela siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">Chizagong'onda nhogolwa zako kwa nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s">Isilailii mzabibu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, yokwimbigwa fana wila woutangigwa, “Maluwa ya Vibesa.”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Weye Mdimi wa Isilaili chitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">weye uulongoze welesi wa Yosefu fana bumbila da ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">weye ukala uchanyha ya makelubi, ulave bung'hulo jako.<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Haulongozi wa makabila ya Efulaimu na Benyamini na Manase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">ulaguse udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">wize uchilopole.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Uchibweleze kumwako weye Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">Uchilole kwa unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">muladi chikomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">kwizawonela ludoko chiwopula wanhu wako mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Kuwalisa masozi fana ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">na kuweng'ha hamha dimemile masozi wang'we.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Kuchitenda chiwe chimu cha ndwagi kwa wakaya wayetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">na wehi wetu wochiseka.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Weye Mulungu Wili na udahi, uchibweleze kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">uchimwemwesele chihanga chako na unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">muladi chikomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Kuwalava wasaho zetu muna iisi ya Misili fana munhu viyong'ola mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kuwawinga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">na kuuhanda muna iisi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Kusasala mgunda kwa ichimu chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">mizizi igangamala imemeza isi.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Milima igubikigwa kwa sisila da mzabibu uja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">matambi yake yagubika mibiki ya mielezi ya Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Matambi yake yenela mbaka mwiibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">mazugwana yake yenela mbaka muna ulwanda.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Habali kubomola ng'huta za mgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">muladi wose wofosa habehi wahe matunda yake?<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Nguluwe woubojoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">na wanyama wa mbago woja umo.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Chibwelele, weye Mulungu Wili na Udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">Ulole hasi kulawa kuulanga uwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">ulole mzabibu uno,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />mzabibu wouhandigwe kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">na zugwana diya douditendile dikule.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Mzabibu wako ukanhigwa na usomigwa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">vouwakalikila wanhu wako wonangigwa.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Umtaze yoyokala mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">umtaze munhu youmgangamize kwa ichimu chako.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Maabaho hachizakuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">uching'he ugima na cheye chizaditambikila zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na udahi, uchibweleze kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">uchimwemwesele chihanga chako na unovu wako, muladi chikomboligwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa dugila</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa chia cha nyila kulawa Gasi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Mulandulileni dizi Mulungu wetu kwa kumwimbila nyila za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">mtoweleni ng'henze Mulungu wa Yakobo!<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Yanduseni wila kwa kutowa ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">bango dilila vinogile na chinubi.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Toweni mhalati za mhembe za mabebelu ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">lusita lwa kwima kwa mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">na lusita lwa mwezi ukangale niiyo siku ya dugila jetu.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Ijo ni lagilizo kwa wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">malagilizo ya Mulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Kaweng'ha wanhu wa Isilaili lagilizo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">lusita viyawatowile wanhu wa Misili.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 81:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">Nihulika ulonzi siumanyile, wolonga,<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Nimnenulani mbahasha muna yamayega yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">nimuhokani chigelo chimwamhile muna yamakono.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Viukalile muna yamanhesa kunitanga na nikulopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">Nikwidika kulawa kuna yamawingu matitu yeli na mbumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nikugeza muna zinzasa za Meliba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Mweye wanhu wangu, tegelezeni, nomzumani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">nolonda mweye Waisilaili munitegeleze!<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Sekemuwe na mulungu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">sekemumtambikile mulungu wa isi imwenga.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">yonimulavileni kuna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">hameni milomo yenu, nizamulisani.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />“Mbali wanhu wangu hawanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Isilaili hawalondile kunisondelela.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Ivo niwaleka wasondelele mizoyo yawo midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">wasondelele magesa yawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />“Wanhu wangu one wahanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">na Isilaili wahasondelele nzila zangu,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />nahawahumile wehi wawo himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">na kuhindula mkono wangu kusonhela wehi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Waja wonihila niye Mndewa Mulungu, wahaidulika kwa ludumbo haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">wagendelele kutenda ivo siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Mbali mweye nihawalisile ngano inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">nihawegutize kwa uki wa kumbago.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu msemi mkulu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Mulungu kokala muna umting'hano wa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">kohumiza milungu.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Kolonga, “Mwizahumiza kwa kuwonela mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">Mwizawatogola wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile mbaka zuwaki?”<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Uwahumize vinogile wachiwa na ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">watendeleni voilondeka wanhu welibule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">iviya watendeleni voilondeka wanhu wawoneligwe.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Wakomboleni nyondenyonde na wanhu wolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">walopoleni kulawa muna yamakono ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Hawavimanyile na hawahulika chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">wogenda muna diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">vandusilo vose va haki muna iisi votingisika.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Niye nilonga, “Mweye ni milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">mweye wose mwawana wa Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Mbali mwizadanganika fana wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">mwizakugwa fana imwe wa wakulu.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Weye Mulungu, inuka uwahumize wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwaviya wanhu wa zisi zose wako.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu yawagombele wanhu wake kwa wehi wawo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Asafu na wila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Weye Mulungu, sekeunyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">weye Mulungu, sekeunyamale na sekeukale hupi.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Lola wehi wako wotenda tibwilitibwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">lola wokwihila viwokwinula matwi yawo kwa magoda.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Woilunga kuwalumiza wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">wowagesela vihile waja wouwalonda.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Wolonga, “Izoni, chiwanange wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">muladi zina da Isilaili, sekedikumbukigwe kaidi.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Woitogolela hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">wokwika lagano kuwa wehi wako.<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Wawo woitogolela, wanhu wa Edomu na Waishimaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">na Moabu na Wahagali,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebali na Amoni na Amaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">Filisiti na wanhu wokala Tilo woitogolela.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Na Waashulu womtaza Lutu wailumba nawo.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Uwatendele fana viuwatendele Wamidiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">fana viuwatendele Sisela na Yabini kuna ichizanda cha Kishoni.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />Wanhu wouwanangile uko Endoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">wawa unyolodo muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Uwatende wakulu wawo fana Olebu na Zeebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">uwatende watawala wawo wose fana Zeba na Salimuna.<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />Waja walongile, “Leka chisole hanhu ha kudimila ha Mulungu, kuwa hanhu hetu.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Weye Mulungu wangu, uwahembeluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">fana timbwisi da vulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">fana mafuya, yohembelusigwa na mbeho.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Fana moto viutimbula mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">hebu milambi ya moto voilunguza milima,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />uwawinge kwa beho jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na uwadumbize kwa beho jako kulu.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Uvitende vihanga vawo viwe na chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">muladi walonge nguvu yako ng'hulu, weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Wagwe vinyala na wadumbe siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">wafe kwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Wavimanye weye kwa dumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">zina jako Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">niiyo Wili Uchanyha Ng'hani ya zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s">Hamu ya kuwa muna ikaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, kwa chia cha nyila cha Gasi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:1">hanhu houkala honogeza ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Muhe wangu una hamu ng'hani ya kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">moyo na lukuli lose womdeng'helela Mulungu yeli mgima.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Iviya ndege wozenga mvulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">sholwe waipatila visanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">umo wokwika makinda yawo habehi na lupango lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">mfalume wangu na Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Wamweda wanhu waja wokala muna ikaye yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">wanhu wokwimba nhogolwa zako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Wamweda wanhu waja wopata nguvu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">wolonda ng'hani kuhita Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Viwofosa muna dibawe ditangigwa Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">Mulungu kahatenda hanhu haja kuwa nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">na mvula za vuli zomemeza vilamba.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Wogendelela kupata nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">mbaka vondawafike haulongozi wa Mulungu uko Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi, utegeleze nhambiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">kinga digutwi, weye Mulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Weye Mulungu, umulole mfalume yeli ngao yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">umulole goya ichihanga munhu wako iumsagule.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Siku dimwe kukala muna ikaye yako kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kufosa kukala hanhu hamwenga siku elufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">Muhavu nihemile muna ulwivi wa Kaye ya Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kufosa kukala muna yamahema ya wahasanyi.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Mndewa Mulungu fana zuwa na ngao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">kochigesa na kuchihishimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">hezawema chochose chinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">wanhu waja wokala vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">kamweda munhu ija yokuhuwila.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu yawatemele mte kaidi wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, umwaka kulagusa unovu kwa isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">na kuwatenda wanhu wa Yakobo watemeligwe mate kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Kuwalekelela ubananzi wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">na kusegeza uhasanyi wawo wose.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Kusegeza ludoko lwako lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">kuleka ng'hasiliki yako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Lelo weye Mulungu wa ukombola wetu, uchibweleze kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">uleke kuchiwonela ludoko.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Vino kwizachiwonela ludoko siku zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Kwizagendelela na ludoko lwako kwa nyelesi zose?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Vino hwizaching'ha ugima kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">muladi wanhu wako wakudeng'helele?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uchilaguse ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">uchikombole.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Nitegeleze chiya choyolonga Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">kwaviya kowalaganila kuwatenda wanhu wake wokwaminika watindiwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">wanhu wake mwenyewo, mbali sekewaubwelele ubozi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Kweli ukombola wake wahabehi kwa waja womdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">muladi ukulu wake ukale muna iisi yetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Ulondo na uwaminika voiting'hana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">haki na tindiwalo voinonela.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Kweli izasuka muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">haki izalola kulawa kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kezaching'ha vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">na isi yetu izalava ndiya.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Haki izamulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">na kumsasalila nzila yake.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kuwoneligwa ubazi</para>
  <para style="d">Mbuli ziya Daudi zoyompula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba unitegeleze na unidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">kwaviya niye ngayengaye na nyondenyonde.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Ukalize ugima wangu, kwaviya niye mwaminika kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">weye Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">mkombole msang'hani wako yokuhuwila.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Mndewa Mulungu, uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">kwaviya nikulamba weye siku yose.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Udeng'heleze moyo wa msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">Kwaviya nokwinulila moyo wangu, weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu kunoga na kolekelela uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">kowalonda wanhu wose wokupula.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, tegeleza mbuli yonipula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">tegeleza vonipula uniwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Nizakupula siku ya magayo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwaviya kwizanidika.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, habule fana weye hagati ya milungu ya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">habule sang'hano fana sang'hano zako.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wouwalumbile wezakwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">wezakutambikila weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">wezaditogoza zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Kwaviya weye niiyo mkulu na kotenda mauzauza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">weye niiyo Mulungu wiidumwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unifunze nzila yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">muladi nidahe kugenda muna ikweli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">moyo wangu udidumbe zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Weye Mndewa, Mulungu wangu, nizakwing'ha hewela kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">nizaditogoza zina jako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Kwaviya konilonda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">kunikombola kulawa kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Weye Mulungu, weli na magoda wonitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">bumbila da wasede wonisepa muladi wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">na hawakusondelela.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa unovu na ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">hupata ludoko himahima, mbali kumema ulondo na uwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Unihindukile na uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">uning'he nguvu yako, niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">umkombole mwana wa msang'hani wako wa chike.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Unilaguse chilaguso cha unovu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">muladi wanhu wonihila wawone na wagwe chinyala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu, kunitaza na kuniguma moyo.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa ya Sayuni</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola na wila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Kazenga bululu jake kuchanyha ya mulima welile.<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kodilonda bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">kufosa ukazi wose wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Wanhu wolonga mbuli zinogile kusonhela weye, bululu da Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Hamwe na wanhu wose wonimanya niye, wanhu wa zisi za Lahabu na Babeli wezanimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">iviya wanhu wa zisi za Filisiti na Tilo na Kushi wezanimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">wezalonga, “Ino kelekigwa Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Izalongigwa kusonhela Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">“Ino na ija welekigwa umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kezadigangamiza bululu da Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawandika wanhu muna ichitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">“Ino kelekigwa Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Wembaji na wavinaji wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Kumwetu cheye, kutemeligwa mate kokwandusila kumwako weye, Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa lusita lwa kudanganika</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya wana wa Kola, kwa mulangulizi wa nyila, yokwimbigwa kwa luholozi, wila wa Hemani Mwezilahi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu yonikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">nokulamba imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Nhambiko yangu igone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">utegeleze chonipula.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Kwaviya moyo wangu umema magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">ugima wangu wahabehi kufika kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Nipetigwa hamwe na waja wokwingila mdikombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">niwa fana munhu yelibule nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Wanileka hamwe na waja wadanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">fana wachinjigwe wagonile muna dileme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">Waja hawakumbukigwa kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">wakutali kutazigwa na weye.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Kunitambalisa muna dikombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">hanhu hagidimile heli na ziza totolo.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Ludoko lwako luwa lukulu lonizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">fana mawimbi yomgubika munhu.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Kuwatenda mbwiya zangu wanibagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">kunitenda sekenigesigwe nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">Nihindiligwa mgati na sidaha kuibanga.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Meso yangu yana uvulivuli kwa ichimu cha lugano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba chila siku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">Nokugolosela makono yangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Vino weye kowalagusa waja wadanganike mauzauza yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Vino waja wafile wokwinuka na kukutogoza?<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Vino ulondo wako wizasimuliligwa kuna dileme?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">Vino waminika wako wezasimuliligwa kuna ihanhu ha kunangigwa?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Vino mauzauza yako yezamanyika kuna diziza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">Vino mbuli zako zigoloke zizamanyika muna iisi ya chizimizimi?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Mbali niye nokulamba weye Mndewa Mulungu, unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">chila imitondo nokupula.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Mndewa Mulungu, habali kunilema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">na konifisa chihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Kwandusila ubwanga wangu mbaka sambi, nigaya na nikala habehi kudanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">weye kunitenda nidumbe na nifa moyo.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Ludoko lwako luiyoha kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">mahulo yako ya kudumbiza yonibananga.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Yonizunguluka fana gombo siku yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">yonizila chila ubanzi.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Kunisegezela mbwiya zangu na wanhu wangu woniwalonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">ziza muhala iyo mbwiyangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kwimba lusita lwa magayo muna iisi ya Isilaili</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya kufundiza ya Esani Mwezilahi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Nizakwimbila weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">nizagong'onda uwaminika wako kwa nyelesi zose siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Nilonga kuwa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo wizakala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">na uwaminika wako wizagendelela kuwoneka fana ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Kulonga, “Nitenda lagano na munhu yonimsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">nimulahila msang'hani wangu Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />Nilonga, ‘Nizawagangamiza welesi wako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">iviya nizachigangamiza chigoda chako cha chifalume kwa nyelesi zose.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Ulanga wizatogoza mauzauza yako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">iviya wizatogoza uwaminika wako muna umting'hano wa vilumbe welile.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Vino yelihi uko kuulanga yodaha kulinganyizigwa na Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Yelihi muna ivilumbe va kuulanga yalingile fana Mndewa Mulungu?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Mulungu kodumbigwa muna umting'hano wa vilumbe welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">kodumbigwa kufosa wose womzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, yelihi yeli na nguvu fana weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">Uwaminika wako wokuzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Weye kotawala bahali ili na beho kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">lusita mawimbi makulu voyokwiza koyemiza.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Kumuhonda Lahabu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">89:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lahabu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yolongigwa kuwa Lahabu niijo zoka kulu da muibahali dofambula sang'hano za wihi na tibwilitibwili.</char></note> kawa fana mtufi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">kuwapwililisa wehi wako kwa nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Ulanga wako na isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">weye niiyo utendile vandusilo va zisi zose na chila chinhu chili umo.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Weye kulumba kasikazi na kusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">mulima wa Taboli na mulima wa Helimoni yodeng'helela zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Mkono wako una nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">mkono wako wa kulume ugangamala na uhuma.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Haki na kuhumiza voilondeka ni chandusilo cha chigoda chako cha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">ulondo na uwaminika vokulongolela.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Wamweda wanhu waja wovimanya kutenda chelekocheleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">waja wogenda muna dibung'hulo jako, weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Wodeng'helela imisi kwa ichimu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">na wokutogoza kwa haki yako.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Koching'ha nguvu na udahi wa kuhuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">kwa unovu wako mhalati zizakwinuligwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Ngao yetu ni yake Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">mfalume wetu kalawa kumwako weye Mulungu welile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano da Mulungu da siku zose</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Umwaka kulonga muna zinzozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">kuwalongela wasang'hani wako waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">“Nimwing'ha nguvu galu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">nimwinula iyo yoyasaguligwe mwaiwawo.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Nimuwona Daudi msang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">nimuhaka mavuta yangu yelile muladi yawe mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Mkono wangu wizamtaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">kweli mkono wangu wizamgangamiza.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Wehi hawezadaha kumvwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">Iviya wahasanyi hawezamdununza.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Niye nizawahonda wehi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">Nizawananga waja wowomwihila.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Uwaminika wangu na ulondo wa kufunya umoyo wizakuwa nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">kwa zina jangu mhalati yake izakwinuligwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Nougangamiza utawala wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">kulawa bahali mbaka nyanda.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Yeye kezanilongela, ‘Weye niiyo tati yangu na Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">niiyo mkalizi wangu yonilopola.’<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Na nizamtenda yeye kuwa chaudele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">nizamtenda yawe mtawala mkulu kufosa wafalume wose.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Ulondo wangu wa kufunya umoyo wizakala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">na lagano jangu kumwake hadizabeneka siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Welesi wake wa chifalume nizaugangamiza siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">na chigoda chake cha chifalume chizakala fana ulanga siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />“Mbali one wanage wahayaleka mafundizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">na sekewazindilile ndagilizi zangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />one hawayazindilila malagilizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">na kuleka kwamha chonilonga,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />nizawatagusa uhasanyi wawo kwa balati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">nizawatowa kwa mahulo kwa ichimu cha mbuli zawo zihile.<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Mbali sizasegeza ulondo wangu wa kufunya umoyo kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">na nizagendelela kuwa mwaminika kwa lagano jangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Sizabena lagano jangu na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">sizagalula mbuli yangu inilongile.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Kwaviya niye yelile, niilaha na sizagalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">kweli sizamulongela Daudi uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Welesi wake wizakala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">na chigoda chake cha chifalume chizakala siku zose fana zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Chizakala siku zose fana mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">msindila mwaminika yeli kuulanga.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndilo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Mbali sambi weye Mulungu kumwasa na kumulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">kumuwonela ludoko munhu youmsagule.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Kudilema lagano doutendile na msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">na kuditenda kombelo jake jambule mwiko muna ditimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Ng'huta zose za bululu jake kuzibomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">na mhongono zake kuzibenabena.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Wafosanzila wose womuhoka vinhu vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">kawa munhu wa kuzehigwa kwa wakaya wayage.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Kuwatenda wehi wake wahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">na kuwadeng'heleza wose womwihila.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Viya vake va ng'hondo kuvitenda viwe vidugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">na kumuleka yahumigwe kuing'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Kumvula ukulu wake wa chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">na kuchigwisa chigoda chake cha chifalume.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Kuzihunguza siku za ubwanga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">na kumguma chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kukala goya</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizaifisa mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Vino ludoko lwako lwizagendelela kwaka fana moto?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Ukumbuke ugima wangu viwili mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">kwaviya munhu youmulumbile kokala lusita luguhi.<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Munhu yelihi yokala bila ya kudanganika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Iviya yelihi youkombola ugima wake kwa nguvu ya leme?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Weye Mndewa, ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">woumulahile Daudi kwa uwaminika wako wakulihi?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ukumbuke viya vonidununzigwa niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">viya vonidununzigwa na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Lola viwomdununza mfalume wako youmsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">viya viwonidununza chila honihita.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">Ivo na Ivo.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Chitabu chekane</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 90-106">Zabuli 90-106</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu wa siku zose na wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="d">Mbuli za Musa munhu wa Mulungu zoyompula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Weye Mndewa, kuwa hanhu hetu ha kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">muna zinyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Ing'hali milima hainaoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">na ing'hali isi hainalumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">weye kukala Mulungu wa siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Weye kowabweleza wanhu muna ditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">viulonga, “Bweleni mweye wana wa Adamu.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Kwaviya miyaka elufu kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">ilinga fana viya igolo ifosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">fana viya ngonelelo ya ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Kousegeza ugima wawo fana nzozi zikwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">nawo walinga fana mayani mabisi imitondo.<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />Imitondo yosuka na kunogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">mbali ichigulogulo yoholola na kunyala.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Kwaviya ludoko lwako luchinanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">chodumbizigwa na nhaguso yako.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Kuulagusa uhasanyi wetu haulongozi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">kuumanya uhasanyi wetu woufisike.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Siku zetu zose chikala muna uludoko lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">chokomeleza miyaka yetu kwa kulila.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Miyaka yetu ya ugima ni malongo saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">one chahawa na nguvu, chokala miyaka malongo manane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Mbali miyaka iyo yose ni magayo na yungwayungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">mana siku zofosa himahima na chokwaga.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Vino yelihi yovimanya nguvu ya ludoko lwako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Kwaviya ludoko lwako lukulu, lowatenda wanhu wakudumbe.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Uchifundize kuzipeta siku zetu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">muladi chipate ubala.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwe na ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Vino kwizakalama mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Wawonele ubazi wasang'hani wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Imitondo uching'he ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">muladi chidahe kwimba kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">na kudeng'helela siku zose za ugima wetu.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Uchideng'heleze siku nyingi kuilinga na siku za magayo zouchigalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">na kuilinga na miyaka ya manhesa yochipatile.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Sang'hano zako ziwoneke kwa wasang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">na wana wawo wawone ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Mndewa, Mulungu wetu, yachitendele unovu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">yazitemele mate sang'hano za makono yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ona, yazitemele mate sang'hano za makono yetu.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mkalizi wetu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Munhu yokala hanhu heli na ukalizi wa Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">kezahumula hana disisila da Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />Nomulongela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">“Weye niiyo kimbililo jangu na mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">Mulungu wangu yonikuhuwila.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Kweli Mulungu kezakulopola kulawa kuna umtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">na kukukimilila sekeupate mitamu ihile.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Kezakugubika kwa machipilo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">kwizakimbilila hasi ya mabawa yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">uwaminika wake ni kimililo na ukalizi.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Hwizadumba vinhu va kudumbiza va ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">hwizadumba msale uzumha imisi.<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />Hwizadumba mahulo yokwiza ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">iviya hwizadumba mahulo yolawilila imisi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Hata wanhu elufu wahadanganika kwa mahulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">hebu elufu longo wahagwa habehi na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">mbali weye, mahulo hayezakukwenhukila.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Kwa meso yako mwenyewo kwizalola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">na kuwona wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile viwotagusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Weye kumtenda Mndewa Mulungu kuwa kimbililo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">kumtenda Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani kuwa hanhu haholile fana kaye yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />Mbuli zihile hazizakupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">na hulo hadizakwenhukila hema jako.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Kwaviya kezakulagilizila wasenga wake wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">wakukalize hohose hondaugende.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Wezakusola muna yamakono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">muladi sekeuikwale muna idibwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Kwizawahuma simba na mazoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">kwizawabojoga ng'hani simba weli na nguvu na mazoka.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizamkombola ija yonilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">nizamkaliza kwaviya konitogola niye Mulungu wake.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Yahanitanga, nizamwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nizakuwa hamwe nayo muna uuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nizamkombola na kumwing'ha hishima.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Nizamwing'ha chila chinhu chiyolonda muladi yakale siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">na nizamkombola.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli na wila wa Siku ya Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Vinoga kumtogoza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">na kwimba wila wa kuditogoza zina jako, weye Mndewa Mulungu Wili Uchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Vinoga kugong'onda ulondo wako imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">na uwaminika wako ichilo,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />kwa chia cha nyila chili na singija longo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">kwa ulilaji wa bango.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu, kutenda nideng'helele sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nizakwimba kwa deng'ho kwa ichimu cha sang'hano zako zoutendile.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Sang'hano zako weye Mndewa Mulungu ng'hulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">habule munhu yovimanya mbuli ziugesa.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Wabozi hawadaha kuzimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">mambunye hawazimanya mbuli izo.<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wosuka fana mayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">na wotenda ubananzi wokwalika fana maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">mbali uhelelo wawo ni kunangigwa.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">kotawala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Kwaviya kweli wehi wako weye Mndewa Mulungu wezakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">na wose wotenda mbuli zihile wezaimwaga.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Konitenda niwe na nguvu fana lume da ng'ombe mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">na kunitemela mate.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Meso yangu yawona wehi wangu viwohumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">magutwi yangu yahulika magayo ya wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakula fana mivumo itelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">wezakuwa fana migude ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Fana mibiki ihandigwe muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">yokula goya muna uluhelengo lwa Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Wanhu wano wezakwima matunda mbaka kuulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">wezakuwa na ubisi na mayani mengi.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Wagong'onde kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">yeye luwe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">kabule wihi.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mfalme</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">yeye niiyo mkulu na kana nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Isi yose kaigangamiza, nayo haizatingisika.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Chigoda chako cha chifalume, chigangamala kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">weye kwauko siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, bahali inuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">bahali ilandula madizi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">mawimbi yolandula mbumo.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kana ukulu ng'hani uchanyha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kana nguvu kufosa mbumo wa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kana nguvu kufosa mbumo wa mazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, malagilizo yako yagangamala ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">kaye yako yela siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu msemi wa wanhu wose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu ulihiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">weye Mulungu ulihiliza uilaguse.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Winuke weye mwene kuihumiza isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">uwataguse weli na magoda viya voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Mndewa Mulungu, vino wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezadeng'helela mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Mbuli zawo za magoda zolawa fana mazi yokuluma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">Wotenda mbuli zihile wose wamema magoda.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Wowananga wanhu wako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">woubananga uhazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Wowakoma wagane na nyambenyambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">wowakoma wachiwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Wolonga, “Mndewa Mulungu halola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Mulungu wa Yakobo havimanyile.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Muiteganye mweye wanhu wabozi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">mweye mambunye, mwizavimanya zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Yatendile digutwi hadahaze kuhulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Yalumbile ziso hadahaze kulola?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Yowazuma wanhu wa zisi hadahaze kutagusa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Yofundiza wanhu hadahaze kuvimanya?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kayamanya magesa ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">kayamanya kuwa hayafaya.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Wamweda wanhu waja wozumigwa na weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">wanhu wouwafunza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Kowahonya siku ya magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">mbaka wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile vondawahimbiligwe maleme.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Mndewa Mulungu hezawaleka wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">na hezawasa weli uhazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Wanhu wezahumizigwa fana voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">na wose wotenda mbuli zinogile wezatogola.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Yelihi yondayanitaze kuwalema wehi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Yelihi yondayanikalize na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />One Mndewa Mulungu hanitazile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">nihakalile hanhu ha ifa hahupike.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Vinilongile, “Mgulu wangu wotelebuka,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">baho ulondo wako Mndewa Mulungu unitaza.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Baho nikala na magesa mengi muna umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">utazi wako wousangalaza moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Weye hudaha kuilumba na watawala wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">wowogala magayo kwa malagilizo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Wawo woitogolela kuwakoma wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">kuwatagusa ifa wanhu welibule ubananzi.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">weye ni luwe lwangu lwa kukimbilila.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Kwizawaliha kwa uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">kwizawananga kwa wihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, kwizawananga.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Izoni chimwimbile Mndewa Mulungu kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">chimdeng'helele yeye yeli luwe yochikombola.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Chize kuulongozi wake kwa hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">chimdeng'helele kwa nyila za nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu ni Mulungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">na mfalume mkulu wa milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Kotawala zisi zose, kwandusila ikombo da isi digidimile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">iviya kotawala ludonho lwa milima.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Bahali ni yake, kwaviya niiyo yoyaitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">isi kailumba yeye.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Izoni, chitumbale mavindi chimtambikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">chitumbale mavindi haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu yachilumbile.<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Kwaviya niiyo Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">na cheye ni wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">cheye ng'hondolo wochidimigwa na yeye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">One diyelo muhahulika dizi jake,<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />sekemuitende mizoyo yenu kuwa midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">fana vimutendile uko Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">na fana vimutendile siku ija kuja Masa kuichuwala.<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Baho wasaho zenu wanigeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">wagendelela kunigeza, ingawa wawona sang'hano zonitendile.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Kwa miyaka malongo mane niwihila welesi uja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">nilonga, “Magesa ya wanhu wano yaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">wolema kuzindilila ndagilizi zangu.”<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Ivo niilaha kwa ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">“Hawezakwingila hanhu honiwasasalile kuhumula.”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa zisi zose wamtogoze Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">mweye wanhu wa zisi zose, mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu, ditogozeni zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">chila siku gong'ondeni ukombola wake.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Muwagong'ondele wanhu wa zisi zose ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">walongeleni wanhu wose sang'hano zake za mwazanyo.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu mkulu na kotogozigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">kodumbigwa na wanhu kufosa viidumbigwa milungu imwenga yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Kwaviya milungu yose ya zisi ni nyang'hiti muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">mbali Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yalumbile ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Hishima na ukulu kanavo yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">nguvu na unovu vahana ihanhu hake helile.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye wanhu wa chila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu yeli mkulu na yeli na nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kwa ukulu wa zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">galeni nhosa na mwingile muna zimbuga za kaye yake.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Mtambikileni Mndewa Mulungu yanogile na yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">wanhu wa zisi zose gudemekeni haulongozi hake.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Walongeleni wanhu wa zisi, “Mndewa Mulungu kotawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Kaitenda isi igangamale, haidaha kusegezigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Kezawahumiza wanhu voilondeka.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Vilumbe wose wa kuulanga wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">wanhu wa isi wasekelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">bahali na vose vili umo vibume.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Leka migunda na vose vili umo videng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">na mibiki yose ya kumbago imbe kwa deng'ho haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">kokwiza kuihumiza isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Kezazihumiza zisi voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">na kezazihumiza zisi kwa uwaminika wake.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">isi ideng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">visiwa vose visekelele.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Mawingu na ziza totolo vomzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">kuhumiza voilondeka na kutenda mbuli zigoloke, niicho chandusilo cha chigoda chake cha chifalume.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Moto womulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">wowasoma wehi wake banzi zose.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Lumwemwe lwake lumwemwesa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">isi iwona na igudemeka.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Milima ilumbuka fana uhula haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">haulongozi wa Mndewa wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Ulanga wogong'onda unovu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">na wanhu wose wauwona ukulu wake.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Wagumigwe vinyala wanhu wose wotambikila nyang'hiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">woigodela vinhu havifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">mweye milungu yose mtambikileni yeye.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Wanhu wa Sayuni wahulika na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">wanhu wa Yuda wasekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">kwa ichimu cha kuhumiza kwako weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa Kuchanyha Ng'hani kufosa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">weye kwa mchanyha ya milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Mweye womumulonda Mndewa Mulungu, muwihile wihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">Koukaliza ugima wa wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">na kuwakombola muna yamakono ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Bung'hulo dowalawilila wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">na deng'ho dowalawilila wanhu weli na moyo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Mweye mutenda mbuli zinogile, mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">na kuditogoza zina jake jelile.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mtawala wa zisi zose</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kwaviya katenda mbuli za mauzauza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">mkono wake wa kulume na chiganza chake chelile viwahuma wehi wake.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Mndewa Mulungu katenda ukombola wake umanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">kalagusa unovu wake muna izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Kakumbuka ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">na kakumbuka uwaminika wake kwa kaye ya Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Wanhu wa zisi za kutali wawona Mulungu wetu viyachikombole.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Isi yose imdeng'helele Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">imtogoze kwa nyila na ng'henze.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu kwa bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">mwimbileni kwa bango na dizi da lungole.<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Kwa ng'henze na mhalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">mdeng'heleleni Mndewa Mulungu yeli mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Bahali na vose vili umo vibume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">zisi zose na wanhu wose wokala umo iviya wabume.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Mizanda itowe mang'huwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">milima imbe hamwe kwa kudeng'helela haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kuhumiza isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">kezahumiza zisi zose voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">na kezawahumiza wanhu wose voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mtawala mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kotawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">zisi zogudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">kotawala viyokala uchanyha ya makelubi wa sanduku da lagano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">isi yotingisika.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mkulu uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">yeye ni mtawala mkulu wa makabila yose.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Waditogoze zina jake kulu da kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">yeye yelile.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Mfalume mkulu yolonda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">kogolosa zimbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">kohumiza voilondeka muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Mtogoleni Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">mtambikileni hanhu heli na chigoda cha kwikila magulu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">yeye yelile.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Musa na Haluni wakala wakulu wake wa nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samweli iviya kakala imwe wa waja waditangile zina jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">nayo kawedika.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Kalonga na Waisilaili muna diwingu dilingile fana mhanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">wazindilila malagilizo yake na ndagilizi zoweng'higwe.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, kuwedika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">Kukala Mulungu wa kulekelela kumwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">ingawa kuwatagusa kwa sang'hano zawo zihile.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">na mumtambikile hana umulima wake welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu kela.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa hewela</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Mtoweleni ng'henze Mndewa Mulungu, mweye wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Mtambikileni Mndewa Mulungu kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">izoni kuulongozi wake kuno mokwimba.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Muvimanye kuwa Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">niiyo yachilumbile na cheye cha wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">cheye cha wanhu wake na ng'hondolo wa bumbila jake.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Ingileni muna zinyivi zake kwa hewela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">ingileni muna uluwa wake kwa kutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mwing'heni hewela na muditogoze zina jake.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">uwaminika wake wokala kwa nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s">Ulangulizi unogile wa mfalume</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Nizakwimba wila wa ulondo wako na kuhumiza kwako voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">nizakwimbila weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Nizaigesa nzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">vino kwizakwiza kumwangu zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Nizatenda mbuli zangu kwa moyo umwe muna ikaye yangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Sizalola chinhu chochose chihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">nozihila sang'hano za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">niye sizailumba nawo.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Moyo wa usede wizasegela kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">sizatogola mbuli yoyose ihile.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Yomtendela udelenya mkaya miyage kwa mvisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">nizamnanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">Sizamfunyila umoyo yeli na meso ya chibuli na moyo wa magoda.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Nizawalola vinogile wanhu waminika muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">wadahe kukala hamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">yeye yotenda mbuli zake kwa moyo umwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">niiyo yondayanisang'hanile.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Habule munhu yoyose yotenda mbuli za uvwizi yokala mwiikaye yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">habule yolonga uvwizi yodaha kwima haulongozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Chila imitondo, nizawananga wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">nizawasegeza wanhu wehi kulawa muna dibululu da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula munhu yowoneligwa</para>
  <para style="d">Mbuli zoyopula munhu yeli na uzidilwa na munhu yolongelela kwa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uhulike chiya chonipula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">uhulike vonikupula unitaze.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Sekeunifise chihanga chako muna isiku ya uzidilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">ukinge digutwi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">unidike himahima lusita vinikupula.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Siku zangu zokwaga fana yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">mavuha yangu yolungula fana kala da moto.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Nibojogigwa muumoyo fana viya misavu na kunyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">na nizimiza kuja ndiya yangu.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Kwa ichimu cha kugutilila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">nisigala mavuha muhala.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Nadumwe fana ndege wa kuchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">nadumwe fana bundi matuwa muna yamatongo.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Nogona meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">niwa fana ndege yeli dumwe muichisuwili.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Wehi wangu woning'ong'a siku yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">waja wonizunguluka wodisang'hanila zina jangu kwa kuduwila.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Noja maivu fana ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">masozi yolagalila muna iching'waji changu,<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />kwa ichimu cha ludoko lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">Kuninula na kunyasa kumgwazo.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Siku zangu zofosa fana sisila da ichigulogulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">nonyala fana mayani.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu kokala muna ichigoda chako cha chifalume siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">zina jako dizakumbukigwa na nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Weye kwizakwinuka na kudiwonela ubazi bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">kwaviya lusita lufika lwa kuditendela mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">lusita louwikile lufika.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Kwaviya wasang'hani wako wayanogela mabwe ya bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">na kuyawonela ubazi matimbwisi yotimuka lusita lwa kubomola.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Wanhu wa zisi wezadidumba zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">wafalume wose mwiisi wezadumba ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kezadizenga kaidi bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">vondauwoneke ukulu wake.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Kezawedika chiwopula wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">hezalema chiwopula.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Mbuli ino yandikigwe kwa ichimu cha welesi ukwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">muladi wanhu wondawaumbigwe hamwande, wamtogole Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kalola hasi kulawa hanhu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">kalola isi kulawa kuulanga,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />muladi yawategeleza wafungwa viwolila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">na yawatende wailegehe waja watagusigwe kudanganika.<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Ivo zina da Mndewa Mulungu dizagong'ondigwa uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">na nhogolwa zake zizagong'ondigwa uko Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />wanhu na falume vondawaiting'hane hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">muladi kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Mulungu kanihunguzila nguvu ning'hali mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">kauhunguza ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Ivo nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">“Weye Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">sekeunisole sambi ning'hali mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">weye kokala nyelesi zose.”<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Umwaka kwika chandusilo cha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">na ulanga ni sang'hano ya makono yako.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Vinhu ivo vizawola, mbali weye kwizakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">vose vizasakala fana mawalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">navo vizasegela.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Mbali weye niiyo ija ija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">na miyaka yako haizamala.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Wana wa wasang'hani wako wezakala haulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">na welesi wawo wezakwikigwa goya haulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogoza Mulungu kwa ubazi wake</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Weye moyo wangu, umtogole Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">vose vili mgati yangu viditogoze zina jake jelile.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Weye moyo wangu, umtogole Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">na sekeuzimize mbuli ziyakutendele.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Niiyo yolekelela ubananzi wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">na kokuhonya matamu yako yose.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Koukombola ugima wako kulawa muna dileme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">kokutemela mate na kokuwonela ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Niiyo yokutendela goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">nguvu zako zizabwelezigwa fana masumula.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kohumiza vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">kowahumiza voilondeka wose wowoneligwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Kamtenda Musa yazimanye nzila zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">na kawatenda wanhu wa Isilaili wazimanye sang'hano zake.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamema ubazi na unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">hawona ludoko himahima, mbali kamema ulondo wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Hezachilongeleza siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">na hezagendelela kuwona ludoko.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Hachitagusa kwa uhasanyi fana viilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">na hachilihilizila fana uhasanyi wetu viulondeka kulihilizigwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Kwaviya fana viya ulanga viuli uchanyha ya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">niivo ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo viuli mkulu kwa waja womdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Fana ulawilo wa zuwa viuli kutali na uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">niivo Mndewa Mulungu viyowika kutali uhasanyi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Fana viya tata viyowawonela ubazi wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">niivo Mndewa Mulungu viyowawonela ubazi wanhu womdumba.<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Kwaviya yeye kochimanya viya vochilumbigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">na kukumbuka kuwa cheye ni matimbwisi.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Ugima wa munhu ulinga fana viya masavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">kokwalika fana viya luwa da mumgunda.<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />Beho dofosa uchanyha yake na dosegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">hadiwoneka kaidi hanhu hadikalile.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Mbali ulondo wa kufunya umoyo wa Mndewa Mulungu wokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">kwa waja wose womdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">na unovu wake wokala nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />Ulondo wake wokala kwa waja wose wozindilila lagano jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">na wokumbuka kwamha malagilizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Mndewa Mulungu keka chigoda chake cha chifalume kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">nayo kotawala vinhu vose.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye wasenga wake wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">mweye mugangamale, womuitenda mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">womuzindilila mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Mweye bumbila jake jose da wakalizi wa kuulanga, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">Mtogoleni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye wasang'hani wake womutenda mbuli zoyolonda.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Mweye wose mulumbigwe na Mndewa Mulungu, mtogozeni yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">mtogozeni chila hanhu hake hoyotawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Weye moyo wangu, umtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogoza mulumbaji</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Weye moyo wangu umtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa mkulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">kuvala hishima na ukulu fana mawalo.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Kuivaza bung'hulo fana walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">kwanzanza ulanga fana hema.<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />Kuzenga mhanda za kaye yako uchanyha ya mazi ya kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">kuyatenda mawingu kuwa tololi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">kuguluka uchanyha ya mabawa ya beho.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Kutenda beho kuwa wasenga wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">na kutenda milambi ya moto kuwa wasang'hani wako.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Kuika isi muna ivandusilo vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">haizatingisika ng'o.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Kuigubika isi kwa bahali fana viya walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">mazi yema uchanyha ya milima.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Mbali uhalagiliza mazi yokimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">uhabuma mazi yohalawa.<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />Milima ima zugaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">makolongo yalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">hanhu haulondile.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Kuyekila mhaka mazi sekeyaloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">na sekeyaigubike isi kaidi.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Kotenda nzasa zitile mazi mengi muna yamakolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">mazi yokilima hagati ya milima.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Nzasa ziya zoweng'ha mazi wanyama wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">mhunda wa kumbago wokanha ng'hilu zawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Ndege wa kuulanga wozenga visanza vawo mumgwazogwazo ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">wokwimba muna yamatambi.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Koitonyela milima kulawa kuchanyha hanhu houkala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">na koitemela mate isi iwe na mavuno ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Kokoteza mgina kwa ichimu cha ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">kokoteza mboga kwa ichimu cha wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">muladi wapate ndiya kulawa muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />Iviya wapate divai iudeng'heleze moyo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">wapate mavuta ya zaituni ya kubung'hula chihanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">na wapate gate da kuguma nguvu muna ulukuli.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Mibiki ya Mndewa Mulungu yopata mazi ya kufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">mielezi ya Lebanoni iyahandile, yokwitililigwa mazi.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Umo ndege wozenga visanza vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">mahondohondo wana mbane.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Milima mitali ni ukazi wa luti wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">na miluwe ni hanhu howokimbilila nyegele.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Katenda mwezi muladi kuchikila lusita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">zuwa najo divimanya lusita lwa kuswa.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Weye kogala ziza, yokuwa ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">wanyama wose wa kumbago wozunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Simba wotongoloma muladi wapate ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">wozahila ndiya yawo kulawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Zuwa dahalawa wohita kumwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">na wobwela kugona muna yamatuka yawo.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Maabaho wanhu wohita kuna zisang'hano zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">wohita kusang'hana usang'hano mbaka ichigulogulo.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kusang'hana mbuli nyingi ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">Zose kuzitenda kwa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">isi imema vilumbe vako.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Kuna bahali ng'hulu na ngalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">kumema vilumbe havipeteka bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">vilumbe vigima, vikulu na vidododo.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Meli zofosa umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">muna ibahali iyo kokala Lewiasani yalumbigwe yangale umo.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Vilumbe wawo wose wokuhuwila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">uweng'he ndiya yawo kwa lusita lwake.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Weye koweng'ha ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">na wawo woidondola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">Weye koufungula mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">na wawo wokwiguta vinhu vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Viufisa chihanga chako, wodumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">Viusegeza muhe wawo, wodanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">na wobwela muna yamatimbwisi kuwalawile.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Uhawahuvila muhe wako, wawo wolumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">na koitenda isi iwe na ulongo unogile.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu ukale siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Mndewa Mulungu yadeng'helele sang'hano zake mwenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Koilola isi nayo yogudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">koidalisa milima nayo yolava yosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Nizamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">nizamtogola Mulungu wangu lusita lwose lonikala.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unogelwe na magesa yangu yano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">kwaviya nokudeng'helela weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Wahasanyi wanangigwe muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile sekewawe uko kaidi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Weye moyo wangu umtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kofikiza lagano doyawalaganile wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu na mumtogoze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">Walongeleni wanhu wa zisi zose mbuli ziyatendile.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Mwimbileni yeye, mwimbileni kwa nyila za nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">gong'ondeni sang'hano zake za mauzauza.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Muigodele zina jake jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">waja womzahila Mndewa Mulungu, wadeng'helele.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu na muhuwile nguvu zake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">Mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Mukumbuke mawewedeko yoyasang'hane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">muyakumbuke mauzauza yake na viya viyahumize,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />mweye welesi wa Bulahimu msang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">mweye welesi wa Yakobo, womusaguligwe nayo.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Yeye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">kowahumiza wanhu muna izisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Yeye kokumbuka lagano jake siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">mbuli iyawalagilize wanhu wa nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Kokumbuka lagano diyatendile na Bulahimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">kokumbuka chilaho chiyamulahile Isaka.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Kadigangamiza lagano ijo kwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">na kamwing'ha Isilaili lagano diwe da siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Kalonga, “Nizakwing'ha isi ya Kanaani iwe yako.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Hawakalile wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">wakala wadodo, iviya wakala wafosanzila muna iisi ya Kanaani,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />wawegela chila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">walawa ufalume umwe wahita ufalume umwenga.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Mulungu hamulekele munhu yawawonele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">na kawakalikila wafalume kwa ichimu chawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />Kalonga, “Sekemuwadalise wanhu wangu woniwasagule kwa sang'hano yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">na sekemuwalumize walotezi wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Mulungu kagala nzala muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">kabananga ndiya yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Mbali kawalongozela munhu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Yosefu yoyaguligwe uko fana mtumwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Wamulumiza migulu yake kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">wamfunga kwa zuma mwiisingo.<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />Mbaka mbuli ziya ziyalotele zilawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu ilagusa kuwa Yosefu kalonga goya.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Mfalume kawatuma wanhu wamfungule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">mkulu wa wanhu kamulekela yailegehe.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Kamwika kuwa mndewa wa kaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">na mtawala wa vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />Yosefu kawalongoza wakulu wa mfalume viyalondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na kawafunza ubala walala wa mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Baho Isilaili kengila mwiisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakobo kawa mfosanzila muna iisi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Mulungu kawatenda wanhu wake weleke ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">kawatenda wawe wengi kufosa wehi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Kawahindula Wamisili wawehile wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">na Wamisili wawatendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Kamtuma Musa msang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">hamwe na Haluni yoyamsagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Watenda vilaguso va Mulungu kwa Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">na mauzauza muna isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Mulungu kagala ziza muna iisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">mbali Wamisili walema mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Kagalusa mazi yawo kuwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">kawakoma somba wawo wose.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Isi yawo imema mabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">mbaka yengila muna ikaye ya mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Mulungu kalonga na yalawilila mabumbila ya ng'honzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">na ulombe muna iisi yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Kaigalusa mvula kuwa mvula ya mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">na lumwemwe lumwemwesa isi yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />Kainanga mizabibu na mibiki ya mitini yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">iviya kaibena mibiki ya isi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Mulungu kalonga na walawilila nzige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">na mbalangulu hawapeteka.<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />Waigegeda mimeya yose muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">wayaja mazao yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Kawakoma wana waudele muna iisi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">kawananga wana wa mwanduso wa Wamisili.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Maabaho kawalava wanhu wa Isilaili kuno wana hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">muna yamakabila yawo habule yaikwalile.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Wamisili wadeng'helela viwasegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwaviya wadumba kwa ichimu chawo.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Mulungu katanda wingu mchanyha kuwagubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">na kagala moto ulave bung'hulo ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Viwapulile kawagalila ng'hwale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">kawegutiza ndiya ya kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Kautula luwe, mazi yalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">na yakilima muna dibwilingu fana lwanda.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Kwaviya kakumbuka chilagano chake chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">chiyamulaganile Bulahimu msang'hani wake.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Kawalava wanhu wake kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">wanhu woyawasagule wadeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Kaweng'ha zisi za manyambenyambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">wasola matunda yawahandile wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />Mulungu katenda ivo muladi wanhu wake wamhe ndagilizi zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">na kuzindilila malagilizo yake.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s">Unovu wa Mulungu kwa wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">kwaviya ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Yelihi yodaha kuzilonga sang'hano ng'hulu zose za Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Yelihi yodaha kuzilonga nhogolwa zake zose?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Wamweda wanhu waja wohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">na kutenda mbuli zinogile siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unikumbuke vondauwatemele mate wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">vondauwakombole wanhu wako, iviya unikombole na niye.<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />Utende ivo muladi nidahe kudeng'helela viuwatemela mate wanhu wako wouwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">nipate kudeng'helela hamwe na wanhu wa isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">na niigodele weye hamwe na wahazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Cheye na wasaho zetu chihasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">chibananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">chitenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Wasaho zetu viwakalile Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawagesile mauzauza ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">hawakumbuke ulondo wake mkulu wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">mbali wamulema uko kumgwazogwazo mwa bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Mbali kawakombola kwa ichimu cha zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">muladi yalaguse nguvu yake ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Kaibwakila bahali ya Shamu, nayo inyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">kawafoseza umo fana muna iisi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Kawakombola muna yamakono ya wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">kawalopola muna zinguvu za wehi.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Mazi yawagubika wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">hasigale hata imwe wawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Baho wanhu wake wahuwila mbuli zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">wamwimbila nyila za nhogolwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Wazimiza himahima choyatendile Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">hawagozile magesa yake.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Mbali walonda ng'hani ndiya uko kudibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">wamgeza Mulungu mwiichuwala.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Nayo kaweng'ha chiya chiwapulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">mbali kawagalila mitamu ihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Kuja kudilago wamuwonela migongo Musa na Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">Haluni niiyo mkulu wa nhambiko yelile wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Baho isi itulika na immela Dasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">imgubika Abilamu na bumbila jake.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Moto uwalunguza wanhu wawasondelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">milambi ya moto iwananga wanhu wawo wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Waisilaili watenda dang'ang'a da zahabu uko Holebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">waitambikila nyang'hiti iyo ya chuma.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Wauhindula ukulu wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">kuwa fana ng'ombe yoja mgina.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Wamzimiza Mulungu mulopozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">yatendile mbuli ng'hulu muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />Wazimiza mauzauza yake muna iisi ya Hamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">na mbuli za kudumbiza muna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Mulungu kalonga kuwa kezawananga wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">mbali Musa ija yasaguligwe kengilila hagati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">kakimilila ludoko lwake sekeluwanange.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Maabaho waizeha isi ija ya kunogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">kwaviya hawahuwile chilagano cha Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Walongelela muna yamahema yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">na hawamtegeleze Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Ivo Mulungu kenula mkono kailaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">kuwa kezawanangila muna dibwilingu.<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />Kawapwililisa welekwa wawo hagati ya wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">kawagala muna izisi zimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Maabaho wailumba kutambika kwa mulungu yotangigwa Baali wauko Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">waja nyama zilavigwe nhambiko kwa milungu yawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Wamtenda Mndewa Mulungu yawone ludoko kwa sang'hano zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">wapata hulo.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Mbali Finehasi kema kutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">na dihulo diya dikimililigwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Mbuli iyo imulagusa kuwa kana haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">kwandusila lusita ulwo mbaka welesi wose.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Wamtendeza Mndewa Mulungu yawone ludoko kuna yamazi ya Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">na Musa kapata uzidilwa kwa ichimu chawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Wamulema muhe wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">na Musa kalonga mbuli za chibozi.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Hawawakomile wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">fana Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize.<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />Mbali waihanganya na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">na waifunza viya viwokala.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Watambikila nyang'hiti za milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">nazo ziwa mtego kumwawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Wawalava wana wawo wa chilume na wa chike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">kuwa nhambiko kwa vinyamkela.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Wawakoma wana welibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">wawachinja wana wawo wa chilume na wa chike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">Niiwawo walavile nhambiko kwa nyang'hiti za milungu ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">na isi yambula mwiko kwa ukomaji uwo.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Niivo viwambule mwiko kwa mbuli ziwatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">wamtendela umalaya Mulungu kwa mbuli zawo ziwatendile.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Mndewa Mulungu, kawawonela ludoko wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">kawehila wahazi wake.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Kawaguma muna yamakono ya wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">muladi wehi wawo wawatawale.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Wehi wawo wawawonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">na wawawangiliza kusang'hana usang'hano.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Miyanza mingi Mulungu kawakombola wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">mbali wawo wasagula kumuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">na wagidimila muna uhasanyi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Mbali kalola uzidilwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">viyahulike ndilo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Kwa ichimu chawo kadikumbuka lagano jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">kawawonela ubazi kwa ulondo wake mkulu wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">kaleka kuwona ludoko.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Kawatenda waja wawasolile wawawonele ubazi Waisilaili.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, uchikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">uchiduganye hamwe kulawa muna izisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">muladi chiding'he hewela zina jako jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na chiigodele sang'hano zako zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">kwandusila umwaka na siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Wanhu wose walonge, “Ivo!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="ms">Chitabu chetano</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 107-150">Zabuli 107-150</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa kwa Mulungu yanogile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">kwaviya ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Waja wakomboligwe na Mndewa Mulungu walonge mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">niiyo waja wakomboligwe muna yamagayo.<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />Kawaduganya kulawa muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa na uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa kasikazi na kusi.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Wawegela muna ichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">na hawawonile nzila ya kuwagala muna dibululu da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Wawona nzala na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">wabeneka moyo ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Ivo muna yamagayo yawo wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">nayo kawalopola muna uzidilwa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Kawalongoza muna inzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">mbaka wadifikila bululu da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">na kwa ichimu cha mauzauza yoyawatendele wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Yeye kowang'hwiza wanhu weli na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na kowegutiza weli na nzala vinhu vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Wamwenga wakalile muna diziza da sisila da ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wafungwa wakalile muna yamagayo na minyololo,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />kwaviya wayehula malagilizo ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">na waizeha mbuli ya Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Wakala walegele kwa sang'hano ndala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">wagwa hasi na hakukalile munhu yoyose wa kuwataza.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Ivo muna yamagayo yawo wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">nayo kawalopola muna uzidilwa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Kawalava muna diziza na uzidilwa wa ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">na minyololo yawo kaibenabena.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">na kwa ichimu cha mauzauza yoyawatendele wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Kwaviya kobena na kufungula nyivi za shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">na kukanhakanha mango za chuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Wamwenga wengila ubozi kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">wengila magayo kwa ichimu cha wihi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Hawalondile kuja chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">wazikwenhukila nyivi ng'hulu za ifa.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Ivo muna yamagayo yawo wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">nayo kawalopola muna uzidilwa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Kwa mbuli yake kawahonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">kawakombola muladi sekewanangigwe.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">na kwa ichimu cha mauzauza yoyawatendele wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Wamulavile nhambiko za hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">na kusimulila sang'hano zake kwa nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Wamwenga wagenda mwiibahali kwa meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">na kutenda sang'hano zawo umo muna ibahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Waziwona sang'hano za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">waziwona mbuli za mauzauza zozitendigwe uko.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Mana kalonga na kagala beho kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">diyenule mawimbi ya bahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Wasigwa mchanyha kuulanga, maabaho hasi hagidimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">ugalu wawo uwamalila muna uzidilwa uwo.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Wayumbayumba na wazazalika fana munhu yakoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ugalu wawo wose umala.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Wamulamba Mndewa Mulungu muna yamagayo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">kawalopola muna uzidilwa wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Kanyamaliza tibwilitibwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">na mawimbi yahupika.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Baho wadeng'helela kwaviya bahali ihupika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">kawafikiza kuna ichiloko chowochihitila.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">na kwa ichimu cha mauzauza yoyawatendele wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Mtogozeni muna umting'hano wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">na mumtogoze muna dilundo da walala.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Mulungu koigalusa mizanda kuwa bwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">na kozigalusa nzasa zinyale.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Koigalusa isi ili na ulongo unogile kuwa na ulongo wa munyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwa ichimu cha mbuli zihile za wakaya wokala uko.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Kogalusa bwilingu kuwa malamba ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">na isi inyalile kuwa nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Kowagala wanhu weli na nzala muna iisi iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">na wozenga bululu da kukala.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Wolima migunda na wohanda mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">na wogobola vinhu vawo mvunyo.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Kowatemela mate wanhu wake na wokongezeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">Hayahunguza mabumbila ya wanyama wawo.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Wehi wawo wohunguka na wokuwa nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">kwa kuwoniligwa na magayo na usungu.<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Kawazeha wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">na kawatenda wawegele mwiichuwala chilibule nzila.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Mbali kowakombola waja wolonda kutazigwa muna uuzidilwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">na kongeza welesi wawo fana bumbila da ng'hondolo.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Weli na moyo unogile wowona na wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wonyamazigwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Weli na ubala wazilole mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">waugese ulondo wa kufunya umoyo wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukalizigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi na wila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Weye Mulungu, moyo wangu haudumba chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">nizakwimba wila wa nhogolwa kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Nizalamka kuno notowa bango na chinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">nizalamka chilochilo kwa wila wangu.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu nizakwing'ha hewela hagati ya wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">nizakwimbila nhogolwa hagati ya wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Kwaviya ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo umema mbaka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">na uwaminika wako umema mbaka kuna yamawingu.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Utogozigwe weye Mulungu uli kuchanyha kuulanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">Ukulu wako wenele chila hanhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Unikombole na unitaze kwa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">muladi wanhu wouwalonda walopoligwe.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Mulungu kalonga kulawa hanhu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">“Kwa deng'ho na uhumi, nizaigola isi ya Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">nizadilinga bawe da Sukosi.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Isi ya Gileadi ni yangu na isi ya Manase ni yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">isi ya Efulaimu ni kingilo da ditwi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">na isi ya Yuda ni fimbo yangu ya utawala.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Isi ya Moabu yonisang'hanila fana ziga da kunawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">nizayasila isi ya Edomu chilatu changu kulagusa ni yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">nodeng'helela kupotigwa kwa Filisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Yelihi yondayanigale kuna dibululu dili na mhongono?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Yelihi yondayanilongoze mbaka Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Vino weye Mulungu huchilemile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Huhita kaidi na watowang'hondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Uchitaze chihaitowa na wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">kwaviya kutazigwa na wanhu hakufaya chinhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Mulungu yahawa na cheye, chizahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">na kezawahonda wehi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s">Kulongelela kwa munhu yogaya</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Weye Mulungu yonikutogoza, sekeunyamale.<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />Kwaviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile na wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">wonigubulila milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">wonilonga kwa uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Wonilonga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">woitowa na niye bila chimu chochose.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Niwalonda mbali wawo wanilongeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">Na niye nowapulila.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Waniliha mbuli zihile kwa mbuli zinogile zoniwatendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">na waniliha wihi kwa ulondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Umsagule munhu yotenda mbuli zihile yamulongeleze mwihi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">na munhu yomulongeleza yeme ubanzi wake wa kulume.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Yahahumizigwa, kezawoneka katenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">mbaka mbuli ziyopula zizawoneka kuwa uhasanyi.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Siku zake ziwe ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">munhu imwenga yasole sang'hano yake ya ulangulizi.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Wanage wawe wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">muke wake yawe mkefilwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Wanage wezawegela na kupulapula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">wawingigwe muna yamatongo yawo.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Munhu yomdai chinhu yamuhoke vinhu vake vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">na nyambenyambe wasole sang'hano yake.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Sekeyawe uko munhu wa kumuwonela ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">sekeyawe uko munhu wa kuwagesa wachiwa wake.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Welekwa wake wose wadanganizigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">zina jake dizimizigwe muna izinyelesi zikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Mndewa Mulungu yaukumbuke wihi wa walala wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">uhasanyi wa mami yake sekeusegezigwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Mndewa Mulungu yaukumbuke uhasanyi wawo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">mbali wawo wenyewo wazimizigwe muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Kwaviya munhu ija hagesile kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">mbali kamuwinga ngayengaye na munhu yolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">mbaka munhu yabeneke umoyo kadanganika.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Kalonda kuwaduwila wanhu mbali duwilo dimpata mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">halondile kuwatemela mate wamwenga, nayo iviya hatemeligwe mate.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Kaiyawala duwilo fana viya walo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">dimwingila muumoyo fana viya mazi viyong'wigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">na fana viya mavuha yake viyofonza mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Duwilo dimgubike fana walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">dimzunguluke fana viya mkwiji.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Mndewa Mulungu yawalihe wanhu wonilongeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">waja wonilonga vihile.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">unitendele mbuli zinogile kwa ichimu cha zina jako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">Kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo, unikombole.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Kwaviya niye ngayengaye na nolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">na moyo wangu wolumila.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Nosegela fana sisila da ichigulogulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">nohembelusigwa fana nzige.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Mavindi yangu yalegela kwa ichimu cha kufunga kuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">lukuli lwangu lusoka.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Niwa munhu wa kuzehigwa na wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">wahaniwona wotingisa matwi yawo.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">unikombole kwa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Wanhu wavimanye kuwa niuwo mkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">wavimanye kuwa weye Mndewa Mulungu, kuzitenda mbuli izo.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Wawo wahaduwila, weye konitemela mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">wanhu wose wonitowa niye, kowaguma chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">mbali niye msang'hani wako nodeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Waja wonilongeleza wavazigwe chinyala fana walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">na waigubike chinyala fana mgolole.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Nizamwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">nizamtogoza hana ulung'husesa.<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Kwaviya yeye kokwima mkono wa kulume wa munhu yolonda kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">muladi kumkombola kulawa kwa wanhu womtagusa.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatenda wanhu wahume</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Mndewa Mulungu komulongela mwenevale wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Kala ubanzi wangu wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">mbaka niweke wehi wako hasi ya magulu yako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kezautenda ufalume wake ugalamuke kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">na weye kwizatawala kuno wehi wako wakuzinga.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Wanhu wako wezakwizila bila kuwangilizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">siku vondauhite kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">uchanyha ya milima yelile wezakwizila wabwanga wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">fana nhungwe viigwa chilochilo ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kailaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">na hezagalula bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Weye ni mkulu wa nhambiko siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">fana viya ukulu wa nhambiko wa Melikizedeki.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Mndewa kaubanzi wako wa kulume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">Kezawahonda wafalume, siku ya ludoko lwake.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Kezazihumiza zisi na kuwakoma wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">kezawahonda walangulizi chila hanhu muna iisi yose.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Mfalume kezakung'wa mazi ya lwanda mwiinzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">ivo kezakwinula ditwi jake kwa uhumi.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kotogozigwa kwa sang'hano zake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Nizamwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">hagati ha wanhu wengi wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Sang'hano za Mndewa Mulungu ni ng'hulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">wanhu wose wonogelwa nazo wozigelegeza.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Chila chiyotenda china hishima na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">unovu wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Katenda sang'hano zake za mauzauza zikumbukigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Mndewa Mulungu kanoga na kana ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Koweng'ha ndiya wawo wowomdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">kezakumbuka lagano jake siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Kawalagusa wanhu wake nguvu za sang'hano zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">na kaweng'ha zisi za wanhu wamwenga ziwe uhazi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Sang'hano zake zigoloka na zokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">malagilizo yake yose ni ya kuhuwiligwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Malagilizo yake yakale siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">yatendeke kwa uwaminika na voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Kawakombola wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">kaweng'ha lagano jake diwe da siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">Zina jake jela na da kudumbiza.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Uhalonda ubala wanduse kwa kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">wose wozindilila malagilizo yake wana umanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Nhogolwa zake zokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s">Kudeng'helela kwa munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Wamweda wanhu waja womdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">wamweda waja wodeng'helela malagilizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Wana wawo wezakuwa na nguvu ng'hani muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">Welesi uja woutenda mbuli zinogile wizatemeligwa mate.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Muna zikaye zawo muna vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">mbuli zawo zinogile zokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Muna diziza bung'hulo dombung'hulila munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">bung'hulo dombung'hulila munhu yeli na ubazi na uhole na yotenda mbuli zigoloke.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Wamweda wanhu waja woweng'ha wamwenga kwa makono maidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">wokwazimisha wamwenga mbali hawalonda limangwe.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Kwaviya hawezatingisigwa hata chidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakumbukigwa siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Hawadumba mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">mizoyo yawo igangamala na womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Wagangamala na hawadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">mbaka wezawahuma wehi wawo.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Walava kwa makono maidi, waweng'ha vinhu ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">mbuli zawo zinogile zokala siku zose na wezahishimigwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Wabananzi viwowona mbuli izo wokuwa na ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">wokwesa ng'hombali kwa kwihiligwa na wopotwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">huwilo da wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile dokwaga.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa kwa Mulungu mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">Mweye wasang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">ditogozeni zina da Mndewa Mulungu!<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Zina da Mndewa Mulungu ditogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">kwandusila diyelo mbaka siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">zina da Mndewa Mulungu dolondeka kutogozigwa.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kotawala zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ukulu wake ufika kuchanyha kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Yelihi yeli fana Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">yokala uchanyha ng'hani?<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />Yelihi yeli fana Mndewa Mulungu yolola hasi, yawone ulanga na isi?<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Komwinula ngayengaye kulawa kuna ditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">na komwinula munhu yolonda kutazigwa kulawa kuna dizalala,<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />na kowatenda wakale hamwe na wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">hamwe na wafalume wa wanhu wake.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Komtenda muke halela yapate welesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">komtenda yadeng'helele kwa kumwing'ha wana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kotawala zisi zose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Waisilaili viwasegele Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">welesi wa Yakobo viulawile muna iisi ya chigeni,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />isi ya Yuda itendigwa kuwa kaye yelile ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">nayo isi ya Isilaili iwa ufalume wake.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Bahali ya Shamu viimuwonile Mulungu ikimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">lwanda lwa Yoludani luleka kukuluma.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Milima izumhazumha fana mabebelu ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">vilima vizumhazumha fana wanang'hondolo.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Weye bahali, habali kukimbila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Weye Yoludani habali kuleka kukuluma?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Mweye milima habali muzumha fana mabebelu ya ng'hondolo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Mweye vilima habali muzumha fana wanang'hondolo?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Gudemeka weye isi haulongozi wa Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">gudemeka haulongozi wa Mulungu wa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />Ija yogalusa luwe kuwa lamba da mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">yogalusa dibwe dala kuwa nzasa ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu imwe wa kweli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeuchitogoze cheye mbali uditogoze zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo na uwaminika wako.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Habali wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Kakulihi Mulungu wawo?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Mulungu wetu kakuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">kotenda mbuli zose zoyolonda.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Nyang'hiti za milungu yawo zolumbigwa kwa hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">zotendigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Zina milomo mbali hazidaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">zina meso mbali hazidaha kulola.<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />Zina magutwi mbali hazidaha kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">zina mhula mbali hazidaha kunusa.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Zina makono mbali hazidaha kwamha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">zina magulu mbali hazidaha kugenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">zina milomo mbali hazidaha hata chidogo kulava dizi.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Waja wozitenda wezalinga fana izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">iviya wose wozihuwila wezalinga fana izo.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Mweye Waisilaili muhuwileni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">yeye niiyo mtazi wenu na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Mweye wanhu wa kaye ya Haluni, muhuwileni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">yeye niiyo mtazi wenu na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Mweye womumdumba Mndewa Mulungu, muhuwileni yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">yeye niiyo mtazi wenu na ngao yenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kachikumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">nayo kezachitemela mate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">Kezaitemela mate kaye ya Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">Kezaitemela mate kaye ya Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />Kezawatemela mate waja womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">kezawatemela mate wakulu na wadodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Mndewa Mulungu yamtendeni mongezeke mweye wose na wanenu.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Mndewa Mulungu yalumbile ulanga na isi, yamtemeleni mate.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Ulanga ni wa Mndewa Mulungu muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">mbali isi kaweng'ha wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Wanhu wadanganike hawamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">waja wohumuluka hanhu hahupike ha ifa hawamtogoza.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Mbali cheye chili wagima chizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">kwandusila diyelo na siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s">Hewela kwa kukomboligwa muna iifa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Nomulonda Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kwaviya kanihulika dizi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">kanitegeleza vinimpulile yaniwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Nomulonda kwaviya chila lusita vinimpula, yeye konhegeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">Ivo nizampula siku zose za ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Nzabi za ifa zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">mawine makulu ya kuzimu yamhata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nipatigwa na magayo na lugano.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Maabaho niditanga zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba, unilopole!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kana unovu na haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Mulungu wetu kana ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wozahila kuvimanya kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">vinikalile muna yamagayo kanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Weye moyo wangu bwela hanhu hako ha kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakutendela mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu kunilopola muna iifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">na kunihangusa masozi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">iviya kunikaliza magulu yangu sekeniikwale.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Nizakala kwa kumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">muna iisi ya wanhu wagima.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Nimuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu vinilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">“Niye nosafagila ng'hani.”<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Nilonga bila kugesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Wanhu wose wavwizi.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Nimbwelezele choni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwa vinhu vose vinogile voyanhendele?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Nizamulavila nhosa ya divai ya ulopozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">Nizapula kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Nizafikiza vilaho vangu kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">na haulongozi wa wanhu wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Ifa ya wanhu wake wokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">si mbuli ndodo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, niye msang'hani wako kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">niye msang'hani wako mwana wa msang'hani wako wa chike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">kuizuhula minyololo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Nizakulavila nhambiko ya hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">na nizapula kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Nizavifikiza vilaho vangu kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">na haulongozi ha wanhu wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />Nizavifikiza muna ulubuga lwa kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">mgati yako, weye Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">mweye wanhu wa zisi zose, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Kwaviya ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo kumwetu ni mkulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">uwaminika wa Mndewa Mulungu wokala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s">Kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Waisilaili walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">“Ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Welesi wa Haluni walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">“Ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Wanhu womdumba Mndewa Mulungu walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Muna yamagayo yangu nimtanga Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">Mndewa Mulungu kanidika na kanikombola.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na niye, sizadumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">Vino munhu kodaha kunitenda choni?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na niye kunitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">ivo nizawawona waja wonihila wopotigwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Muhavu kumkimbilila Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">kufosa kumuhuwila munhu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Muhavu kumkimbilila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">kufosa kuwahuwila wafalume.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">mbali kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu niwahuma.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Wanizunguluka banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">mbali kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu niwahuma.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Wanizunguluka fana nyuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">mbali watakamila fana viya mbaya inyalile viikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu niwahuma wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Nisung'higwa kwa nguvu nigwe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kanigangamiza na kunikaliza.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Mndewa Mulungu iyo yonigangamiza na kunigombela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">kanikombola kulawa kwa wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Madizi ya wanhu wodeng'helela kuhuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">yohulikika muna yamahema ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">“Mkono wa kulume wa Mndewa Mulungu wotenda mbuli ng'hulu!<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Mkono wa kulume wa Mndewa Mulungu winuligwa uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">Mkono wa Mndewa Mulungu unitaza kuwahuma wehi!”<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Sizadanganika, mbali nizakuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">nizazisimulila sang'hano zoyatendile Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kanitagusa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">mbali hanilekile nidanganike.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Nivugulileni nyivi za Kaye ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">nizakwingila na kumwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Uno niuwo lwivi lwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakwingila umo.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Nokwing'ha hewela kwaviya kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">weye kuwa mkombola wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Dibwe dowalemile wazenzi kuzengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">diwa dibwe dinogile kufosa mabwe yose ya kuzengela.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kachitenda chinhu chino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">na chiwa chinhu cha mwazanyo ng'hani kumwetu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Iyo ni siku yoyaitendile Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">kwa ichimu chake chideng'helele na kusekelela.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu chokupula uchikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">weye Mndewa Mulungu chokulamba uchitemele mate.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Yatemeligwe mate yokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">muna Ikaye ya Mulungu chowatemela mate mweye.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">nayo niiyo yachimwemwesele bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">yamheni matambi muna umkono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">muilumbe hamwe kutenda dugila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">mbaka kuna zimhembe za lupango.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Weye niiyo Mulungu wangu, nokwing'ha hewela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">weye niiyo Mulungu wangu, nizakutogoza.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Wamweda wanhu waja welibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">waja wozindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Wamweda waja wotegeleza ukalangama wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">waja womzahila Mulungu kwa mizoyo yawo yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Wanhu wano hawatenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">mbali wogenda muna zinzila zake.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Weye kulava ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">muladi chizamhe vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Nolonda ugenzi wangu ugangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">kwa kuyazindilila malagilizo yako!<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Maabaho sizagumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">vonigesa ndagilizi zako zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Nizakwing'ha hewela kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">lusita voniifunza mafundizo yako yagoloke.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Nizazindilila malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">sekeunileke mbee.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzindilila malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Vino mbwanga kodahaze kuulola ugenzi wake kuwa unoga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Kwa kuzindilila na kutegeleza mbuli yako weye Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Nokuzahila kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">sekeunileke niinege na ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Muumoyo wangu niika mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">muladi sekenikuhasanye.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Utogoligwe weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Kwa milomo yangu nisimulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">viya viuhumiza.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Nodeng'helela kutegeleza ukalangama wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">fana munhu yodeng'helela kuwa na vinhu vingi.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Nizayagelegeza mafundizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">na kuzigesa ng'hani nzila zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Nizanogeligwa na malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">na sizazimiza mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudeng'helela malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Unitendele mbuli zinogile niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">muladi nidahe kukala na kwamha mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Uyagubule meso yangu muladi nidahe kulola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">mbuli za mawewedeka muna yamalagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Niye nyambenyambe muna iisi ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">sekeunifise ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Moyo wangu una hamu ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">nolonda kuyamanya mafundizo yako lusita lose.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Weye kowakalikila wanhu watatali waja waduwiligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">waja hawategeleza ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Nisegezele kwehuligwa na maligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwaviya notegeleza ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Watawala wokala hamwe na woilunga kunitendela mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">mbali niye msang'hani wako nizayagelegeza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Malagilizo yako ni deng'ho jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">yayo fana vinyandama wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutegeleza malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Nobimbilisigwa muna ditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">uulopole ugima wangu fana viulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Nikulongela mbuli zonitendile na kunidika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">nifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Nitaze kuvimanya fambulo da ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">na niye nizayagesa mauzauza yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Nilegela kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">unigume nguvu fana viunilongele.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Unisegezele nzila ya uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">kwa ubazi unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Nisagula nzila ya kwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">Niyazindilila goya malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Nitegeleza ukalangama wako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">sekeunileke nigumigwe chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Nokimbilila muna inzila ya ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwaviya kunitenda nivimanye.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kuvimanya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Mndewa Mulungu, unifunze kwamha malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">maabaho nizayeka goya mbaka kuuhelelo.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Unitende nivimanye, muladi nidahe kwamha malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">na kuyazindilila kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Unilongoze muna inzila ya ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwaviya umo nopata deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Ugaluse moyo wangu ulonde malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">kufosa kulonda vinhu vovipatika kwa nzila ihile.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Unyepule, sekenisondelele mbuli za chakachaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">unilaguse nzila yako, uning'he ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Unitendele fana viunilongele niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">muladi udahe kudumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Unisegezele maligo yonidumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwaviya ulamuzi wako unoga.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Nolonda kuzindilila ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">kwaviya weye kotenda voilondeka, ning'he ugima wa sambi.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyahuwila malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unileke niumanye ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">unikombole fana viunilaganile.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Baho nizamwidika munhu yoniliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwaviya noihuwila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Sekeusegeze mbuli ya ukweli muna umulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwaviya nohuwila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Nizagendelela kuzindilila malagilizo yako yose, sambi na siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Nizagenda kuno niilegeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwaviya nizahila ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Nizawagong'ondela wafalume ukalangama wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">na sizawona chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Noyadeng'helela malagilizo yako yoniyalonda.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Nozimelela mate ndagilizi zako kwaviya nozilonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">Niye noyagelegeza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Ukumbuke chilagano chounilaganile niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kwaviya kunitenda nilolele.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Vinikalile muna yamagayo nigumigwa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">kwaviya chilagano chako chining'ha ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Weli na magoda wogendelela kuniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">mbali niye silekile kuzindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Vinikumbuka malagilizo yako ya umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">nigangamizigwa na weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Ningiligwa na ludoko ng'hani kwa ichimu cha wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">waja wolema kuzindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Noyemba malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">hohose honikala muna iisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, lusita lwa ichilo nodikumbuka zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">kwaviya nozindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Nitemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">kwaviya niyazindilila mafundizo yako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyahishimu malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo uhazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">nokwika chilagano cha kuzitegeleza mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Nikuzahila kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">uniwonele ubazi fana vounilongele.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Nougesa ugenzi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">na nilamula kuutegeleza ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Sikalame kuzindilila malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">nolopola kuyategeleza.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahanitataliza nzabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">sizazimiza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Nolamka ichilo chikulu kukutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">kwa ichimu cha ulamuzi wako ugoloke.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Niye mbwiya wa waja wose wokusang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">waja wokwamha ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Isi imema ulondo wako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Mulungu yela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kunitendela mbuli zinogile niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">fana viulongile weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Nifundize umanyi na kuhumiza vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">kwaviya nozihuwila ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Viukalile hunanitagusa nikala nohasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">mbali sambi notegeleza mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Weye kunoga na kotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Weli na magoda wonilongeleza mbuli za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">mbali niye nozindilila malagilizo yako kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Wanhu wano hawayagesa malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">mbali niye noyadeng'helela.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Ikala vinoga niye kugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">muladi nidahe kuifunza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Malagilizo youyalavile yanoga kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">yanoga kufosa maalufu ya vihande va hela na zahabu.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Makono yako yanilumba na kunigangamiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">ning'he umanyi nidahe kuifunza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Waja wokuhuwila wadeng'helele viwoniwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">kwaviya mbuli zako nozihuwila.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Novimanya kuwa weye Mndewa Mulungu kohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">na kunitagusa kwaviya weye ni mwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Ulondo wako woniguma moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">fana viunilaganile niye msang'hani wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Uniwonele ubazi muladi nidahe kuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwaviya noyadeng'helela malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Weli na magoda wagumigwe chinyala kwaviya wanilongeleza uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">mbali niye nizazigesa ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Niihanganye na waja wose wokuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">waja woyamanya malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Moyo wangu sekeuwe na ubananzi muna ukuzindilila malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">muladi sekenipate chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula lusita lwa kubamanyigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Nilegela kwa kukugozela unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">nokwika uhuwilo wangu muna imbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Meso yangu yokukila kwa kugozela chilagano chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">nouza, “Kwizakwiza zuwaki kuniguma moyo?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Niye sifaya chinhu fana mkoba wa mbende wili na masizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">mbali sinazimiza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Vino niye msang'hani wako nolondeka nigozele mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Vino kwizawahumiza wehi wangu zuwaki?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Weli na magoda wanihimbila lwingilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">wanhu waja hawasondelela malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Malagilizo yako yose ni ya kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">unitaze kwaviya wanhu wonilongeleza vihile.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Wakala habehi kuninanga muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">mbali silekile kutegeleza ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Wike goya ugima wangu kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">niye nizategeleza ukalangama wako woulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Mulungu yolondeka yahuwiligwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, mbuli yako yokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">yokwima chigangamavu kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Uwaminika wako wogendelela nyelesi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">kuilumba isi yose, nayo igangamala.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Vinhu vose vabaho mbaka diyelo kwa ichimu cha malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwaviya vinhu vose vokusang'hanila.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />One sideng'helele malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">nahafile na magayo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Sizazimiza ng'o ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwa ndagilizi izo kuwika goya ugima wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Unilopole niye munhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwaviya nizihishimu ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wonisepa muladi wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">mbali niye nougesa ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Nivimanya chila chinhu chokuwa na uhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">mbali malagilizo yako yabule uhelelo.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyalonda malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Malagilizo yako noyalonda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">noyagelegeza imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Ndagilizi zako zoning'ha ubala kufosa wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">kwaviya nozigesa lusita lwose.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Nina nzewele kufosa wafundiza wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwaviya nougesa ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Nivimanya ng'hani kufosa walala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwaviya nozindilila ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Niikimilila migulu yangu sekeihite kuna inzila ihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">muladi nitegeleze mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Siyalekile mafundizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwaviya kunifundiza weye mwenyewo.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Lola mbuli zako zamulile ng'hani kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">zamulile kufosa uki muna umulomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Ndagilizi zako zoning'ha umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">na zonitenda niwihile uvwizi wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Mulungu yalinga fana bung'hulo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Mbuli yako ni chitasa cha magulu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">na bung'hulo da nzila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Niilaha na kuchifikiza chilaho changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">nizazindilila ndagilizi zako zigoloke.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, niye nigazigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">uwike goya ugima wangu, fana viulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uhokele nhosa yangu ya kulonda mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">na unifunze malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Ugima wangu wozahiligwa ulavigwe lusita lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">mbali sizazimiza mbee malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wanhegela mtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">mbali silekile kuzindilila ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Malagilizo yako ni uhazi wangu wa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">yayo ni deng'ho da moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Niilunga kuzindilila malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">mbaka siku yondanidanganike.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukala goya muna yamalagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Nowehila wanhu wadelenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">mbali noyalonda malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Weye konigombela na konikaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">nika uhuwilo wangu muna imbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Mweye mutenda mbuli zihile, segeleni kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">muladi nidahe kuzindilila ndagilizi za Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Nike goya kwa ichimu cha chilagano chako na niye nizakuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">sekeudileke lolelo jangu jage.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Uning'he vinhu vose vonilonda na niye nizalopoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">nizayakaliza malagilizo yako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Kuwalema wanhu wose hawazindilila malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">kwaviya uvwizi wawo haufaya.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zihile kowasa fana viya unyolodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">ivo noulonda ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Lukuli lwangu logudemeka kukudumba weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">na noudumba vouhumiza.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyamha malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Nitenda mbuli zinogile na voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">sekeunileke kwa wanhu wonigaza.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Unilaganile kunitaza niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">sekeutogole watatali wanilumize.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Meso yangu yana luziza kwa kugozela ukombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">na kulolela mbuli igoloke younilongele kwizaitenda.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Unitendele niye msang'hani wako fana viya viuli ulondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Unitendeze niye msang'hani wako nivimanye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">muladi nidahe kuyamanya mafundizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Lusita lufika lwa Mndewa Mulungu kutenda usang'hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwaviya wanhu hawazindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Kweli nozilonda ndagilizi zako kufosa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">ona, kufosa zahabu yelile ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Nokwamha ndagilizi zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">mbali noihila chila nzila ihile.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamu ya kuzindilila malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Malagilizo yako ni ya mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">ivo noyazindilila.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Mbuli zako zogala bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">na hata wabozi wodaha kuvimanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Nohaha fana mnyama yeli na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">kwaviya noyamelela mate malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Unihindukile na uniwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">fana viutendaga kwa waja wodilonda zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Unilangulize muna uugenzi wangu fana viunilongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">sekeutogole niye nitawaligwe na wihi.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Nilopole na wanhu wonigaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">muladi nizindilile ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Unilolese na ulondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">na unifundize malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Meso yangu yokilima masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwaviya wanhu hawazindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Mulungu yanoga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, weye niiyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">na kohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Kulava ukalangama wako voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">na kwa uwaminika ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Kwaviya nokulonda, nopata ludoko ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">wehi wangu viwozehula mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Chilagano chako chofaya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">niye msang'hani wako nochilonda.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Niye mdodo, iviya nokwehuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">mbali sizimiza ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Unovu wako wokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">na malagilizo yako ni kweli.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Nipata magayo na uzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">mbali ndagilizi zako ni deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Ukalangama wako unoga siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">unitende nivimanye muladi niwe mgima.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kukala goya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Nokupula kwa moyo wangu wose, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">unidike na niye nizayazindilila malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Nokulamba unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">na niye nizauzindilila ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Nolamka chilochilo kukupula unitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">nohuwila mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Nokala meso ichilo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">muladi kuzigelegeza mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uhulike dizi jangu kwaviya konilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">ukombole ugima wangu kwaviya kohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Waja woilungila mbuli zihile wahabehi kunifikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">na wokala kutali na malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">na ndagilizi zako zose zokwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Kwandusila umwaka niifunza kulawa muna yamalagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">niifunza kuwa kuyeka muladi yasigale siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Ulole magayo yangu na unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwaviya sinazimiza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Unigombele na kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">uwike goya ugima wangu fana viulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezalopoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwaviya hawayagesa malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ubazi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">uwike goya ugima wangu kwa kusondelela malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Wehi wonigaza ni wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">mbali niye siuleka ukalangama wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Nowalola waja hawahuwila na nowawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwaviya hawazindilila mbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Lola viya vonizilonda ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwike goya ugima wangu kwa ulondo wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Mbuli zako zose ni kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">na kohumiza voilondeka siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda viyolonda malagilizo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Wafalume wanigaza bila chimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">mbali moyo wangu wogudemeka kwa ichimu cha mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Nodeng'helela chilagano chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">fana munhu yotola vinhu va beyi ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Nowihila ng'hani uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">mbali noyalonda malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Nokutogoza miyanza saba chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwaviya kohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Wana tindiwalo ng'hani waja woyalonda malagilizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">na habule chinhu cha kuwatenda waikwale.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nogozela unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">na notenda malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Nozindilila mafundizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">na noyalonda ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Nozindilila malagilizo yako na ndagilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">kwaviya mbuli zangu zose zomanyika kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Masozi yangu yakufikile weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">unitende nivimanye fana viulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Tegeleza mbuli zangu zonipula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">unikombole kwa kusondelela chilagano chako.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Dizi jangu dikutogoze lusita lwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwaviya konifundiza malagilizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Lulimi lwangu lwokwimba mbuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwaviya ndagilizi zako zose zigoloka.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Mkono wako uisasale kunitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwaviya nisagula ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu nolonda unilopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">na ndagilizi zako ni deng'ho jangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Unitende niwe mgima muladi nikutogoze weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">na mafundizo yako yanitaze.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Niwegela fana ng'hondolo yagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">nizahile niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwaviya sizimize ndagilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukomboligwa kwa ichimu cha wavwizi</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwelela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Nomulilila Mndewa Mulungu muna yamagayo yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">nayo konidika.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unikombole na wavwizi na wanhu wadelenya.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Mweye wavwizi, Mulungu kezawatendela choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Iviya mweye wadelenya, Mulungu kezawaliha choni?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Kezawatagusa na misale ikutwa ya galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">hamwe na makala ya moto.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Nogaya kwaviya nokala Mesheki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">nokala hagati ya mahema ya Kedali.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Nilegela kukala hamwe na wanhu wokwihila tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Niye munhu wa tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">mbali vinilonga tindiwalo, wanhu wawo wolonda ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu mkalizi wetu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Nokwinula meso yangu niilole milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">yelihi yondayanitaze?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yonitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">Mndewa Mulungu yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Hezakuleka ugwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">mkalizi wako hakukila.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Mkalizi wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">yeye hakukila na hagona.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo ndolezi wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">Kokukaliza fana mbiki viukikiza vinhu vili hana disisila jake.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Zuwa hadizakulumiza imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">hebu mwezi lusita lwa ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kezakulolesa kwa mbuli zihile zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">kezaulolesa ugima wako.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kezakulolesa vondaulawe kunze na vondawingile mgati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kwandusila sambi na siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa za Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Nideng'helela viwanilongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Chihite kuna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Migulu yetu ima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">mgati ya nyivi zako, weye Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Bululu da Yelusalemu dizengigwa vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">muladi wanhu waiting'hane umo.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Uko niuko wokwela wanhu wa makabila ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">makabila ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">kumwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu fana viyawalagilize Waisilaili.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Kwaviya uko vikigwa vigoda va chifalume va kuhumizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">vigoda va chifalume va kaye ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Puleni kwa ichimu cha tindiwalo da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">longeni, “Wanhu wose wokulonda wakale goya.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Tindiwalo dikale mgati ya ng'huta zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">na wanhu wakale goya mgati ya mhongono zako.<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Kwa ichimu cha ndugu zangu na mbwiya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">nizalonga, ‘Tindiwalo dikale mgati yako, weye Yelusalemu.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Kwa ichimu cha kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">nizadipulila bululu da Yelusalemu ditemeligwe mate.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kuwoneligwa ubazi</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, noyenula meso yangu uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">nokulola weye ukala uko kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Fana viya watumwa viwomulolela mwenevale wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">fana viya msang'hani wa chike viyomuhuwila mkulu wa kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">niivo cheye vochimuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu mbaka vondayachiwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Mndewa Mulungu, chiwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kwaviya chifunyila umoyo kwehuligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Chifunyila umoyo kwehuligwa na wanhu weli na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">chizehigwa ng'hani na wanhu woiwona kuwa wotenda goya.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />One Mndewa Mulungu hawile ubanzi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Waisilaili walonge,<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />one Mndewa Mulungu hawile ubanzi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">wanhu viwakalile wochitowa,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />lusita viwachiwonele ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">baho wehi wahadahile kuchimela ching'hali wagima.<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />Wahachitowile ng'hani fana gombo vidigubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">fana mazi mengi yokuluma,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />wahachitowile fana mazi yokuluma ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">kwaviya hawalekile wehi wetu wachinange fana wanyama wa mmbago viwowaja wayawo.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Chipulusuka fana viya udege kulawa muna umtego wa munhu yokongola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">Mtego ufatuka na cheye chipulusuka.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yochitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Mulungu viwokala goya</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Waja womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu walinga fana mulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">uli haudaha bule kutingisika na wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Fana viya Yelusalemu viizungulukigwe na milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">niivo Mndewa Mulungu viyowazunguluka wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">kwandusila sambi na siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezaitawala isi ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">muladi wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile sekewatende mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uwatemele mate wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">waja wotenda kwa moyo umwe.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Mbali wanhu wose wosondelela nzila zawo zagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Mndewa Mulungu kezawawinga hamwe na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Wanhu wa Isilaili wakale kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kudeng'helela kukomboligwa</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Mndewa Mulungu viyachibweleze Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">chikala fana wanhu walotile nzozi.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Milomo yetu imema seko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">ndimi zetu zimema nyila za deng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Maabaho wanhu wa zisi zimwenga walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Mndewa Mulungu kawatendela mbuli ng'hulu.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kachitendela mbuli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">na cheye chideng'helela ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Mndewa Mulungu chibwelezele wanhu wetu wagaligwe isi imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">fana mvula viibweleza mazi na kukilima muna iisi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Wanhu wohanda kwa masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">wezagobola kwa nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Munhu yosola mbeyu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">kuhita kuhanda kuno kolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">kezabwela ukaye yake kwa nyila za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">kuno kaitwika mavuno yake.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s">Chiyosang'hana munhu hachifaya chinhu bila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Sulemani wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />One Mndewa Mulungu haizengile kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">woizenga wogaya bule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">One Mndewa Mulungu hadikaliza bululu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">wanhu wodikaliza wogonelela bule.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Muigaza bule kuidawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na kukalama kugona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">na kusumila ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">kwaviya Mulungu koweng'ha ndiya yake wanhu woyowalonda.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Wana ni nhunza kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">wana ni gweko kulawa kumwake.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Fana viya misale muna imikono ya galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">niivo wana viwokwelekigwa na munhu yang'hali mbwanga.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Kamweda munhu ija podo jake dimemezigwa ng'hani misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">wanage vondawamgombele, hezagumigwa chinyala na wehi wake.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s">Gweko da wanhu womdumba Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Wamweda wanhu womdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">waja wozindilila malagilizo yake.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Wezakuja ndiya zilawa muna imigunda yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">wezatemeligwa mate na kukala goya.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Wake zawo wezawelekela wana wengi fana mzabibu ukwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">muna zikaye zawo, wana wezakuwa fana misukila ya mizaituni.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Ivo niivo vondawatemeligwe mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">wanhu waja womdumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Mndewa Mulungu yakutemele mate kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">siku zose za ugima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">muladi ulole Yelusalemu viinogeza.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />Uwe mgima mbaka uwawone wazukulu zako.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Wanhu wa Isilaili wakale kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s">Kupula muladi wehi wa Isilaili wahumigwe</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Wanidununza kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Waisilaili walonge,<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />“Wanidununza ng'hani kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">mbali wang'hali hawananihuma.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Wehi wangu wanilanha ng'hani muna umgongo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">mbaka watenda milulumu mitali fana mifulunda ya kumgunda.”<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kotenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">kazidumula nzabi zowanitatalize wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Waja wose woihila isi ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">wabwelezigwe kuchisogo kwa chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Wawe fana mayani yokota kuna ichisuwili chizengigwe na msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">maabaho zuwa doyanyaza yang'hali hayanakula.<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />Ivo wawa fana mavuno yelibule ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">na wanhu wolima wabwela bule.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Habule munhu yofosa habehi yondayawalongele wehi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Mndewa Mulungu yamtemeleni mate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Nomtemelani mate kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Nokulamba weye Mndewa Mulungu voniwa muna yamagayo mengi.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Mndewa uhulike dizi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">magutwi yako nayategeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">uniwonele ubazi vonikupula.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu one uupetile uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">yelihi yahadahile kwima haulongozi wako?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Mbali weye kochilekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">muladi chikutambikile.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Nomgozela Mndewa Mulungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">nohuwila ng'hani mbuli yake iyolonga.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Moyo wangu womgozela Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">kufosa wakalizi viwogozela mhwani yau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">ona, kufosa wakalizi viwogozela mhwani yau.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Weye Isilaili umuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kokulonda kwa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">na kana nguvu ng'hulu ya kukukombola.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Yeye mwenyewo kezawakombola Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">kulawa muna uhasanyi wawo wose.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s">Kumuhuwila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nabule moyo wa magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">na siiwona kuwa nofaya ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Sigeza kutenda mbuli ng'hulu kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">hebu mbuli za kunyazanya.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Mbali niye ninyamala na nina tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">Fana mwana yahagatigwe hachaha na mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">niivo viili muumoyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Weye Isilaili, umuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">kwandusila sambi na siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa ya kaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu umkumbuke Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">kumbuka magayo yake yose yoyapatile.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Kailaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">keka chilagano kwa Mulungu wa Yakobo Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />“Sizakwingila muna ikaye yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">na sizagona muna dikomwa jangu,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />na sizalekelela nhongo muna yameso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">na sizakukila muna zingohe zangu,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />mbaka vondanimpatile hanhu Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">hanhu ha kukala ha Mulungu wa Yakobo Yeli na Udahi.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Chiihulika mbuli ya sanduku da lagano uko Efulasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">chidiwona muna imigunda ya Yaala.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Chilonga, “Chiteni hanhu hake ha kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">chitambike kuna ichigoda chake cha chifalume.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Inuka weye Mndewa Mulungu, wize hanhu ha kuhumulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">weye na sanduku da lagano dodilagusa nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Wakulu wa nhambiko wako wayawalizigwe haki fana walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">wanhu wako wokwaminika wembe nyila za deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Kwa ichimu cha Daudi msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">sekeumuleme mfalume iyo youmsagule.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulahila Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">na chilaho icho hezachigalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Nizamwika imwe wa welesi wako muna ichigoda chako cha chifalume.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />One wanago wahamha lagano jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">na malagilizo yoniwafundiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">wezahazi chigoda chako cha chifalume siku zose.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kaisagula Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">kahalonda muladi hawe hanhu hake ha kukala.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />Kalonga, “Hano ni hanhu hangu ha kuhumulila siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">baho nizakala kwaviya nihamelela mate.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Nizaditemela mate ng'hani bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">nizawegutiza ngayengaye wokala umo.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Nizawalopola wakulu wa nhambiko wa bululu ijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">na wanhu wake wokwaminika wezakwimba na kutowa ng'henze kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Baho nizamtenda imwe wa welesi wa Daudi kuwa mfalume mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">mfalume yonimsagule kezamwemwesa fana chitasa chikwaka.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Nizawayawaliza chinyala wehi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">mbali yeye nizamvaza kombelo da ufalume dimelemeta.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s">Kuilumba kunoga</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Ni mbuli inogile ng'hani na ya kudeng'heleza ndugu kukala hamwe na kuilumba.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Kutenda ivo kulinga fana mavuta yonung'hila goya yogidigwa muna iditwi da Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">kulagusa kuwa Mulungu kamsagula yawe mkulu wa nhambiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">Mavuta yayo mengi yakilima hasi hana ichidevu chake mbaka hana yamawalo yake.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Iviya kulinga fana nhungwe yogwa kuna umulima Helimoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Mndewa Mulungu kezautemela mate ng'hani mulima Helimoni siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogoza Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa kukwela mulima wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu, mweye wasang'hani wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">mweye wose womutambika muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu ichilo.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Inuleni makono yenu hanhu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">mumtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Mndewa Mulungu yalumbile ulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">yamtemeleni mate kulawa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa kwa ukulu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">ditogozeni zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">mtogozeni, mweye wasang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />mweye womusang'hana muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">muna uluhelengo lwa Kaye ya Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya yeye kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">imbeni nhogolwa ya zina jake kwaviya donogeza.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamsagula Yakobo kwa lungilo jake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">na kawasagula Waisilaili kuwa wanhu wake.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Novimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">na Mndewa wetu ni mkulu kufosa milungu yose ya uvwizi.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kotenda chochose choyolonda kuulanga na mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">muna ibahali na muna yamazi mengi ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Kotenda mawingu yagubike isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">kogala lumwemwe na mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">na kogala beho kulawa muna yamadungu yake.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Kawakoma waudele wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">waudele wa wanhu na wanyama.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Katenda mauzauza na mawewedeko muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">muladi kuwatagusa mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake wose.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Kazihuma zisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">na kawakoma wafalume weli na nguvu.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Kawakoma mfalume Sihoni wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na Ogu mfalume wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na wafalume wose wa Kanaani.<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Kailava isi yawo kuwa uhazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">uhazi kwa wanhu wake Waisilaili.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Zina jako dokala siku zose weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">kwizakumbukigwa nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezawagombela wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">na kuwawonela ubazi wasang'hani wake.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Nyang'hiti za milungu za isi zilumbigwa kwa hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">zitendigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Zina milomo mbali hazidaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">zina meso mbali hazidaha kulola.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Zina magutwi mbali hazidaha kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">zina milomo mbali hazidaha kuhumula.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Waja wozilumba wailinga nazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">iviya waja wose wozihuwila wailinga nazo.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Mweye Waisilaili, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">mweye welesi wa Haluni, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Mweye welesi wa Lawi, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mweye womumuhuwila Mulungu, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">mtogozeni yokala uko Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kokwaminika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya yeye kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">kwaviya ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Mwing'heni hewela Mulungu yeli na udahi kufosa milungu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">kwaviya ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa yeli na udahi kufosa wandewa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">kwaviya ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Yeye yaidumwe yoyotenda mauzauza makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Yeye katenda ulanga kwa umanyi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Kalumba isi mchanyha ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Kalumba zuwa na mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Zuwa ditawale imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Mwezi na nhondo vitawale ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Kawakoma waudele wa Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Kawalongoza Waisilaili walawe Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Kawalava kwa mkono wake ugoloke uli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Yeye kaigola bahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Kawalosa Waisilaili hagati ya bahali iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Kampigisa mfalume wa Misili na watowang'hondo wake muna ibahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Kawalongoza wanhu wake wafose muna ichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Kawakoma wafalume wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Nayo kawakoma wafalume weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Kamkoma mfalume Sihoni wa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Kamkoma mfalume Ogu wa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Kaweng'ha wanhu wake uhazi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />Kaweng'ha zisi izo Waisilaili wasang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Kachikumbuka lusita vichihumigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Kachilopola na wehi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Komwing'ha ndiya chila chilumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Mwing'heni hewela Mulungu wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">ulondo wake wokala siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s">Kulila kuna iisi ya ugeni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Chikala hasi mumgwazo wa nyanda za Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">chilila vichiikumbuke Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Kuna imibiki ya uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">chitumbika mabango yetu.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Kwaviya uko wawo wowachisolile walonda chiwembile nyila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">wehi wetu walonda nyila za deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">walonga, “Chimbileni wila umwe muna zinyila za Sayuni!”<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Chodahaze kwimba wila wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">muna iisi ya ugeni?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Weye Yelusalemu, one nahakuzimiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">mkono wangu wa kulume uzimize kutowa bango.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />One sikukumbuke weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">na one sikugesile weye Yelusalemu kuwa deng'ho jangu kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">lulimi lwangu luyamhise na hanzagwa da mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">muladi sekenidahe kwimba.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kumbuka chiya chowatendile Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">siku ija Yelusalemu viigwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">viwalongile, “Bomoleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">bomoleni chandusilo chake.”<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Wanhu wa Babeli mwizanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">kamweda munhu yondayamulihilizeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">kwa chiya chomuchitendele.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Kamweda munhu yondayavigwile ving'hele venu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">na kuvihonda muna uluwe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za hewela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 138:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">Nizakutogoza weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">nizakwimba wila wa nhogolwa kuno milungu imwenga yotegeleza.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Nizakutumbalila mavindi kuikwenhukila kaye yako yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">na nizaditogoza zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwa ichimu cha ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo na uwaminika wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">na kwaviya weye kotogoligwa kufosa vinhu vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">zina jako na mbuli yako votogoligwa kufosa vinhu vose.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Vinikupulile, weye kunidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">kunitenda galu na kunigangamiza.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Wafalume wa zisi zose vondawahulike mbuli zoulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">wakutogoze weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Wezakwimba nhogolwa za sang'hano zako, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwaviya weye mkulu ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kauchanyha kowalola goya ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">mbali kavimanya chowotenda wanhu weli na magoda ingawa wakutali nayo.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Nihafosa muna uuzidilwa, weye konikaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kogolosa mkono wako wa kulume kunikombola na wehi wangu wonihila.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kezafikiza mbuli zoyanilungile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ulondo wako wokala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Sekeuzileke sang'hano za makono yako.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kovimanya vinhu vose</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kuupekula moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">kunimanya vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Nahakala hasi hebu nahenuka, weye kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">kuyamanya magesa yangu hata uhawa kutali.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Kovimanya vonigenda na vonigona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">komanya chila chinhu chonisang'hana.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Ing'hali mbuli hainafika muna ululimi lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">weye Mndewa Mulungu, kulongola kuimanya mbuli iyo.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Kunizinga kuchisogo na kuulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">kwika mkono wako uchanyha yangu kunikaliza.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Sidaha kuimanya mbuli iyo ya mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">kwaviya mbuli iyo ndala ng'hani kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Nihite kulihi niinege na muhe wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Nihite kulihi nichikimbile chihanga chako?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />One nihakwela kuulanga, weye kwauko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">one nihatenda kuzimu kuwa komwa jangu, weye kwauko.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />One niguluke mbaka ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">na kuhita kutali kuna zimhaka za bahali za ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />Uko iviya mkono wako wizanilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">mkono wako wa kulume wizanyamhisa.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Nodaha kulonga, “Kweli ziza dizanifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">na bung'hulo donizunguluka dihagaluka kuwa ichilo,”<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />mbali ziza hadizakuwa ziza kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">ichilo izakuwa fana imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">na ziza dizakuwa fana bung'hulo kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Kwaviya weye niiyo unilumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">kunitenda nikule muna iinda ya mami yangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Nokutogoza kwaviya nilumbigwa kwa mauzauza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">sang'hano zako za mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">nozimanya vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Vonilumbigwe kwa mvisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">vinitendigwe hana ihanhu hahawoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">mavuha yangu hayafisigwe kumwako.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Meso yako yaniwona ning'hali muna iinda ya mami yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">siku zangu zose zounikile zandikigwa muna ichitabu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">ning'hali sinawona zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Mulungu, magesa yako yazama ng'hani kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">magesa yako hayadaha kupeteka.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />One niyapetile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">yahawile mengi kufosa msanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Vinilamuka, nahamwe na weye.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Weye Mulungu, uwakome wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Mweye wakomaji, inegeni kumwangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Wokulonga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">wehi wako wodilonga vihile zina jako.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Nowehila wanhu wokwihila weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">nowehula ng'hani wanhu wokulema.<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Nowehila ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">na wawa wehi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Weye Mulungu, unipekule muladi uumanye moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">nigeze muladi umanye viniwa na lugano.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Ulole one kuna magesa yehile muna umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">unilongoze muna inzila yako.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kupula ukalizi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi kwa mulangulizi wa nyila</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unilopole kulawa kwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">unikalize kulawa kwa wanhu wasede.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Wogesa mbuli zihile muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">na wokong'hela ng'hondo chila siku.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Mbuli zawo zolumiza fana sungu ya zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">muna imilomo yawo molawa mbuli zikoma fana muyombo.<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unikalize kulawa muna yamakono ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">unikalize na wanhu wasede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">unikalize na waja wogesa kunyagiza.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Weli na magoda wanifisila mtego muladi nyenzeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">wakunzula nzabi za lwavu lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">watega mitego kuna inzila yangu.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Nomulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Weye ni Mulungu wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uhulike vonikupula uniwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu ni mkombola wangu mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">wounikaliza ditwi jangu lusita lwa ng'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu sekeuweng'he wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile chiya chowolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">sekeuleke wapate chowoilunga muladi sekewaigode.<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Sekeuwaleke wehi wangu wanihume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">magayo yogaligwa na milomo yawo yawabwelele.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Makala ya mabwe ya moto yawagwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">na wasigwe muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">wasigwe muna yamakombo muladi sekewadahe kuibanga.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Wavwizi sekewapate chowolonda muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">mbuli zihile ziwapelembe himahima wanhu wasede.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Novimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kowatenda ngayengaye wahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">na kowagombela wanhu wose wogaya.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Kweli wanhu wotenda voilondeka wezaditogoza zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">na wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakala haulongozi hako.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kukalizigwa na magezo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokutanga wize kumwangu himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">unihulike vonikupula.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Mbuli yonikupula uihokele fana ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">kwinula makono kwangu kuwe fana nhosa ya ichigulogulo.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, wike mkalizi muna umulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">muladi sekenilonge mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Unikimilile sekenitende mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">sekenizowele sang'hano zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">hamwe na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">hata sekenije ndiya zawo za madambwa.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile yanitaguse na izakuwa ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">yanikalikile na izakuwa fana mavuta muna iditwi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">ditwi jangu sekedileme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Mbali sileka kupula muladi sekenitende fana viwotenda wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Wasemi wawo vondawagwisigwe kuna imiluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">wanhu wezategeleza mbuli zangu kwaviya zinoga.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Wezalonga, “Fana munhu viyolima na kuhimbula isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">niivo mavuha yetu vondayapwililisigwe hana ihanhu ha kwingilila kuzimu.”<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Nokuhuwila weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">nokukimbilila weye sekeunileke nidanganike.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Unikimilile sekeningile muna umtego wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">kulawa kuna imitego ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wagwe muna zinyavu zawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">mbali niye nifose vinogile.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ziyopula munhu yalekigwe yaiyeka</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi lusita viyapulile muna dituka</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Nomulamba Mndewa Mulungu kwa dizi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">nomulandulila dizi jangu Mndewa Mulungu yaniwonele ubazi.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Nomgalila magayo yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">nomulongela uzidilwa wangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Voniwa habehi kubeneka moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">kwahabehi kunitaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">Muna inzila yangu yonifosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">wehi wanitegela mitego.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Ulole mkono wangu wa kulume na uwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">habule munhu yonigesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">nabule hanhu ha kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">habule munhu yonika goya.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Nokulamba weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">nolonga, “Weye niiyo kimbililo jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">silonda chinhu chimwenga chochose muna uugima wangu, mbali weye.”<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Uhulike vonikupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya nolonda kutazigwa ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">Unikombole kulawa kwa wanhu woniwinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya wawo wana nguvu kufosa niye.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Unilave muna ichifungo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">muladi nidahe kuditogoza zina jako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Baho wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">kwaviya kunitendela mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kulopoligwa</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko yangu igone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">vonikulamba utegeleze kwa uwaminika wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">unidike kwa unovu wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Sekeunihumize kwa kukalika niye msang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwaviya habule munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile haulongozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Wehi wangu wanisondelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">waugwisa ugima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">Wanika hanhu heli na ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">fana viya munhu yafile umwaka.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Nibeneka moyo ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">moyo wangu ufa nene.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Nokumbuka siku za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nozigesa sang'hano zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nozikumbuka ng'hani sang'hano zousang'hane kwa makono yako.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Nokugolosela makono yangu nokupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">moyo wangu wokuwonela hamu fana isi inyalile.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, unidike himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">moyo wangu haudahile bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">sekewiifise kutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">sekeniwe fana waja wohumuluka kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Nihulike ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaviya nikuhuwila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Unilongele nzila ija yondaniigendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaviya nokwinulila moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu unikombole na wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">nikukimbilila weye unifise.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Unifundize kutenda voulonda weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwaviya weye niiyo Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">muhe wako yanogile yanilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">muna inzila igoloke.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kohishimigwa, lelo unihonye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">kwa unovu wako unikombole kulawa muna yamagayo.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Kwa ulondo wako uwatende wehi wangu wafudale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">uwanange wanhu wose wonigaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwaviya niye msang'hani wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu galu wa ng'hondo</para>
  <para style="d">Zabuli ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Yatogozigwe Mndewa Mulungu yeli luwe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">yoyofundiza ng'hondo makono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">yoyofundiza vidole vangu kwiitowa.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Yeye niiyo Mulungu wangu wa ulondo na mhongono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">niiyo kimbililo jangu na mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">na ngao yangu yonikimbilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">Kowahuma wanhu wa zisi muladi niwatawale.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, munhu kofaya choni mbaka ummanye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Munhu kofaya choni mbaka umgese?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Munhu kalinga fana mhumuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">siku zake zilinga fana sisila dodifosa.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu uhumuluke kwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">uidalise milima muladi ilave yosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Utende lumwemwe luwapwililise wehi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">uwatowe misale wehi wako na uwagume chinyala.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Ugolose mkono wako kulawa kuchanyha unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">na kunisegeza muna yamazi yano mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">unilopole kulawa muna yamakono ya wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />Milomo yawo yolonga mbuli za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">na hawalonga ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Weye Mulungu wangu, nizakwimbila wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">nizakwimbila kwa chia cha nyila chili na singija longo.<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />Koweng'ha ukombola wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">komkombola Daudi msang'hani wako na panga dodikoma.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Unikombole na unilopole kulawa kwa wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">Milomo yawo yolonga mbuli za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">na hawalonga ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Maabaho wanetu wa chilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wakule vinogile fana mbiki ukangale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wandele wetu wawe fana mhanda za mgomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">zozisongoligwe kuhambila hoyokala mfalume.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Madungu yetu yameme ndiya mbasakanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">ng'hondolo wetu weleke maalufu muna imigunda yetu,<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />na ng'ombe wetu wapape mbahasha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">Sekekuwe na ng'hondo muna zimhongono zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">hebu wehi wetu sekewawanyang'hule wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">na sekekuwe na chililo muna zinzila zetu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Wamweda ng'hani wanhu wowatemeligwe mate fana ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">wamweda wanhu waja Mndewa Mulungu ni Mulungu wawo.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu mfalume</para>
  <para style="d">Wila wa Daudi wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Weye Mulungu wangu uli mfalume wangu, nizakutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">nizaditogoza zina jako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Nizakutogola chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">nizaditogoza zina jako siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Mndewa Mulungu ni mkulu yoyolondeka kutogozigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">ukulu wake haumanyika.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Nyelesi zose wezatogola sang'hano zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">wanhu wezagong'onda sang'hano zako ng'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Wezailonga hishima yako na ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">na niye nizazigesa sang'hano zako za mwazanyo.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Wezasimulila nguvu za sang'hano zako za mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">na niye nizagong'onda ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Wezatenda chelekocheleko kwa ichimu cha ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">na wezawimba unovu wako kwa deng'ho.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kana unovu na ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">hahuhile kuwona ludoko, mbali kamema ulondo wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kanoga kwa wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">koviwonela ubazi vinhu vose viyavitendile.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu vose voulumbile vizakutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">wanhu wako wokwaminika wezakwing'ha hewela.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Wezausimulila unovu wa ufalume wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">na kulonga nguvu zako.<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />Muladi wanhu wose wazimanye sang'hano zako ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">waumanye unovu na ukulu wa ufalume wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Ufalume wako ni ufalume wa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Mndewa Mulungu kokwaminika muna zinyelesi zose.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Mndewa Mulungu kotenda chila mbuli iyolonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Kokwaminika muna zisang'hano zake zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kowataza wose wogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">na kuwenula wanhu wose weli na mnamilo.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Vilumbe vose wokugozela uwataze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">na weye koweng'ha ndiya yawo lusita lufaya.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Koweng'ha kwa makono maidi vilumbe wose na kowegutiza.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kotenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">na kokwaminika muna zisang'hano zake zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kahaguhi na wose wowomtanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">wose wowomtanga kwa ukweli.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Koweng'ha wanhu womulonda vinhu vose viwolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">kohulika viwompula yawataze na kowakombola.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kowamila wanhu wose wowomulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">mbali kezawananga wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">Wanhu wose weli wagima waditogoze zina jake jelile siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s">Nhogolwa kwa Mulungu mkombola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Weye moyo wangu, umtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu siku zose za ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">nizamwimbila nhogolwa Mndewa Mulungu ning'hali mgima.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Sekeuwahuwile wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">sekeuwahuwile wanhu kwaviya hawadaha kukukombola.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Vondawadanganike, wezabwela muna uulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">siku iyo magesa yawo yose yezakuwa yaga.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Watemeligwa mate wanhu wotazigwa na Mulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">waja womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo.<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Yalumbile ulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">bahali na vinhu vose vili umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">kokwaminika siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Kowahumiza vinogile wanhu wowoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">koweng'ha ndiya weli na nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Mndewa Mulungu kowaleka wafungwa wailegehe.<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kowagubula yameso vipofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mndewa Mulungu kowenula uchanyha wanhu wose wanyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Mndewa Mulungu kowalonda wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kowamila wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">kowataza wagane na wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">mbali nzila ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile yonangigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kezatawala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Weye Sayuni, Mulungu wako kezatawala nyelesi zose.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s">Kumtogoza Mulungu kwa sang'hano ziyotenda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Kwaviya vinoga kumtogoza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">kumwimbila Mulungu wetu wila wa nhogolwa woulondeka ni chinhu chinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yadizengile bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">kowabweleza Waisilaili wose weli kuuhami.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Kowahonya waja wabeneke imizoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">na kowaguma moyo wanhu wolumwa.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Kozipeta nhondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">na kozitanga chila imwe kwa zina jake.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Mndewa wetu ni mkulu na mwene udahi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">umanyi wake wabule uhelelo.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kowenula woinyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">mbali kowagwisa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu kwa nyila za hewela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mtoweleni bango Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Kougubika ulanga kwa mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">isi yotonyiligwa na mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">na kokoteza savu kuna ivilima.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Koweng'ha wanyama ndiya zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">na kowalisa makinda ya howe vowolila.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Kunogelwa kwake hakwili muna inguvu ya chihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">iviya hanogeligwa na nguvu za watowang'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Mndewa Mulungu konogelwa na waja womdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">konogelwa na waja wohuwila ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu, mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni, mtogozeni Mulungu wenu.<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Kwaviya kogangamiza mhalalingwe za nyivi zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">na kuwatemela mate wanhu wenu.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Niiyo yogala tindiwalo muna zimhaka za isi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">na kuwegutiza wanhu kwa ndiya inogile.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Kolava lagilizo jake muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">mbuli yake yofika uko himahima.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Kotandika seluji fana mgolole wa pamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">na kohumulusa nhungwe fana maivu.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Mulungu kogala mvula ya mabwe fana msele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">vino yelihi yodaha kwima hanhu hozizima?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Kotuma mbuli yake na kuvilumbula vinhu viya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">koditenda beho jake dibume na mazi yakilime.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Kamgubulila Yakobo mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">kamgubulila Isilaili malagilizo yake na kuhumiza kwake.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Haitendele ivo isi imwenga yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">na malagilizo yake hawayamanyile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s">Vilumbe vose vimtogoze Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kulawa uchanyha ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye wasenga wake wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mtogozeni yeye, mweye wakalizi wose wa kuulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye zuwa na mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">mtogozeni yeye, mweye nhondo zose zozibung'hula.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye ulanga uli uchanyha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">mtogozeni yeye, mweye mazi yeli uchanyha ya ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Leka vinhu ivo vose viditogoze zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwaviya kalonga, navo vilumbigwa.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Kavika hanhu hake siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">kalava lagilizo hadizagaluka siku zose.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Mtogozeni Mndewa Mulungu kulawa muna izisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">mtogozeni yeye, mweye vilumbe vikulu va mwiibahali.<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye moto na mvula ya mabwe na seluji na kungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">na beho kulu dodilawilila kwa mbuli yake.<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye milima na vidundulima vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">na mibiki ya matunda na mibiki yose ya mielezi.<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye wanyama wa kumbago na wanyama wofugigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">na wang'onyo wotambala na ndege woguluka.<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye wafalume wa isi na wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">na mweye wakulu na watawala wose wa isi.<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />Mtogozeni yeye, mweye wabwanga na wandele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">na walala na wana.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Wanhu wose waditogoze zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwaviya zina jake ditogoligwe ng'hani kufosa mazina yamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">ukulu wake wofosa isi na ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Kaweng'ha nguvu wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">muladi wanhu wake wose wamtogoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">na Waisilaili woyowalonda wamtogoze.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa uhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu wila wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mtogozeni muna umting'hano wa wanhu wokwaminika.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Waisilaili wamdeng'helele yoyawaumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">mweye wanhu wa Sayuni mtendeleni chelekocheleko mfalume wenu.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Waditogoze zina jake kwa kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">na wamtowele ngoma na bango.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu konogelwa na wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">kowavaza wanyendanyenda kombelo da ukombola.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Waminika wadeng'helele hishima iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">na wembe kwa deng'ho ichilo chose.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Wamtogoze Mulungu kwa milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">kuno wamha panga dikutwa muna yamakono yawo,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />muladi kuwalihiliza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">na kuwatagusa wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />Wawatatalize minyololo wafalume wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">na wawafunge wakulu wawo mhingu za zuma.<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />Wawahumize wanhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalagilize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">uno niuwo uhumi wa wanhu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s">Mtogozeni Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mtogozeni hana ihanhu hake helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">mtogozeni kuulanga kokulagusa udahi wake.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Mtogozeni kwa sang'hano zake ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mtogozeni kwaviya viyeli na ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Mtogozeni kwa mhalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mtogozeni kwa ngoma na bango.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Mtogozeni kwa vivugo na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mtogozeni kwa bango na chilongelonge.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Mtogozeni kwa kutowa vimbeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">mtogozeni kwa vimbeta vihulikika ng'hani.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Chila chilumbe chili na mhumuzi chimtogoze Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>